C5645856630F16470000CFB5E0E40886,"Everyone in Canto Bight will be focused on the Canto Cup race, which is the perfect time for a job. Kay knows that the Sixth Kin keep identicards in their safe at Club Tarsus. She will need one to finally hitch a ride off-world."
C5645856630F1DB20001E2BD906D3CFF,"Kay has gotten a last job from Bram to join a group of mercenaries in a break-in of Westhill Palace. The palace belongs to Zerek Besh crime lord Sliro Ruback, and his vault is filled with immense wealth."
