7EE6463463C6B26D00009CCC87F9AF41,"<b>FOCUS FIELD</b>: Activate to prevent overheat on blasters in area.
<b>SET CHARGE</b>: Allows Set Charge / Sabotage interactions.

<b>RK-3 BLASTER PISTOL</b>: Low damage, but high rate of fire.
<b>SONIC IMPLODER</b>: Deals damage in an area.
<b>BLASTER SUPERCHARGE</b>: Allows Perfect Cooling."
7EE6463463C6BB5600009DFC4E17B56A,"<b>STUN FIELD</b>: Activate to stun enemies in an area around you.
<b>SLICE</b>: Allows Slice interactions.

<b>A280-CFE BLASTER PISTOL</b>: Heavy single shot damage.
<b>BLAST CHARGE</b>: Remotely detonated explosives.
<b>EXTRA POCKETS</b>: Additional gadget charge.
<b>DEAD MAN'S SWITCH</b>: When downed, stun last enemy to hit you."
