7110821464539886009806D79754D78D,Message for M
7110821464539886009806D8E1FC122E,"Had to leave in a hurry. They were coming. Don't worry, everything is locked up tight. Bring them to our spot when you get them. If you get them. 

L."
711082146453AE2700020707EF43A9C7,Urgent
711082146453AE27000207084381092A,"The shipjackers came out of nowhere. It was like they were waiting for me!

I grabbed the cargo and did a run for it. Say goodbye to the ship, it's probably been stripped and sold for scrap by now.

The goods are waiting for you beneath the 'flying mound'. You know where it is."
