711082146454EAB500218A3A350D7F00,Stolen Imperial Goods
711082146454EAB500218A3B633FB5F1,Smugglers stole back their stash from an Imperial compound.
711082146454EC2700218A4AA2D47BF6,Getaway Stash
711082146454EC2700218A4B308940C3,A civilian is preparing to leave Tatooine and has a getaway bag hidden on Toshara.
711082146454F198003023ED77263611,"Completed, but..."
711082146454F198003023EE77564D7D,"You never said that the target was an Imperial convoy.

We stashed half the score in the mountains south of the compound. We've kept the rest to ourselves. Additional payment for our troubles. 

We'll be off Toshara before you read this so don't bother looking."
711082146454F47D003023F54E0CED4A,It is done
711082146454F47D003023F684826972,"Everything’s ready. We will meet our escort in three days. I know Nih will need convincing, but she'll come around. Then we'll be out of the Empire's clutches for good.

I hid the getaway bag in the cave east of the Pyke territory. If we take the canyon route, I’ll grab it on our way out.

I love you.

Diran"
711082146454F6900041AA1A18E3E9FD,Tosharan Treasure
711082146454F6900041AA1BE0B76C01,Someone has tracked down the location of stolen treasure buried right here on Toshara.
711082146454FB1C0041AA2BF43315BC,It's on Toshara!
711082146454FB1C0041AA2CB1801E27,"I've gathered some information from the locals and I’m convinced the stolen cargo is here on Toshara.

Apparently, there’s a drop-off point at the base of a mountain west of the amberine ravine. Pretty sure it’s buried around there. Let's meet in Jaunta's Hope to discuss our next steps.

Can you imagine if we find it after all this time?"
