BA9D046A645B87560000B4629827842D,Vertical sync
BA9D046A645B87560000B463C9D98189,"Sync the display of the scene to the refresh rate of the monitor to avoid screen tearing. Turning this option off can increase performance significantly.

Please note: Vertical sync will be disabled if NVIDIA DLSS and Frame Generation are enabled.

<color name=""Menu Yellow"">Off:</color> Does not sync the presenting of frames with the refresh rate of the monitor.
<color name=""Menu Yellow"">On:</color> Sync the presenting of a new frame to the next monitor refresh.
<color name=""Menu Yellow"">Half-rate:</color> Sync the presenting of a new frame to every second monitor refresh.
<color name=""Menu Yellow"">Third-rate:</color> Sync the presenting of a new frame to every third monitor refresh.
<color name=""Menu Yellow"">Quarter-rate:</color> Sync the presenting of a new frame to every fourth monitor refresh."
