7EE64634648983500000ABA98C1FC317,"<b>TAUNT</b>: Activate to draw enemy fire and take less damage.
<b>HEAVY TAKEDOWN</b>: Allows takedowns on Heavy enemies.

<b>A280-CFE BLASTER PISTOL (CHARGE)</b>: Area damage, but low rate of fire.
<b>SONIC IMPLODER</b>: Deals damage in an area.
<b>BRUTAL TAKEDOWN</b>: Stun nearby enemies on takedown."
7EE64634648984740000ABB0F2BC449F,"<b>SCAN</b>: Reveal nearby enemies to all teammates.
<b>LOCKPICK</b>: Allows Lockpicking interactions.

<b>A280-CFE BLASTER PISTOL</b>: Heavy single shot damage.
<b>BLAST CHARGE</b>: Remotely detonated explosives.
<b>QUICK SNEAK</b>: Move faster while crouched."
