E52E0D4364A44E1D0000D11C9061D153,About the next race
E52E0D4364A44E210000D11DBE56622F,<b>{0}</b> has everything going for him to win the next race.
E52E0D4364A52D600000DC341191328B,I've got a contact in Canto Bight who says the upcoming race has been rigged. <br> He assured me that <b>{0}</b> is gonna win. He hasn't been wrong so far.
E52E0D4364A582D40000F1F201848287,About the next race
E52E0D4364A582D40000F1F3CAEFF0A8,<b>{0}</b> is the jockey to look for. We have him rigged to win.
E52E0D4364A582D40000F1F438E6DB33,"An old friend in Canto Bight warned me about how races can be rigged. Jockeys are ready to sell their sporting spirit for a few credits.<br>He told me ""Keep an eye on <b>{0}</b>... he's gonna win big next race""."
E52E0D4364A582D40000F1F5B26349A2,There is a tip-off about the winning jockey's name.
E52E0D4364A583D10000F1FAA0E232D5,About the next race
E52E0D4364A583D10000F1FBCF6DF3CD,"Here's a tip. I just bet half my salary on a <b>jockey from {0}</b> to win the next race. I've got someone who owed me that intel, and they're never wrong."
E52E0D4364A583D10000F1FC25973FE5,"Okay, get this. I've got a person on the inside who says that a <b>jockey from {0}</b> is definitely gonna win the next race. You didn't hear it from me."
