7110821464AFC6DD004E718A0289FAC5,Imperial Report: Tosharan Locals
7110821464AFC6DD004E718BC4EA0893,"After further investigation we have discovered a location of great importance to the Tosharan locals. A shrine underneath a series of collapsed mounds, not far from our own compound in the north.

We are yet to confirm the contents of the shrine as it requires a special artifact to get inside."
7110821464AFDC95004E718FAD793B9C,Tosharan Shrine
7110821464AFDC95004E719025F608CA,"An Imperial report mentioned a Tosharan shrine near a northern compound, locked by a local artifact."
7110821464AFE960004E71A2DB07F6FF,Crimson Dawn Hideout
7110821464AFE960004E71A3FD346FEF,A datapad has revealed that Crimson Dawn have stolen an Imperial shuttle to travel to their secret cliff hideout.
7110821464AFEB68005AE09986FEEE8D,Important
7110821464AFEB68005AE09AED895FE4,"Imperial shuttle has been stolen from the compound. We suspect Crimson Dawn are involved.

Last seen flying south of the river fork and behind the cliffs. We have not been able to track it since then."
7110821464AFEF94005AE0A94A4059B0,"What a climb! I almost got blown off the mountain three times!

I was starting to think Cordra was playing a joke on us, but she was right, this seems like a good place to stash some loot.

Head south-east of Typhon's Rock. Look for the flyers. Come and join me when you can."
7110821464AFF29C0064F07F2285D828,Smuggler's Hideout
7110821464AFF29C0064F080EF27F541,A datapad message revealed the coordinates of hideout used by smugglers. There might be something useful left behind.
7110821464AFF63F006E2DCB825FE109,MG Rescue Service
7110821464AFF63F006E2DCC8E73E691,"Dear Customer,

We have received your distress call and are sending a breakdown recovery service to the coordinates provided. Please note that it's unlikely we will be able to retrieve your speeder from the well.

If you'd like to upgrade to our premium plan, we can provide a replacement vehicle and complimentary driving lessons.

Mirogana Breakdown Care"
7110821464AFF64E006E2DCFCB77E0D7,Crashed Speeder
7110821464AFF64E006E2DD0DA21D046,Someone has managed to crash their speeder down a well. There might be some parts or valuables to salvage.
