7110821464B0091F007A9F42F7BF11DC,"The gushiro west of the river fork have settled inside a rocky alcove near the amberine arch. We encourage you to visit the nest, but DO NOT try and retrieve your equipment. The gushiro will attack at the slightest perceived threat. Take this from someone who is already down to three and half fingers.

The Tosharan Wildlife Society"
