BA9D046A64B019F100002896B8E0D911,Upscaler mode
BA9D046A64B019F100002897EE9172DE,"Which mode should be used when upscaling graphics to your output resolution.

<color name=""Menu Yellow"">Off:</color> No upscaling will be used and the screen will be rendered at native output resolution.
<color name=""Menu Yellow"">Fixed:</color> Upscaling is based on a fixed rendering resolution to the native output resolution. Which fixed scaling is used, is decided by the scaling quality.
<color name=""Menu Yellow"">Biased:</color> Upscaling which is based on the fixed rendering solution, but in addition biases it towards a 4k output resolution."
