D00CF65464B7ED6D000183EE5F93AD16,"A wind chime pearl from a Tosharan flying trap. 

It makes a calming noise when Nix makes it roll."
D00CF65464B7EE13000183F5EDDB2EC8,"A piece from an old grappling spike launcher from the Clone Wars, used by mercenaries and soldiers alike. 

Nix seems to like to fiddle with it."
D00CF65464B7EE42000183F9B1C531EC,"A pair of Sabacc dice from some old casino. 

Nix seems to like chewing on them."
D00CF65464B7EE44000183FDF3CC1C73,"A skillfully carved piece of amberine that sparkles in the light. 

Nix seems mesmerized by the color of it."
D00CF65464B7EEA500018407E5A45D27,"The trigger of a LAAT-Carrier pilot controller. 

It has a nice texture to it that Nix seems to enjoy."
D00CF65464B7EF5B0001840DFC8BDB06,"The bottom club of a Tusken Gaderffii stick, which was probably doused in sand bat venom at some point. 

Nix seems to like the smell of it."
D00CF65464B7EF5D000184116A7F24EC,"Horns that were probably shed by some local animal. 

Nix seems to enjoy chewing on them and sharpening his claws on them."
D00CF65464B7EF6000018415E2F72D5A,"A well-made airspeeder miniature that was probably used as a toy by children on Tatooine. 

Nix doesn't play with it, but maybe he likes the idea of owning his own ship."
D00CF65464B7F0BF00018431A10EE100,"A forged identicard that probably belonged to someone who wanted to leave the planet. 

Nix seems to just like the shape of it."
D00CF65464B7F19000018449CE244518,"A bone from a mysterious Akiva predator found in a dark cave in the jungle. 

Nix took it as a trophy, maybe to prove his braveness."
D00CF65464B7F1910001844DBA19929F,"A Republic Credit from before the Clone Wars. 

Not legal tender anywhere in the galaxy these days, but Nix seems to like the metal."
D00CF65464B7F194000184513690799F,"A cheap 2-Mal personal comlink that was probably used by rebels. 

Nix seems to like holding it and yapping into the microphone, as if he's talking to someone."
