8FD81D5164C92EE400051A268E9BCB96,Regarding the Intrepid
8FD81D5164C92EE400051A274E7B855C,"As you should all be well aware, the Intrepid will soon dock and Admiral Vaneer himself will grace us with his presence. Your orders are to service and refuel the Intrepid as swiftly and efficiently as possibly, whilst drawing as little attention as possible to our secondary operations."
8FD81D5164C931830005C0E6CBBC3897,Valve release
8FD81D5164C931830005C0E77306E08A,"Despite telling maintenance about the risks, the team on L-Section 04 insist that the fuel-rails are correctly adjusted.

The excessive levels of pressurized steam makes the stormtrooper's lenses fog up. My troops can't keep putting up with these poor working conditions. 

If this is not addressed I will elevate this issue to the section chief."
8FD81D5164C932AA0005C9E157AEE0DC,TIE maintenance logs
