8FD81D5164C9331E0005CED3E8FF3DB0,Regarding the accountant
8FD81D5164C9331E0005CED438DBCA24,"I have received multiple complaints about the accountant on this station, and therefore think it is necessary to remind you about the organization of this sector. The accountant has been appointed by me and will remain under my protection until further notice. If you still wish to raise any concerns, you may do so in person.

Governor Thorden"
8FD81D5164C935C9000679D8C83C8462,Regarding corruption
8FD81D5164C935C9000679D97B3FFF6A,"Ensign,

Thank you for your report regarding elements of corruption on Fuel Station Visavi. I have reviewed the evidence and I agree it looks bad. I have asked Captain Volo to relieve you so that you can meet with my commission in Mirogana and deliver your testimony in person. I see great things ahead for you.

Governor Thorden"
