5FC60A8F64CA12530004146A8D072184,Take Photo
5FC60A8F64CA17BB00010A3DB43CD2AC,Failed to save screenshot...
5FC60A8F64CA17BB00010A3E4043E225,Photo Saved!
D00CF65464CA3DC00000EF81995044F4,"Kay Vess is a young thief from Canto Bight's Worker's District who's running out of marks. Together with her pet and partner in crime, a merqaal named Nix, Kay is looking for a big score to get them set for life. Ever since she was left behind by her mother, Kay has rented a room from a bar owner named Bram who is the closest to family she has left."
D00CF65464CA3DC00000EF820443118B,Kay Vess
D00CF65464CA3E3E0000EF8AAFBE20AC,"Nix is a merqaal who has been Kay Vess' best friend and loyal partner in crime since she was a kid. Nix's background and home planet are unknown, but he is immensely loyal to Kay and will never leave her side. Together, Kay and Nix have made Canto Bight their prowling grounds, and Nix's innate abilities of climbing, jumping and sensing danger has been a perfect complement to Kay."
D00CF65464CA3E3E0000EF8BAC3AC0F2,Nix
D00CF65464CA3E550000EF9110190D50,"Riko Vess is Kay's mother and a talented thief and slicer. Riko raised Kay in the Worker's District in Canto Bight and taught her daughter everything from slicing to lockpicking and grifting, with Riko seeing no other choice to survive in the unforgiving Worker's District. At some point, Riko decided to leave Kay behind and her whereabouts since then are unknown."
D00CF65464CA3E550000EF92DB94616E,Riko Vess
D00CF65464CA3E750000EF9A157CBA4C,"Bram is the owner of The Broken Hoof in Canto Bight's Worker's District, and has looked after Kay for years with free meals and an attic to sleep in. Aside from bartending, Bram is also a broker for illegal jobs, finding work for Kay as well as other thieves and grifters. Despite his gruff exterior, he deeply cares for Kay and wants her to learn from her own mistakes."
D00CF65464CA3E750000EF9B631F6406,Bram Shano
D00CF65464CA3E890000EFA22E141A31,"Asara realized early that he could read people and talk himself out of anything. Asara idolized his sister Calys, and as she organized a burgeoning rebel cell, Asara helped by spying on Imperial patrols. When Calys said she wanted them to leave and join the fight among the stars, Asara was scared and told their parents. Calys slipped away in the night and died in battle, leaving Asara feeling immense guilt."
D00CF65464CA3E890000EFA3B3941054,Asara Deyn
D00CF65464CA3EAA0000EFAA3C154559,"Vail is a bounty hunter who was raised by a syndicate enforcer and a pirate who taught her that looking out for number one is the only true law of the galaxy. As soon as she was old enough, she set off to make a name for herself as a bounty hunter. After losing part of her hand to an assassin, Vail installed cybernetic prosthetics to become even more dangerous."
D00CF65464CA3EAA0000EFABD9284437,Vail Tormin
D00CF65464CA3EBE0000EFB2E8F83C1A,ND-5 is a BX Commando droid from the Clone Wars who works as a personal enforcer droid for the crime lord Jaylen Vrax. ND-5 hides some of the damage with a large trench coat and tends to avoid talking about his past. He is forced to work with Jaylen due to an intrusive restraining bolt but he has come to accept that he is a mere tool to be used.
D00CF65464CA3EBE0000EFB3DBF8A0D8,ND-5
D00CF65464CA3ED70000EFBA90A7F7C2,"Jaylen Vrax is a crime lord who has been running heists and smuggling rings for years across the whole Outer Rim, always staying independent of the major crime syndicates. A charming and clever outlaw, Jaylen is well-connected and is used to getting people on his side. He is typically accompanied by his personal enforcer droid ND-5 who he trusts more than anything due to the custom-made restraining bolt."
D00CF65464CA3ED70000EFBBAC24A140,Jaylen Vrax
D00CF65464CA3EEF0000EFC257163708,"Ank always had an aptitude for chemistry and a taste for danger, spending decades moving on to bigger and bigger jobs with her husband Pirrip. Their final job together was breaking into a Black Sun vault, which would've been a success if Pirrip's heart didn't give out during the robbery. Now Ank has accrued immense debts to the Ashiga Clan without her former partner in crime by her side."
D00CF65464CA3EEF0000EFC347BD2FE6,Ank Parako
D00CF65464CA3F150000EFCA350C3FF5,"Raised in Canto Bight's Worker's District, Gedeek's criminal career started by modifying mouse droids to steal for him. When he was a teenager, he became fast friends with Kay Vess and the pair made some decent credits grifting together. When a casino scam became too successful and attracted the attention of the Canto Bight Police, Gedeek had no choice but to enlist in the Empire and leave Canto Bight behind."
D00CF65464CA3F150000EFCBDC551C64,Gedeek Obaz
D00CF65464CA3F470000EFD212A79132,"Dennion is a rebel spy who was conscripted by Imperial security to fight insurgents on their home world. Dennion tried to convince everyone that they had to conform to survive, but that changed when they found themselves standing over the bodies of friends who had taken up arms against the Empire. Dennion switched sides, and although they are filled with regrets, they are now seeing a freedom they couldn't imagine."
D00CF65464CA3F470000EFD366576549,Dennion
D00CF65464CA3F620000EFD93459045F,"Waka is a mechanic and scavenger on Toshara. He has dreamed his whole life of greatness, wealth, comfort and power – but he was never a fan of the whole “hard work” thing. A self-interested mechanic with big ambitions but not a lot of foresight, Waka leaves behind a trail of failed grifts and burned former allies, giving him a reputation as unreliable."
D00CF65464CA3F620000EFDAC3FAE405,Waka
D00CF65464CA3F760000EFE2361E0F21,"Gorak is a Pyke crime lord who established the Pykes as the most powerful syndicate on Toshara. He surrounds himself with fineries and spends lavishly wherever he goes. With the governor of Mirogana on his payroll, Gorak knows the importance of social manipulation – well aware that the perception of wealth and power are just as important as actually having them."
D00CF65464CA3F760000EFE311637CEF,Gorak Palas
D00CF65464CA3F8A0000EFEA0D5280B6,"Danka is an independent broker on Toshara who's working with the toughest syndicates in the galaxy. Gruff but likeable, tough but fair, Danka's carved out a place for herself in the underworld. After getting tangled up in some bad deals on Mon Cala at a young age, Danka fled her home and landed on Toshara with nothing, building an empire of her own using nothing but her wits and confidence."
D00CF65464CA3F8A0000EFEB83B80E7D,Danka Orsato
D00CF65464CA3FB40000EFF2A73BD481,"Eleera is a senior member of the Crimson Dawn syndicate, focused on leading their operation on Toshara to collect intel, find recruits, and undermine the Pykes. Knowing Qi'ra personally, she has earned a great degree of trust to carry out her work as she sees fit. Eleera has never been interested in leading, prefering instead to stay in the shadows so she can slip away if things get too complicated."
D00CF65464CA3FB40000EFF359DE402C,Eleera Soi
D00CF65464CA3FE60000EFFA1319EDDF,"Bosnok always had a knack for numbers, spending the greater part of his life drifting through the galaxy doing quick jobs that paid fast. He became proficient at counting cards in Sabacc, but eventually picked the wrong table and was quickly arrested. Governor Thorden saw great use of Bosnok's abilities, and instead of a prison cell offered him a job managing records of the Empire's shady dealings on Toshara."
D00CF65464CA3FE60000EFFB2E3A9CD0,Bosnok
D00CF65464CA402E0000F0117049A9DC,"Queen Ashiga has ruled the Ashiga Clan for generations, admired for holding back the Empire from Kijimi. At the breakout of the civil war, the Queen finally gave in to Imperial pressure, giving them access to Kijimi's rhydonium mines in exchange of weapons contracts. The Queen's concessions have become widely criticized, making her distraught and vengeful to the point where a coup is building up in the clan's own ranks."
D00CF65464CA402E0000F0125F39284B,Queen Ashiga
D00CF65464CA41950000F018EF7EC9F4,"Krisk Ashiga is the heir to the Ashiga Clan's throne. Krisk has always known that her time would come to take over the clan, but as the Queen's grip on both the clan and Kijimi is faltering, Krisk believes she must expediate the process and turn on her mother. Krisk is pragmatic and dutiful, and a firm believer that the hive's interests supersedes everything."
D00CF65464CA41950000F01935745357,Krisk Ashiga
D00CF65464CA41AC0000F01FD0F0075F,"Qi'ra grew up as a scrumrat in Corellia's criminal underworld. After working for Crimson Dawn and their leader Dryden Vos, Qi'ra eventually climbed her way up to the top as the new leader of the syndicate. While Crimson Dawn was assumed gone for years, they have recently resurfaced as a powerful player in the galactic underworld, with Qi'ra leading the syndicate with poise, intelligence and determination."
D00CF65464CA41AC0000F020ED965455,Lady Qi'ra
D00CF65464CA41C60000F0264C33CE51,"Hoss is an outlaw legend, known for his wild gambling, his collection of powerful weapons, and risk-taking. But Hoss didn't know when to stop. In one bad game, Hoss lost everything – more than everything, as he left the game massively in debt. With no ship, no crew, and no way out, he wandered into the dunes, looking for anyone he could trick into handing over their credits."
D00CF65464CA41C60000F02724DFA428,Hoss
D00CF65464CA41DA0000F02D9B3CA265,"Jabba the Hutt is one of the galaxy's most powerful gangsters, with far-reaching influence in both politics and the criminal underworld. Jabba rules his syndicate from his palace on Tatooine, where he holds both the underworld and the local economy in his grip. Jabba is famous for his decadence and ruthlessness, and he keeps a menagerie of wild beasts in his palace as a show of power."
D00CF65464CA41DA0000F02ECCEC2D45,Jabba the Hutt
D00CF65464CA41F00000F03435D6E37E,"Bib Fortuna is the majordomo to Jabba the Hutt and takes care of business around the palace and acts as Jabba's chief adviser. Even though Bib has been at Jabba's side for as long as anyone can remember, he is at heart a selfish and manipulative person. Some suspect that Bib is just biding his time, waiting for the right opportunity to betray Jabba and take over his syndicate."
D00CF65464CA41F00000F0353C3B73E5,Bib Fortuna
D00CF65464CA59A70000C9312BCFFAE5,"Surat is a vicious crime-boss who notoriously murdered his own parents and keeps his own brother frozen in carbonite in his office. Surat has recently established close ties with the Hutt Cartel, causing him and his gang of henchmen to become an extended arm of the Hutts' business on Akiva. Surat is the owner of The Alcazar in Myrra, a popular cantina among outlaws and fugitives."
D00CF65464CA59A70000C9320736B209,Surat Nuat
D00CF65464CA59E40000C9418D593602,"Quint Cresadde is a former pirate who worked with the notorious pirate Gwarm. While she had immense success as a pirate, especially thanks to her gunslinger skills, Quint eventually realized that the lifestyle had made her a heartless person. Buying her way out from the gang, Quint returned home to Wayfar on Tatooine, putting her skills to better use to help the locals, earning their trust to become their sheriff."
D00CF65464CA59E40000C94271D76E33,Quint Cresadde
D00CF65464CA5A030000C94AB4AE55CE,"Selo Rovak is a young native Tosharan. She was raised in a windfishing settlement, always dreaming of a different life but she couldn't leave her family behind. She decided that if she couldn't change the galaxy, maybe she could change Toshara. So, she spent her time creating gadgets that would streamline windfishing, devices that took advantage of the strength of Toshara's wind."
D00CF65464CA5A030000C94B831B9696,Selo Rovak
D00CF65464CA5A170000C952C516DC0B,"Aila Bren is a slicer and computer expert who has made a living freelancing for the syndicates on Toshara. She became well-known around Mirogana for being fast, efficient and most of all discrete. But seeing Toshara fall victim to the Empire and the rival syndicates has made Aila want to start fresh off-world, seeking new opportunities in the greater galaxy."
D00CF65464CA5A170000C9535A78177E,Aila Bren
D00CF65464CA5A3F0000C95AD0EC2542,"Rooster's been in the mercenary game for longer than anyone else in the Mid Rim, and a hired gun doesn't survive multiple wars and regime changes without being pretty damn tough and very damn mean. Some mercs like to pretend that the job is purely business, that feelings don't enter into it. As far as Rooster's concerned, they're kidding themselves."
D00CF65464CA5A3F0000C95BB9F02F2F,Rooster Trace
D00CF65464CA5A590000C96269775DBB,"Temmin Wexley is an Akivan boy whose father was arrested by Imperial forces for carrying messages for the Rebel Alliance. Temmin was left on Akiva by his mother Nora who joined the rebels as a transport pilot. While he was left in the care of his aunt Esmelle and her partner, Temmin has insisted on living alone in his family home, scavenging droid parts and working on various projects."
D00CF65464CA5A590000C9631F707273,Temmin Wexley
D00CF65464CA5A800000C969B68830C8,"Lando Calrissian is a gambler, smuggler, and former baron administrator of a tibanna gas colony on Bespin. After losing the colony to an Imperial occupation, Lando's chief concern has been around rescuing his friend Han Solo, who is frozen in carbonite and put on display in Jabba's palace on Tatooine. Rumor has it that Lando is getting a bit too familiar with the Rebel Alliance lately."
D00CF65464CA5A800000C96A8F97F4DE,Lando Calrissian
D00CF65464CA5A9E0000C9709A975E2D,"Sliro is a crime lord and leader of the Zerek Besh crime syndicate which he runs from a palace in Canto Bight. Sliro is often seen mingling with the rich and powerful in the city's casino district, using both charm and intimidation to gain their favor. While he and Zerek Besh are widely known in the underworld, Sliro has always managed to stay influential among Canto Bight's elite."
D00CF65464CA5A9E0000C9716897B392,Sliro Ruback
D00CF65464CA5ABA0000C97737E4D296,"Teeka is a Jawa scavenger, mechanic and trader who works with her tribe around various settlements on Tatooine. She has a wide reputation for being a shrewd and clever entrepreneur who can sell almost anything at a mark-up, earning the tribe great profits. More importantly, Teeka is a skillful mechanic who can handle almost any type of vehicle or machine with great results."
D00CF65464CA5ABA0000C9783B822993,Teeka
DA5615DD64CA152E0000ABD028F55CF0,Droid
DA5615DD64CA15420000ABD2AC4E2030,Droid
