9128788864D259AF00468C5C7988AF8E,Instructions for Drebb
9128788864D259AF00468C5D27869AF0,"Here's a reminder, Drebb.

Do NOT bring the item itself to the trade. If Crimson Dawn demand to see it, blast them at once. It should be easy to pilfer whatever credits they bring afterwards.

If Crimson Dawn has some underhanded scheme - it's not worth losing the bivalve along with your life. 

You are expendable. The clam is not."
