F4D8AE2664CCFD39000316CEE83489CD,Defeat an enemy with a single <b>Quickdraw</b> or <b>Hip Fire</b> shot
F4D8AE2664D23F7F00040A81479954D7,Find Pyke Syndicate hideouts
