D00CF65464D3AD160000D0D5FE7D3984,Toshara is a dangerous savanna moon in the Outer Rim that is rife with corrupt Imperials and ruthless crime syndicates.
D00CF65464D3AD160000D0D6F8F76FEB,Locations
D00CF65464D3AEF40000D0DB8265147B,"Mirogana is the capital city of Toshara and the oldest settlement on the moon. The original Tosharan refugees built the settlement as a way to shield themselves from the harsh winds, and over generations it has grown into a vibrant city. These days the city is under siege by both the Empire and the syndicates, with the Empire holding the starport, customs and utilities, and the Pykes spreading out into a major district. Many Tosharans who are old enough to remember dream about a return to Mirogana's former glory."
D00CF65464D3AEF40000D0DC7B1CE09A,Mirogana
D00CF65464D3AF3A0000D0E407B2EC38,"Jaunta's Hope is a small Tosharan settlement outside of Mirogana that was founded as a hub for mechanics and engineers to trade goods and repair ships. After the construction of the landing pads, the settlement has amassed numerous shops and homesteads, as well as a popular diner."
D00CF65464D3AF3A0000D0E58BAF03D0,Jaunta's Hope
D00CF65464D3AF4A0000D0EB6E16952D,"Makal's is an old Tosharan parlor that used to be a popular meeting place for Tosharans long before the arrival of the syndicates and the Empire. Over the years, the parlor got corrupted into a gambling parlor where gangsters, fugitives and other outlaws collude. While Gorak has a private suite upstairs, the parlor is considered neutral ground."
D00CF65464D3AF4A0000D0EC628C2942,Makal's Gambling Parlor
D00CF65464D3B06C0000D0F9E4D390E7,"Mos Eisley is a spaceport settlement on Tatooine that is widely known in the underworld as a hotbed of smugglers, bounty hunters and other criminals. Beings of all types of species from all kinds of backgrounds live and work in Mos Eisley, many of them on the run from the Empire."
D00CF65464D3B06C0000D0FA7AEED680,Mos Eisley
D00CF65464D3B32A0000D101036D9CD8,Tosche Station is a power station and machine shop in the desert on Tatooine that is a popular hangout by local teenagers.
D00CF65464D3B32A0000D10238C750BD,Tosche Station
D00CF65464D3B33D0000D109F6E16D49,"Bestine is a small city on Tatooine that supports nearby moisture farmers with trade opportunities, a spaceport as well as other types of facilities. When the Empire increased their presence on Tatooine after the Battle of Yavin, they established their main administrative offices in Bestine."
D00CF65464D3B33D0000D10AB72930BE,Bestine
D00CF65464D3B3500000D11160378B37,"Kijimi City was founded long ago by monks of the Dai Bendu order, and over time the city was raided by pirates and criminals until the monks eventually disappeared. The city became a lawless place, occupied by thieves and crime syndicates. During the High Republic, a clan of Melitto known as the Ashiga Clan established a hive there, evolving into a powerful crime syndicate that carved out a large piece of the city for themselves."
D00CF65464D3B3500000D112CF231742,Kijimi City
D00CF65464D3B36D0000D119AA24C465,"The Domak Refectory is an old refectory that belonged to one of the Dai Bendu monasteries that became an open business after the monks disappeared. The refectory specializes in hot teas and soups, with warm thermals that is a welcoming change from Kijimi's cold streets."
D00CF65464D3B36D0000D11A2FAB76F8,The Domak Refectory
D00CF65464D3B37F0000D121B558DFF0,"The Ashiga weapons factory is a factory where the Ashiga Clan has been making blaster rifles and vibroblades for generations. After Queen Ashiga opened up Kijimi to the Empire, the factory has been repurposed to focus on producing powerful explosives for the Empire, which some Ashiga Clan members believe is a betrayal of the clan's values."
D00CF65464D3B37F0000D1224FC2AB52,Ashiga Weapons Factory
D00CF65464D3B3910000D129518130DF,"Myrra is the capital city of Akiva and the main foothold of the Akivan satrapy. During the Clone Wars, the city was an important holdout for the Confederacy of Independent Systems, with a droid factory that produced a massive amount of battle droids for the war effort. Like most settlements on Akiva, Myrra is built to minimize impact from the treacherous rain seasons and floods."
D00CF65464D3B3910000D12AEA44377A,Myrra
D00CF65464D3B3D30000D1310043FC80,"Sashin is a village on Akiva situated in the forested slopes of Stratha Peaks. The village comes from a rich history of pottery, using mud from the flooded river banks to create traditional Akivan pots and bowls. The village is a testament of the simple and peaceful life that can be found on this world."
D00CF65464D3B3D30000D132AC3467D6,Sashin
D00CF65464D3B3E30000D1387A5FE2C1,"The Alcazar is one of the most popular cantinas and gambling parlors in Akiva, owned and operated by the gangster Surat Nuat. The cantina is famous for giving their patrons privacy as well as a variety of different games to play. Surat Nuat holds his private office in the cantina, using a carbonite slate containing his brother as his desk."
D00CF65464D3B3E30000D13986AB2E5B,The Alcazar
D00CF65464D3B4150000D14152FE2E13,Tatooine is a lawless and barren desert planet in the Outer Rim under control by the powerful crime lord Jabba the Hutt.
D00CF65464D3B4150000D142C3EDB36A,Locations
D00CF65464D3B44E0000D14C6D9C06AD,"Kijimi is a cold, terrestrial planet in the Mid Rim that is under heavy influence by the Ashiga Clan crime syndicate."
D00CF65464D3B44E0000D14DFFE7EB58,Locations
D00CF65464D3B4A10000D1573D153CF2,"Akiva is a hot and humid jungle planet in the Outer Rim, remotely controlled by the Empire via a local satrapy."
D00CF65464D3B4A10000D1589411222E,Locations
D00CF65464D3B4D20000D1620D009F02,"Canto Bight is a city of contrast. It was built for the sole purpose of offering the greatest, most exclusive and expensive entertainment available in the galaxy, but it also contains a vibrant Worker's District where thousands of people reside making a living off the tourism. The city is constantly evolving, with new distractions constructed onto the city's core ever cycle."
D00CF65464D3B4D20000D163FCAA31BE,Canto Bight
D00CF65464D3B4F50000D16AACA884D4,"Bram established The Broken Hoof after retiring from fathier racing, and over the years it has become a popular meeting spot for Worker's District locals. Bram also uses it as a front for his work as a fence, and he will move goods and broker jobs for Kay and other associates. Kay rents a cheap space in the attic where she has a bed and the bare necessities."
D00CF65464D3B4F50000D16B20850D0C,The Broken Hoof
D00CF65464D3B5040000D1714681AC40,"Club Tarsus is a nightclub run by Wen Delphis and the Sixth Kin gang, and it's one of the seedier places in the whole Worker's District. While the club has headlined some celebrated musicians over the years looking for credibility, it's also a place where the hardened Sixth Kin enforcers and their associates do business with smuggling, blackmail and assassinations."
D00CF65464D3B5040000D172CB4A99F0,Club Tarsus
D00CF65464D3B5150000D17AF599F2E4,Cantonica is a transformed desert world in the Corporate Sector that hosts the luxurious and exclusive casino city Canto Bight.
D00CF65464D3B5150000D17B3A33709F,Locations
D00CF65464D3B5B10000D1855F9A55D7,"Slygels are a soft-bodied invertebrates with gelatinous skin that can be found in Toshara's orbit. They feed off energy supplies from starships and satellites powered with energy cells, with dormant sublight engines being able to sustain hundreds of slygels for multiple cycles. Expired slygels will vaporize and scatter into a surge of bubbles before fading, and will typically release bursts of energy on contact."
D00CF65464D3B5B10000D1861555B51E,Slygel
D00CF65464D3B5DA0000D18C252A39DE,"Scurriers are small and skittish rodents that nest in the wilds on Tatooine but can often be found around settlements as well. They usually travel in groups and will often scatter at the slightest threat, with even their names coming from their swift and nervous movements."
D00CF65464D3B5DA0000D18D7DFDEC23,Scurrier
D00CF65464D3B5F10000D193E0AB9B2E,"Massiffs are reptilian predators that can be found on Tatooine where they are sometimes domesticated by Tusken or other locals to be used as guard creatures. Massiffs have thick and durable hides as well as sharp teeth and strong jaws, making them very dangerous to most organic beings. Their eyes are well-adapted to the dark, and they will often use this to their advantage when hunting prey at night."
D00CF65464D3B5F10000D194F693EB1D,Massiff
E4123D2764D483B2000075154E7831F8,Ashiga Myrmite
E4123D2764D483B4000076D3EC425446,Ashiga Myrmite
6B0E1DE964D2578D000603BDAD2B82CA,Sienar-Chall Utilipede Transport
75B1D5B364D4FCD3000E9BB076A649FB,Win a game against the high-rollers
