92D7D0C164D9D82A00064F62B0309E4E,"{0} {0?Configuration,Configurations} Available "
92D7D0C164D9D82A00064F63E0ABC8F4,"{0} {0?Upgrade,Upgrades} Available "
AB9E8ED964D647910000D30F0CA64F62,Read Intel
D00CF65464D64F8A0000DAB7643F2212,"Slow-grilled sweet mosskà on the cob, freshly picked from the steppes of Toshara. Served with mashed deikkò root and jerà peppers."
D00CF65464D64F8A0000DAB85762B6C8,Che Mosskà
D00CF65464D64F8A0000DAB935B1D824,Mirogana
D00CF65464D6502F0000DAC32B6565F1,Fried sketto meatballs and chuga fruit on a skewer served with pickled legume puree and hot kankee spices.
D00CF65464D6502F0000DAC4F8BADD0B,Sketto Chuga
D00CF65464D6502F0000DAC51EED6918,Mos Eisley
D00CF65464D650630000DACDF68C8E67,Fisherfolk's broth with sweet algae and larvae simmered in Buyan-Ki mineral water. Served with a frozen chakino eel from the deep lakes.
D00CF65464D650630000DACE9303D3CD,Duradan Soup
D00CF65464D650630000DACFEC5D9101,Kijimi City
D00CF65464D650920000DADB4AE14C81,Fresh kurado fruit served in the traditional Akiva style.
D00CF65464D650920000DADC4F9B4209,Kurado Fruit Platter
D00CF65464D650920000DADD6148F67B,Myrra
D00CF65464D650FB0000DAE7C92B91F5,"Rider is a popular arcade racing game that can be found in cantinas and arcade halls all over the galaxy. The game's high-resolution graphics and fast-paced racing challenge have led to countless fans competing over the high-score, with some sharing their best results on the HoloNet."
D00CF65464D650FB0000DAE8BB23604C,Rider
D00CF65464D650FB0000DAE9E1D2B6C4,Cities & Settlements
D00CF65464D651830000DAF3682F79D5,"Raven 6 is a popular starfighter simulator game where players pilot an Imperial vessel to hunt down and destroy waves of pirates and smugglers. While the game can often be found around cantinas and arcade halls, it has also become a popular pastime for Imperial pilots. As with many other arcade games, players often compete for high-scores and share their best results on the HoloNet."
D00CF65464D651830000DAF4380B2FEC,Raven 6
D00CF65464D651830000DAF5A8B9D960,Cities & Settlements
D00CF65464D652000000DAFF7B276A2A,"The fathier races from Canto Bight have recently reached new audiences, as betting consoles make their way to cantinas and gambling halls out in the Outer Rim. These betting consoles cover live broadcasts and give racing enthusiasts live updates and odds, along with commentary straight from the race track in Canto Bight."
D00CF65464D652000000DB00A7555AA7,Canto Fathier Racing
D00CF65464D652000000DB0169881CA0,Cities
D00CF65464D652440000DB0ACE532328,"Wandering Sylop is an old arcade game that is still popular among cantina and arcade owners in the Outer Rim. The simple graphics and straightforward gameplay creates a low barrier of entry for those who want to win some quick credits. The goal of the game is to consistently spot the Sylop as it moves between multiple locations, with an increasing challenge."
D00CF65464D652440000DB0BB87CDA19,Wandering Sylop
D00CF65464D652440000DB0CD635C9C5,Cities & Settlements
D00CF65464D652D60000DB15D6F8E217,"Bosnok is a brilliant Sabacc player and a notorious card counter who enjoys all kinds of games, especially Kessel Sabacc."
D00CF65464D652D60000DB16E37A6E33,Bosnok's Table
D00CF65464D652D60000DB173C1CD0CE,"Toshara, Kaslo's parlor"
D00CF65464D655130000DB21A6E1EA92,"A former life as a pirate has not just honed Sheriff Quint's gunslinging abilities, it has also forged her into a tough opponent at the Sabacc table."
D00CF65464D655130000DB226B8DB243,Quint's Table
D00CF65464D655130000DB23E6DE8F25,Tatooine
D00CF65464D655420000DB2D6B992EE8,"Lando Calrissian has played in some of the bigger tournaments in the galaxy, but is well-known for being lax when it comes to playing by the rules."
D00CF65464D655420000DB2EE1CC5B77,Lando's Table
D00CF65464D655420000DB2F788DF072,Akiva
D00CF65464D655910000DB39F6750E2E,"Despite being a Melitto myrmite and a member of the Ashiga Clan, Mehdo has made a name for himself as one of the most skilled Kessel Sabacc players on Kijimi."
D00CF65464D655910000DB3A2AD29F37,Mehdo's Table
D00CF65464D655910000DB3BB557E451,Kijimi
D00CF65464D657310000DB752E18F209,"The galaxy is full of exciting culinary experiences, where different ingredients and cultures combine to create unique dishes. When traveling the galaxy, it's worth taking a moment to seek out some of the local delicacies available on different worlds."
D00CF65464D657310000DB76E02D92CF,Galactic Street Food
D00CF65464D657E00000DB8578219529,"Arcade games are popular activities across the galaxy, whether it's in dinky cantinas in the Outer Rim or in vibrant arcade halls on Coruscant. Some elders might say it's a waste of time and energy, but beings across the whole galaxy are captivated by the games and their unique way of testing skills, providing immersive experiences and building creative communities."
D00CF65464D657E00000DB8657718274,Arcade
D00CF65464D658100000DB8F13BB352A,"Sabacc cards are cheap and versatile, and are used for an assortment of different games across the whole galaxy. Aside from Coruscant Shift and Corellian Spike, many players in the Outer Rim will sit down and play Kessel Sabacc at automated dealer tables. The droid dealer guarantees that no player can interfere with other player's cards."
D00CF65464D658100000DB901C688793,Kessel Sabacc
