BA9D046A64DF8C7400013F8DC05CB377,Raytracing
D00CF65464E36D0100010FC6C104E80C,"Westhill Palace is a luxurious residence up in the Westhill cliffs that has had numerous wealthy residents over the years with its high-secure vault and underground starship hangar. In recent years, the palace is the residence of socialite Sliro Ruback, the gentleman crime lord of the Zerek Besh syndicate. When Sliro is not out socializing with the galaxy's elite in the Casino District, he will often entertain guests in the palace."
D00CF65464E36D0100010FC7E7CD6BA7,Westhill Palace
D00CF65464E36D0E00010FCDDED078EB,"The Crescent Royale Casino is one of the main attractions in Canto Bight, and one of its oldest venues. Connected to the popular fathier race track, the Crescent Royale has numerous gambling halls, private rooms, theaters, restaurants and a hotel. Many guests will go to Canto Bight simply to stay at the Crescent Royale, finding no reason to ever leave the building complex."
D00CF65464E36D0E00010FCE938D9134,Crescent Royale Casino
D00CF65464E36D1F00010FD4204CF7D5,"The Worker's District in Canto Bight was established when the city was first constructed, and it has lived on for years as its own separate district. This is where construction workers, hosts, valets, maintenance staff, and countless other workers live, hidden away from the luxurious façade of the Casino District. Over time, the Worker's District has been reconfigured, with many buildings demolished with little forewarning."
D00CF65464E36D1F00010FD5EA08F049,South Stretch Worker's District
D00CF65464E36D3600010FDBA6E1A5AB,"The Casino District is the main draw of Canto Bight, where wealthy tourists spend their time in luxury hotels, the various casinos or any of the other countless entertainment venues available. The Casino District is under strict security by the Canto Bight Police, and every thief and outlaw in the Worker's District knows to keep a low profile in there."
D00CF65464E36D3600010FDC4093F092,Casino District
D00CF65464E36DB400010FE60427792E,"Aside from the landing pad and the mechanical shops, Daruda Diner is the main attraction of Jaunta's Hope. The diner was originally run by a retired mechanic, but it has become a hotbed for criminal activity away from the peering eyes of the Pykes in Mirogana. The basement has been refurbished into a speakeasy where Imperials and criminals alike collude, making some of the most profitable deals on Toshara."
D00CF65464E36DB400010FE7A4CF97FB,Daruda Diner
D00CF65464E36DCD00010FEDBC075B8C,"Shortly after arriving on Toshara, the Empire established a comm station at the edge of the amberine canyon. The facility gives the Empire a wider reach in the Toshaal system with minimal interference, ensuring stable communication between Mirogana and the Imperial fuel station in the moon's orbit."
D00CF65464E36DCD00010FEEF3D92C43,Imperial Comm Station
D00CF65464E36DE200010FF4FECB7004,"While the Empire's main foothold on Toshara is in the capital city of Mirogana, they have established outposts in the more remote regions. This forward base was built on top of an amberine structure to send a clear message to the locals that the Empire is in control."
D00CF65464E36DE200010FF53D780375,Imperial Forward Base
D00CF65464E36DF700010FFBB0FB923A,"The Pyke Syndicate's main foothold in Mirogana is in a former temple. This building grants the Pykes a lot of security and influence in the city, and they use the building to manage their operations in the sector and to store valuable goods away from the prying eyes of the Empire and their rivals."
D00CF65464E36DF700010FFC9A9120B4,Pyke Syndicate Stronghold
D00CF65464E36E0D000110021D7C80A1,"This Imperial Fuel Station was transported to Toshara's orbit in the early days of the Empire's occupation of the moon as a means to sustain large cruisers and transport shuttles. Following Governor Thorden's increased corruption, the fuel station is now mostly used to hold illegal goods and to handle high-value transactions from approved crime syndicates."
D00CF65464E36E0D00011003814C968F,Fuel Station Visavi
D00CF65464E36E23000110099F50F816,"This large cruiser crashed down on Toshara at some point during the High Republic. While the crew and cargo were evacuated shortly after the disaster, the shipwreck has remained mostly intact due to its inaccessible location. Over the years, bands of scavengers have explored the wreck in search of valuables, but most of it is long gone. What remains are dated electronics and ship components that aren't of much value."
D00CF65464E36E230001100A74CBA3D3,The Castellan
D00CF65464E36E4B000110104C410E77,"The Pykes use this mechanics shop to break down stolen starships and speeders, either stripping them down to their most valuable parts or rebuilding them into proper smuggling vehicles. While the Pykes are mostly focused on the resources being smuggled, the abundance of ships and mechanics on Toshara has created an opportunity they cannot ignore."
D00CF65464E36E4B00011011543AC90B,Pyke Syndicate Workshop
D00CF65464E36E5E000110173463E6B0,"This space station is an independent facility that allows pilots to refuel and repair their ships, as well as trade goods, without having to touch down on Toshara proper. The space station has especially been used by larger cargo ships, but overtime the space station has become its own meeting spot for smugglers and syndicate enforcers to meet and do business."
D00CF65464E36E5E00011018AC3A34FD,Renpalli Station
D00CF65464E36E800001102645E3C9D3,"Crimson Dawn are light and lean on Toshara, operating from a small district in Mirogana. Unlike the Pykes, who are brash and provocative with their territories on the moon, Crimson Dawn emphasize versatility and leverage. The district itself is of little value, but it's a good location to organize their operations."
D00CF65464E36E8000011027A418667B,Crimson Dawn District
D00CF65464E36E980001102DAC5F5EC7,"After the Pykes carved out a place for themselves in the higher echelons of Toshara's economy, they naturally sought the best real estate that Mirogana had to offer. The Pyke district is set up around an old Tosharan temple, and it's the beating heart of the syndicate's operation on Toshara."
D00CF65464E36E980001102EDB69838A,Pyke Syndicate District
D00CF65464E36EAB000110340A59DE7D,"The Pykes use this station to hold and process captured robumas. The Pykes were quick to realize that the native robumas were sturdy animals with tough skin that can be processed into valuable leather. The operation is still small-scale but Gorak believes it can be expanded over time, especially to shut out the Hutts from one of their wheelhouse markets."
D00CF65464E36EAB00011035C86E8C90,Pyke Poaching Station
D00CF65464E36ED10001103BE37842EB,"While Crimson Dawn mainly operates out of a district in Mirogana, they also hold a hideout outside of the city. This discrete hideout is used for smuggling goods, monitoring communications and producing equipment and counterfeited credits."
D00CF65464E36ED10001103C60FF470F,Crimson Dawn Hideout
D00CF65464E36F2100011042754DC7FD,Typhon's Rock is a mound in the middle of the Tosharan savanna that has been used as a nest for aglis flyers for generations. The mound slopes are covered in vegetation and individual nests.
D00CF65464E36F2100011043B5BA373C,Typhon's Rock
D00CF65464E36F350001104912482F60,"The Gate is a colloquial name for a narrow canyon with a river going through it. The area is a common passage for migrating aglis flyers, which has led to many Tosharans using it as a spot for wind fishing."
D00CF65464E36F350001104AAA0B97DF,The Gate
D00CF65464E370CB00011056B473FEDE,Excavation Site 12 is an Imperial dig site operated by the Imperial Department of Military Research. The site was built to excavate the impact of a meteorite and conduct research on potential military applications of the material.
D00CF65464E370CB00011057552CA7CC,Excavation Site 12
D00CF65464E370E20001105DCD6D3B22,"Research Station 57 is an Imperial facility operated by the Imperial Department of Military Research. The facility's focus is to collect samples from Akiva's flora and fauna in an effort to evaluate potential military applications. The project has led to several discoveries, mainly around toxicology from venomous plants and creatures."
D00CF65464E370E20001105ED19AF2A5,Research Station 57
D00CF65464E370F700011064BADE020B,"Kassina Outpost is a secret listening post on Akiva operated by the Imperial Security Bureau. While the Empire is officially supporting the satrapy on Akiva, the ISB is taking precautions to monitor activity in the system to locate rebel sympathizers and other anti-Imperial behavior."
D00CF65464E370F700011065F18F0DD4,Kassina Outpost
D00CF65464E3710A0001106BB01D4E91,"The Myrra droid factory is an old droid factory in the catacombs under Myrra. The factory was active during the Clone Wars and produced and reconfigured countless battle droids for the Confederacy of Independent Systems. Following the end of the war, the facility was abruptly abandoned."
D00CF65464E3710A0001106CC4D24710,Myrra Droid Factory
D00CF65464E3712100011072D1FAE8B2,"Achra Station is an old Trade Federation supply station that was used to resupply and refuel ships. Since the end of the Clone Wars, the space station has become an independent trade hub that attracts smugglers and black market merchants who want to make money outside of the satrapy's purview."
D00CF65464E37121000110730A0B4E0B,Achra Station
D00CF65464E3713300011079D71EA562,"The Hutt Cartel District in Myrra is a recent development, following the crime lord Surat Nuat's fragile alliance with the Hutts after the death of the Hutt Council. The Hutts have aggressively expanded into Myrra's droid black market, and have managed to carve out a significant market share for themselves."
D00CF65464E371330001107A5599E85B,Hutt Cartel District
D00CF65464E371CE00011080D5E14F39,"The Pyke Syndicate holds a sizable district in Myrra, staying in the satrapy's good graces by paying exuberant taxes for the land. While the satrapy claims to be strictly opposed to any form of organized crime, the Pykes have managed to bribe and coerce most influential representatives to stay almost untouchable."
D00CF65464E371CE000110818A00C3C3,Pyke Syndicate District
D00CF65464E372290001108795C1497F,"The Ahia-Ko people have left numerous temples behind before going extinct, and many of them feature advanced techniques that are still inspiring new architects on Akiva. Historians are still unraveling the meaning of different buildings and temples, discovering that the Ahia-Ko were complex people with different schools of thought."
D00CF65464E3722900011088B903A588,Ahia-Ko Temple
D00CF65464E372440001108E4098E43A,"The Cauldron is an old cruiser engine that crashed down into the Great Basin and has gradually transformed into an island. Over time, the island formed a small ecosystem with different plants, as well as creatures using it as their home and breeding ground."
D00CF65464E372440001108F570E3D66,The Cauldron
D00CF65464E37259000110953160C320,"The Temple of Ko-Shia is an ancient Ahia-Ko place of worship where it's believed that the Ahia-Ko people performed rituals to celebrate births and unions. The temple features several hidden aqueducts to channel water into the main chamber, as the Ahia-Ko believed water to be the source of life."
D00CF65464E372590001109606657AA3,Temple of Ko-Shia
D00CF65464E3726A0001109CE5846DE0,The Witch's Finger is an eye-catching cliff formation in the jungles of Akiva. The landmark was named by the ancient Ahia-Ko people and is located near one of their temples.
D00CF65464E3726A0001109DD9AAB983,Witch's Finger
D00CF65464E373E2000110AE2BF79EA3,"The Wellspring is an old bathhouse that was once a popular venue for locals to meet up for relaxation and recreation. The bathhouse was taken over by Crimson Dawn shortly after their arrival on Kijimi, and they now use it as an exclusive club for their members and allies."
D00CF65464E373E2000110AF26ACC955,The Wellspring
D00CF65464E37401000110B5C5E2E3B6,"The Ashiga Clan stronghold is a Dai Bendu monastery that was once the main headquarters for the monks of the Dai Bendu order. The stronghold has changed hands ever since the monks disappeared from Kijimi, but the Ashiga Clan laid claim to it shortly after arriving on Kijimi during the High Republic. It is commonly believed that whoever holds the monastery holds the city in their hands."
D00CF65464E37401000110B60C24D72B,Ashiga Clan Stronghold
D00CF65464E37417000110BC1A243F51,"The Ashiga Clan District is the area surrounding the Dai Bendu monastery, where the Ashiga Clan retains full control and owns all the properties. While the clan's influence extends to the spaceports and cantinas in the city, their footprint is comparatively small to the full scale of Kijimi City."
D00CF65464E37417000110BDDCDE4415,Ashiga Clan District
D00CF65464E37428000110C352A43F29,"The Thieves' Quarter is a district in Kijimi City that was once home to a religious group known as the Brotherhood of the Beatific Countenance. After the bandits and criminals chased out the monks from Kijimi, the quarter has become a refuge for thieves and smugglers who want to keep a low profile."
D00CF65464E37428000110C40CDA864F,Thieves' Quarter
D00CF65464E3746D000110CA84F64AA6,"The Queen Ashiga Statue is located near the entrance of the Ashiga Clan District and depicts the ruler of the clan, Queen Ashiga. The statue is built with several tactile inscriptions, creating an evocative presence for the eyeless Melitto members of the clan."
D00CF65464E3746D000110CB053D1806,Queen Ashiga Statue
D00CF65464E37487000110D1587B47B8,"Monk's Gate is a district near the northernmost wall of the Thieves' Quarter that connects with the Ashiga Clan's District. The Dai Bendu monks would traditionally pass through Monk's Gate when moving between the monasteries, temples and other sacred grounds, usually carrying lanterns to light their way."
D00CF65464E37487000110D299C2EA56,Monk's Gate
D00CF65464E37AAD000110DEF7264AB2,"Wayfar is an old trading post that eventually grew into a small settlement with residences, utilities and assorted services. Wayfar is under the protection of Sheriff Quint, a local Weequay woman who has managed to keep most Hutt enforcers at bay."
D00CF65464E37AAD000110DF0DF30734,Wayfar
D00CF65464E37AE7000110E5C4A1774B,"Chalmun's cantina is one of the most popular cantinas in Mos Eisley, with a reputation for being a hotbed for bounty hunters, smugglers, and fugitives. While the cantina is owned by a Wookiee named Chalmun, the bar is usually tended by other staff."
D00CF65464E37AE7000110E60D99D194,Chalmun's Cantina
D00CF65464E37AFE000110EC471ABBD2,Fort Sunfire is a supply depot on Tatooine that is used to hold and secure supplies to support the local Imperial detachment. The depot contains enough food and water rations to last several months.
D00CF65464E37AFE000110ED770456F7,Fort Sunfire
D00CF65464E37B16000110F31F3E3219,"The ancient lair was the habitat of a massive Krayt Dragon that has since been abandoned, leaving nothing but bantha bones behind. The large interior of the cave system, as well as the intimidating entrance, has led to a gang of bandits using it as their hideout."
D00CF65464E37B16000110F4B2DE0F97,Ancient Lair
D00CF65464E37B38000111011530EAE1,"Originally a monastery for the monks of the ancient B'omarr Order, Jabba's Palace is the residence and primary base of operations for the leader of the Hutt Cartel, Jabba the Hutt. The palace features a throne room, chambers for all of Jabba's workers, as well as a bestiary for Jabba's rancor and other wild creatures."
D00CF65464E37B3800011102D8455DDB,Jabba's Palace
D00CF65464E37BF500011108993B3548,"Mos Algo is an old mining town that was abandoned after the Mining Guild faced diminishing returns from the mining operation. Since then, the Hutt Cartel have been using the town as a shadowport for smuggling as well as a storage hub for certain cargo."
D00CF65464E37BF500011109C090A051,Mos Algo
D00CF65464E37C080001110F290DA423,"The abandoned moisture farm once belonged to the influential Darklighter family before it fell into dereliction. The broken vaporators have created a surge of moisture inside, causing the vegetation to grow exponentially."
D00CF65464E37C080001111066253076,Abandoned Moisture Farm
D00CF65464E37C2800011116C2C3DB3F,"This dead sarlacc has been left in the desert for years, leaving its massive body a strange landmark in the hostile desert landscape. Some scavengers have explored the insides of the sarlacc, in the hope of finding lost treasures."
D00CF65464E37C2800011117FE17E7EA,Dead Sarlacc
D00CF65464E37CFE0001111D8039E3E9,"The Hutt Cartel District is an area around Jabba's townhouse, his favored location when having to travel to Mos Eisley personally. The district contains a courtyard with some lush vegetation, a distinct difference from the dust-covered streets outside. The district is fully locked down by Jabba's enforcers where they openly handle illegal goods."
D00CF65464E37CFE0001111EA8B53280,Hutt Cartel District
D00CF65464E37D1A00011124BA74CD81,"The Hutt Cartel Outpost is built on the side of a canyon and features a set of different buildings. The outpost is built to extend Jabba's influence on Tatooine, giving the enforcers a hub from where they can handle tax collection from the locals before delivering it to Jabba in the palace."
D00CF65464E37D1A00011125673979EE,Hutt Cartel Outpost
D00CF65464E37D2C0001112B97BB7D49,The Pillar Forest is a section of plains with some unique rock formations that was once a notable landmark during some of Tatooine's podraces.
D00CF65464E37D2C0001112C1F30A8F6,Pillar Forest
D00CF65464E37D3B00011132756E1E50,"This massive skeleton is left untouched in the Tatooine sand dunes, and a sober reminder that even the greatest apex predators on the planet will eventually fall."
D00CF65464E37D3B00011133B947516F,Krayt Dragon Skeleton
D00CF65464E37D4E000111392FF9A57D,"The Arch is an underpass formed from the mountain after centuries of erosion, with a dirt road passing through that makes it an ideal passage for speeder drivers. The Arch has sometimes been know to attract bandits looking to ambush defenseless merchants."
D00CF65464E37D4E0001113AAC695EA0,The Arch
