7110821464EC5CCE0000AF9C3D3E2CAE,Last thing I do for you
7110821464EC5CCE0000AF9DAE8F426D,"Alright, here's the passcode to the gate off the square. 

Don't ask me for anymore favors. I'm done. I won't help you again so don't even ask.

Passcode: 13QWN"
7110821464EC5CD70000AF9F32ABAF2D,Locked Gate
7110821464EC5CD70000AFA0FE3CAE8A,Someone left a keycard with coordinates to a locked gate in Kijimi City. There is probably something valuable inside.
7110821464EC5E7D0002D437FEB325AD,Gate Passcode
7110821464EC5ECA0002D440D224A6C3,A datapad has revealed the password to one of the locked gates.
7110821464EC60940002D446064E396D,Phase 1 Instructions
7110821464EC60940002D44765F17E4D,"1. Break into the gate near the cantina and steal one of the keys to the Crimson Dawn vault.
2. Plant the key on Pyke operative.
3. Inform Crimson Dawn of the Pyke's betrayal.

Trust me this will work! 

Here is the passcode: 2X3FH"
7110821464EC61F10002D4495B429F7F,Gate Passcode
7110821464EC61F10002D44A2CB0402B,"Some thieves were planning to break-in and steal valuables behind a locked gate. Luckily, the passcode was easy to crack."
7110821464EC64A50002D4555C9EE74D,You owe me!
7110821464EC64A50002D456606B61D0,"The bribe was more than we expected. But here it is (usual cypher). Gate is located in an alley near the Ashiga District. It should be nice and quiet around sunrise. I want half of whatever you find!

remember, you Were alwayS the ONE FOUR mE.

Maybe we should use a different cypher."
7110821464EC65410002D458E7B60654,Secret Button
7110821464EC65410002D4594CB93160,According to a datapad message there is a secret button to open one of the Kijimi City gates.
7110821464EC66960002D466F3DFE651,We're in
7110821464EC66960002D46743EEC5B3,"There's a button hidden behind a brick on the right of the gate. How have we never noticed it before?

Meet me tonight and we'll look inside. Lady Qi'ra is certain they're planning something, so we need to gather as much evidence as possible.

Don't back out on me again, you hear? Fathier tables can wait until tomorrow."
7110821464EC669B0002D469201C13D7,RE: Locked out... again
7110821464EC669B0002D46A2CFD94EB,I put a spare keycard for you on the roof next to the gate. It's a bit too narrow for someone of your... stature. You might have to send someone smaller up there.
7110821464EC6AA00002D46FD77DEED3,Spare Keycard
7110821464EC6AA00002D470DE7F6CA3,Someone has hidden a spare keycard to a locked gate in Kijimi City.
