D4F6307964F0A6DE000D9007F31050B8,Hey!
D4F6307964F0A6DE000D9008B690D3AE,"I tried to fight, but those stun blasters really pack a punch. By the time I woke up, the Pykes had taken off with the robuma and trashed the place.

I hid the family savings. You'll find them on the clifftop behind the farm. All I took was enough credits to buy a ticket to Renpalli Station. Figured I'd hitch a ride to another planet from there.

If anyone asks, tell them I didn't make it."
