5600F8C265020ED1000A035EE2513077,VIPER 058-V-2353 REPORT
5600F8C265020ED1000A035F9E111C73,"The droid was sent to Vassek based on intel from a captured smuggler. It scanned a settlement on the planet for six standard weeks, recording conversations between local farmers. A farmer named Roni expressed actionable plans to steal Imperial generators. An ISB agent was deployed and captured the suspect along with two adult members of the family."
5600F8C265020F28000A0366BF876F89,Security protocol
5600F8C265020F28000A03678991AB77,"Reminder to all technicians that diagnostics equipment must be turned in for inspection at the end of the shift. Failure to comply will be met with severe consequences. This is an Imperial Security Bureau facility, not some automated signal station in the Outer Rim."
5600F8C265021020000A037E250F2E53,Kadiopa experiment 9484-2
5600F8C265021020000A037FD2692B98,"In order to evaluate ideal interrogation techniques, two groups of prisoners were exposed to either an IT-O droid or a bor of the Mairan to exude false intel provided by a plant. Both groups gave up the information within the expected time frame, but the bor of the Mairan left several prisoners with permanent neurological damage."
5600F8C265021080000A03960DE8CB07,VIPER 071-V-8852 SCHEDULE
5600F8C265021080000A0397EF9DDFD9,"Location: Plexis

Duration: 8 standard weeks

Mission: Observe and record spaceport activity for elements of spice and weapon smugglers. Any sign of a Corellian YT-2400 light freighter takes highest priority due to a suspect ship being heavily involved in a local smuggling ring."
