5EA540EF65168E4B0000C1B26A077C74,"ACCESSIBILITY OPTION
Minigame difficulty"
5EA540EF65168E960000C1B30EA49356,"Nix can do many things, such as steal, distract and sabotage.
Use <gameaction src=""HoldPetMode""> to reveal all of Nix's possible actions in the current location."
5EA540EF65168E960000C1B4D5502AAF,Nix
5EA540EF651691E50000C1B8E369D84E,"Use <gameaction src=""TriggerPetPulse""> for Nix to reveal enemies and interactive elements within a radius, even through walls."
5EA540EF651691E50000C1B9E244A6D2,Nix Sense
5EA540EF651692620000C1BD021F0703,"Use <gameaction src=""Jump""> to climb on walls or hang from ledges."
5EA540EF651692620000C1BE75A8123C,Climbing
5EA540EF651692D10000C1C227951891,"Sneak up on enemies and press <gameaction src=""Takedown""> to perform a takedown. 
Some enemies are more resilient and will require specific tools to take down."
5EA540EF651692D10000C1C3425054FE,Takedown
5EA540EF6516933A0000C1C71E5FBE2A,"Use <gameaction src=""Melee""> to attack enemies in melee. Droids and heavily armored enemies are resistant to melee attacks."
5EA540EF6516933A0000C1C84F11EE35,Brawling
5EA540EF651693A20000C1CC15027CB8,"Use <gameaction src=""Shoot""> to fire the blaster, even when moving, or take aim with <gameaction src=""Aim""> and fire <gameaction src=""Shoot""> to gain more precision. Keep in mind that regular plasma shots are less effective against shields and droids."
5EA540EF651693A20000C1CDE4D90478,Blaster
5EA540EF651693A20000C1CEAA4BF2B3,"ACCESSIBILITY OPTION
Auto-perfect cooling
Aim assist"
5EA540EF651694620000C1D2B2312763,"Use Stun Shot for a silent, non-lethal takedown against humanoids (ineffective against droids).
Stun Shot with <gameaction src=""FireStun"">.
Once fired, Stun Shot must recharge before it can be used again.
Stealth takedowns or melee finishers increases Stun Shot recharge speed."
5EA540EF651694620000C1D3B0EFFB0E,Stun Shot
5EA540EF651694620000C1D4BE692DC7,"ACCESSIBILITY OPTION
Aim assist"
5EA540EF651694FE0000C1D82E032E53,"Select the ion module by using <gameaction src=""WeaponModuleCycle""> to unleash ionized attacks.
Ionized attacks make humanoids vulnerable to takedown and are very effective against droids and shields."
5EA540EF651694FE0000C1D9D689F03A,Ion Module
5EA540EF651694FE0000C1DA9C076F51,"ACCESSIBILITY OPTION
Auto-perfect cooling
Aim assist"
5EA540EF651695B00000C1DED584105B,"The power module is effective against groups of enemies as well as vulnerable walls. Select the power module using <gameaction src=""WeaponModuleHoldSelect"">."
5EA540EF651695B00000C1DF42F70BBF,Power Module
5EA540EF651695B00000C1E0D420DBBD,"ACCESSIBILITY OPTION
Auto-perfect cooling
Aim assist"
5EA540EF6516961C0000C1E48F51426B,"When the Adrenaline meter is full, use <gameaction src=""AdrenalineRushUse""> to slow down time and fire <gameaction src=""AdrenalineRushExecute""> shots before the timer runs out.
It will take out two targets if possible."
5EA540EF6516961C0000C1E53547A9FC,Adrenaline Rush
5EA540EF6516969E0000C1E940459209,"When the Adrenaline meter is full, activate Adrenaline Rush using <gameaction src=""AdrenalineRushUse""> and quickly target enemies with <gameaction src=""CrackShotTag""> before time runs out, or press <gameaction src=""AdrenalineRushExecute""> to fire early. Normal enemies are defeated instantly, while Elite enemies are more resilient and can only be Staggered."
5EA540EF6516969E0000C1EADC157A48,Adrenaline Rush
5EA540EF6516975D0000C1F37D2D207F,"Select grenades with <gameaction src=""GadgetToggle""> and <gameaction src=""GrenadeHold"">.
Throw it with <gameaction src=""ThrowableThrowPress"">."
5EA540EF6516975D0000C1F4A5CFD182,Grenade
5EA540EF651698DE0000C1F86712A50E,"Committing crimes near Imperials will lead to becoming Wanted, and continued acts will increase the Wanted level further.
When Wanted, you can stay out of sight to lose it and return to normal.
At the highest Wanted level, the Empire will unleash its full force to attack Kay. The only way to escape is to slice a bounty terminal in a high-security area or bribe a corrupt Imperial Officer."
5EA540EF651698DE0000C1F902341D6D,Wanted System
5EA540EF65169DC00000C1FD91650FED,"Equip the holotracker with <gameaction src=""GadgetToggle""> and <gameaction src=""HoloReaderHold"">.

The holotracker has two operating modes: it first displays landscape holomaps <b>indicating marked locations to reach</b>. Upon reaching marked locations, <b>visual and audio cues can be aligned</b> to the correct frequency to discover hidden vaults.

 That last operating mode is triggered automatically near <b>Smuggler Caches</b>, leading you to their locations."
5EA540EF65169DC00000C1FE319B2659,Holotracker
5EA540EF65169DE20000C2008459A621,"Use <gameaction src=""GadgetToggle""> and <gameaction src=""SmokeGrenadeUse""> to create a temporary smoke screen to escape from a sticky situation."
