D00CF654651EDAAF0009A9CDB88B110F,Jet Kordo's Legacy part 1
D00CF654651EDAAF0009A9CE195ECF20,Jet Kordo explains the holotracker to his crew.
D00CF654651EDADA0009A9DC1A8B91FE,Jet Kordo's Legacy part 2
D00CF654651EDADA0009A9DD686327D2,Jet Kordo talks to H1-0N about a traitor.
