D00CF654651EDB020009A9F3D409CDCE,Jet Kordo tries to find Dorhal's recording.
D00CF654651EDB120009A9FD5018A916,Jet Kordo's Legacy part 5
D00CF654651EDB120009A9FE8F26D3DB,Jet Kordo warns H1-0N about being compromised.
D00CF654651EDB2C0009AA080B414FAE,Jet Kordo's Legacy part 6
D00CF654651EDB2C0009AA091674D215,Jet Kordo talks to Raatha about payment.
D00CF654651EDB460009AA1331F7B0C8,Jet Kordo's Legacy part 7
D00CF654651EDB460009AA143D5CCE4D,Jet Kordo confronts Naist.
D00CF654651EDB580009AA1EE5D2D1E9,Jet Kordo's Legacy part 8
D00CF654651EDB580009AA1F59A81F1F,Jet Kordo makes final arrangements.
D00CF654651EDBA10009AA33C5D2FB0E,"Hello, this is Jet Kordo. It's almost time to do this job, but first we need some precautions.

That thing you're holding is a holotracker. Trade league members, such as myself, use them to find vaults to store contraband. But I've taken a couple of those vaults off the grid. No one's going to find them but us.

Just don't lose that holotracker and the discs. Because we don't want anyone else to find these vaults and take the score.

I have spoken."
D00CF654651EDBBF0009AA37DDBF0879,"<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">H1-0N:</font> Jet. Are you here? My sensors-- What are you doing? Jet? Who is that on the ground?

<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">JET KORDO:</font> H1-0N! I need you to remain calm. Dorhal sold us out, so I had to take care of some things.

<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">H1-0N:</font> What did you do..?

<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">JET KORDO:</font> Dorhal betrayed us, and I can prove it. He put the whole crew, and the heist itself, at risk. We need to go to the backup vault. I will prove it to you."
D00CF654651EDBCF0009AA3BAFCCA1C7,"I had a great time in Nar Shaddaa. You really know how to host. Showed a guy a good time. I'm just confirming the deal is still on. Kordo's gonna hit the palace tonight, so be ready. Oh, and keep a clean perimeter watch. He's got a hunter outside with killer aim.

I'm looking forward to doing more business with ya. I'll send you the coordinates to another vault here on Akiva, you can contact me there."
D00CF654651EDBDA0009AA3FCB007AB9,"<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">JET KORDO:</font> H1-0N, the recording was here... It must have been in the other vault...

<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">H1-0N:</font> Jet, this is a serious accusation. We had Dorhal vetted.

<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">JET KORDO:</font> I am positive! Dorhal has been in contact with the Hutts and gave them information about our plans. It is the only explanation for how the Hutts knew we were coming. Dorhal told them everything!

<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">H1-0N:</font> Are you alright, Jet? Your biometrics appear unstable...

<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">JET KORDO:</font> I am fine... you must go to the other vault here on Akiva and listen to the recording. I will visit Raatha and resolve that matter."
D00CF654651EDBF50009AA4B11E4E028,"H1-0N, this is Jet Kordo. I am leaving you a message in case you are wondering where we are. Raatha claims that she was followed and that this location is compromised. We are moving to the other vault for safety. Be careful and don't trust anyone."
D00CF654651EDC010009AA4F626867AD,"<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">JET KORDO:</font> No, Raatha, you are not getting Dorhal's cut.

<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">RAATHA:</font> Hey, I did my part!

<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">JET KORDO:</font> Not particularly well.

<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">RAATHA:</font> Kriff's sake, Jet! I told you, they moved security inside! I couldn't get a shot!

<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">JET KORDO:</font> You're a professional bounty hunter but you couldn't land a single shot. It makes me wonder if you and Dorhal--

<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">RAATHA:</font> Hey! I took those goons off your back when you escaped. I'm in this as much as you!

<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">H1-0N:</font> Jet, she's correct. If it wasn't for Raatha, you would have gotten caught.

<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">JET KORDO:</font> And that was her fault to begin with.

<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">RAATHA:</font> Fine! I'm leaving. But don't come to me when you need a crew, Jet, because I'm never working with you again."
D00CF654651EDC100009AA53DA3B6EBB,"<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">JET KORDO:</font> Naist? Please tell me you've got some good news...

<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">NAIST:</font> Jet? Jet... I'm back here...

<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">JET KORDO:</font> What happened to you?

<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">NAIST:</font> That doshing Rodian didn't have my back. Had to handle the Hutts myself.

<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">H1-0N:</font> Naist, let me assess your injuries.

<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">NAIST:</font> It's fine... just give me my cut and I'm out.

<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">JET KORDO:</font> Are you saying you didn't bring anything with you?

<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">NAIST:</font> You kidding me now, Kordo? Does it look like I could have carried anything here? I'm lucky I got out at all!

<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">JET KORDO:</font> You don't have any idea what I did to plan this job! If you think that I'm giving you a single credit...

<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">H1-0N:</font> Jet, please. Stop.

<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">JET KORDO:</font> H1-0N..? H1-0N, can you stand..? No, this is not good... Come here, I will help you out of here."
D00CF654651EDCEF0009AA5D0A430436,"H1-0N... H1-0N, this is Jet Kordo... though I suspect you can't hear me anymore.
 
I never meant for this to happen. The crew betrayed me and it didn't leave me much of a choice...
 
I guess it's true that this job is not meant for friends. It's a lot easier to split the credits when it's just yourself.
 
There is nothing I can do for you now, H1-0N. I have to disappear and leave the Trailblazer behind.
 
I just need you to know that everything I did was with the best intentions. I suppose I just... work best alone."
