9D01D2176527DC98000C81C6E1C45181,Regarding the B'omarr Monks
9D01D2176527DC98000C81C79989219F,"Remember that the B'omarr Monks are not to be disturbed. They remain under the great exalted Jabba's protection. Let what happened to Crakka be a lesson to everyone. There are many fates worse than death.

Bib Fortuna"
9D01D2176527E138000C82248278EA32,Pateesa food
9D01D2176527E138000C8225C37C18C3,"Master Fortuna,

Pateesa is sick again. He can't eat more detonators. Bounty hunters are bad for him. He needs good meat and grains for ten more days.

Malakili"
9D01D217652812C5000483A9055BFE08,New creature
9D01D217652812C5000483AA9B330B3B,"The specimen is a warm-blooded male mammal. Six head tendrils, large eyes, retractable claws, mouth full of sharp teeth. The beast master was bitten and is being examined for possible poisoning. 

We have caged it and will give it a fifth’s portion of gruel and meat. If Jabba grows bored with it, we will feed it to the nexu."
