7110821465293A960001585FD52BF90E,Abandoned Hideout
7110821465293AA900015863436CB135,"Crimson Dawn have identified the location of an old hideout, which is being heavily guarded by the Empire."
7110821465293AAC0001586B8A5E2F0B,The hideout is west of Daroona House in North Jundland.
7110821465293AEB0001587542575750,Abandoned Mine
7110821465293AED0001587911194C6F,The Mining Guild had a mining operation on Tatooine. They left in a hurry and abandoned whatever they unearthed.
7110821465293AF2000158813766A6CC,One of the mines is located in the north-west corner of the North Jundland Wastes.
7110821465293B4A0001588BFF20E4C6,Smuggler Camp
7110821465293B4F0001588E065B20DF,"The whereabouts of a smugglers camp has been leaked to the Imperials, who are preparing to confiscate any contraband."
7110821465293B6100015894273A4D9A,The camp is north-west of an Imperial bunker in the Western Dune Sea.
7110821465293C95000158AD51EBC1E3,Dune Sea Bunker
7110821465293C96000158B0F64DA512,An officer ordered a shipment of blaster parts to be moved to the Imperial Outpost 42.
7110821465293C9A000158B68FE69AB7,A Blaster Recirculator can be found in a bunker located on a cliff on the eastern edge of the Western Dune Sea.
7110821465293CD5000158BF3B2EEAEF,Abandoned Fuel Station
7110821465293F03000158F88B7C10C8,Tusken Camp Vantage Point
7110821465293F67000159011E4C27CC,Tusken Camp Vantage Point
7110821465293F67000159026388977E,"I've been watching the Tusken out in the Jundland Wastes. They are highly territorial, often firing slug throwers at passing speeders.

I'll try to get a closer look. If you don't hear back from me, assume the worst."
7110821465293FA400015904B6D2608A,Status Report - Western Hideout
7110821465293FA400015905C9DF43DB,"It is unclear who the hideout belonged to, but I can confirm that the Empire has not found a way inside.

When the Dawn is ready to move out of Daroona House, head west into North Jundland. You’ll see the hideout across the ravine.

The Empire are patrolling, so prepare for a fight."
7110821465293FC5000159072947533F,URGENT: CMC REPORT
7110821465293FC5000159080CB4B0AD,"Location 2 is closing down as part of the new corporate strategy. Any personnel not already transferred to Bestine, Mos Espa or Anchorhead must prepare for departure.

Tunnels are to be sealed by charges and the pit closed. Any equipment not already retrieved by Logistics will be locked up and left on site."
71108214652940260001590A894C96AC,Shipments List
71108214652940260001590B9A81F211,"Modified Skipray came in with the medicine crates today – delivered by a one-eyed Rodian and a Devaronian.

Now we have the shipment, I think our friends at the Imperial outpost might appreciate an “accidental transmission” with the smugglers.

Don't be too specific. Just imply something shady is going on north-west of their Dune Sea bunker. Something to grab their attention."
71108214652940730001590D3B0C201F,Loan Denied
71108214652940730001590ED6182824,"I looked into your situation and I'm sorry, but I can't help you. 

The farm's a write-off and the bigger problem is the money you owe to the Hutts. I'd be risking my neck giving you a loan against them. 

Maybe it's time to move on."
71108214652940A900015910B83FA163,Thank you!
71108214652940A900015911E26962A3,"I don't know what you said to the officer, but I'm being transferred to Bestine. I'm on the eastern border, so it shouldn't take long to fly over. Then I can thank you in person!

I've been in this Dune Sea far too long. I see nothing but sand in my sleep. I cannot get out of this bunker fast enough."
71108214652940CB0001591354D658D3,Abandoned Fuel Station
71108214652940F60001591674E7AA8D,Tips for Desert Traveling!
71108214652940F60001591792117402,"Remember to travel in a group when you're crossing the desert. There's a big monster living under the dunes. Well, I say monster but truthfully, we don't know what it is...

Don't worry! There's a simple rule to surviving an encounter: you don't need to be faster than the monster, you just need to be faster than the person beside you."
71108214652941120001591993E2EF6D,Crashed Speeder
71108214652941120001591ADA188C5E,"Blindfolded. No hands. On fire. If that won't impress him, I don't know what will."
71108214652941300001591C55973143,Get me a new ship!
71108214652941300001591DD18A251B,"I made the transit from Bothawui with my associate by chartered cargo vessel. Captain was a Twi'lek who came recommended by YOUR people. 

Well, she left the cargo and took off with my secretary. I'm not sure it's entirely wise to be sitting on unprotected payload in this crime-infested armpit of a system!

Get me a new ship and fast!"
7B3BBC61652951BB00717FDEA5090E44,Treasure retrieved
