8FD81D5165280F99001FB75F12EB90DB,SK01
8FD81D5165280F99001FB76058954782,"Twelve parts krill
One part spob
One half part akaba spice
One quarter part kiliducha
Combine into a base
Ferment for eight to ten cycles
Strain the mixture
Distil, filter, dilute, and bottle"
