8FD81D51652D52B1000374ADCE72D29E,"Having crashed on Toshara, Kay has teamed up with a mechanic named Waka who will help repair the Trailblazer. Waka suggests going to Mirogana to pick up a job from the Pyke Syndicate in order to get credits for the repairs."
8FD81D51652D5748000375178930C8EF,Waka has a potential lead on a nav computer for the Trailblazer and wants to meet to discuss it.
8FD81D51652D57890003756FC7DFE3BB,Gorak has a job for Kay that he can't talk about over comms. He's asked to meet at Makal's Gambling Parlor.
8FD81D51652E40560004D5B9F943D34E,Kay has just gotten familiar with the underworld on Toshara but can probably get some more good advice from a veteran like Danka.
8FD81D51652E40BC0004D5DD0D9926DD,"Speaking to Danka, Kay has realized that she needs to upgrade her tools to stay effective in the underworld. Danka has a lead on a merchant who can provide parts for Kay to upgrade her blaster."
8FD81D51652E4B640004D7450E0F2E6E,Waka has found a nav computer that will get the Trailblazer ready for hyperspace travel. The nav computer is located in a High Republic shipwreck.
