8FD81D516530095C0002D8B451BB8F3F,I quit!
8FD81D516530095C0002D8B58FF74AC3,"Sending out this message to the team to let you all know I quit. Got into a disagreement and punched out the line boss. It is what it is. Collecting my Bryar Pistol and leaving tonight. My old crewmate's been working on Nar Shaddaa and already found me work. If you wanna get off Toshara, come find me. I'll be staying at Smuggler's Bar. Speak to the bartender. He's impatient and goes on about people always causing trouble, but he'll make sure you find me. Otherwise good luck."
8FD81D51653009D30002D8BC4AFC58B2,The Pyke Informant
8FD81D51653009D30002D8BDA1497DEE,"The directive is to take a 'soft hand' approach with the Pyke informant. Flatter him. The armed guards are for 'his protection'. Get him talking. We want to know who Gorak is in business with and what his expansion interests are. Once you get everything you can out of the informant, his disposal is up to your discretion."
91908ED2652FC9E60000C0EC4AFDFACF,Encrypted Messages
