F4D8AE26652D051A0000F6AA0F096B99,"<font preset=""Light Bodytext"">Increases Kay's maximum </font><font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">Health</font><font preset=""Light Bodytext"">.</font>"
F4D8AE26652D0592000108005F1526A1,"<font preset=""Light Bodytext"">Allows Kay to quickly react to nearby alerted enemies and delay their reaction. Press </font><gameaction src=""BlabbermouthUse""><font preset=""Light Bodytext""> when prompted to briefly <b>Distract</b> the alerted enemy.</font>"
F4D8AE26652D05E0000108025DE31795,"<font preset=""Light Bodytext"">Allows <b>Fast-Talk</b> to affect every nearby enemy. Press </font><gameaction src=""BlabbermouthUse""><font preset=""Light Bodytext""> when prompted to briefly <b>Distract</b> every enemy within a medium radius.</font>"
F4D8AE26652D06000001080467A22231,"<font preset=""Light Bodytext"">Unlocks the ability to see and fulfill <b>Personal Requests</b>. Find <b>Merchants</b> with the </font><font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">Requests</font><font preset=""Light Bodytext""> category to find new opportunities. </font>"
F4D8AE26653000760000EB7A2395650A,"<font preset=""Light Bodytext""><b>Nix</b> will alert Kay when valuable <b>Containers</b> are nearby, and <b>Containers</b> in range can now be highlighted by pressing </font><gameaction src=""TriggerPetPulse"">"
F4D8AE266530008F0000EB7C4E9F0872,"<font preset=""Light Bodytext"">Enhances <b>Kay's Speeder</b> with a <b>Boost</b> engine. Press </font><gameaction src=""Boost""><font preset=""Light Bodytext""> while on the <b>Speeder</b> for a quick burst of speed.</font>"
F4D8AE266530009D0000EB7EA05926F7,"<font preset=""Light Bodytext"">Press </font><gameaction src=""GadgetWheelOpen""> and <gameaction src=""SmokeGrenadeUse""><font preset=""Light Bodytext""> to drop a <b>Smoke Bomb</b> at Kay's feet, creating a dense cloud of smoke that obscures vision.</font>"
F4D8AE26653000A90000EB80F15AED7A,"<font preset=""Light Bodytext"">Increases </font><font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">Bacta Vial</font><font preset=""Light Bodytext""> and </font><font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">Grenade</font><font preset=""Light Bodytext""> carrying capacity by <b>1</b>.</font>"
F4D8AE26653000B40000EB82D522A5FA,"<font preset=""Light Bodytext"">Increase the amount of </font><font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">Bacta Vials</font><font preset=""Light Bodytext""> and </font><font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">Grenades</font><font preset=""Light Bodytext""> Kay can carry by 1 each.</font>"
F4D8AE26653000DC0000EB87A76F5251,"<font preset=""Light Bodytext"">Allows Kay to execute <b>Melee</b> attacks by pressing</font> <gameaction src=""Melee""><font preset=""Light Bodytext"">. Press repeatedly to chain attacks and perform a <b>Melee Finisher</b>.</font>"
F4D8AE266530E7970000EB93FAE04758,"<font preset=""Light Bodytext"">Doubles the distance at which <b>Nix</b> can reveal enemies with <b>Nix Sense</b>. Press </font><gameaction src=""TriggerPetPulse""><font preset=""Light Bodytext""> to use <b>Nix Sense</b>.</font>"
F4D8AE266530E7C00000EB9A9C54E0BD,"<font preset=""Light Bodytext"">Increases <b>Pick-Up Weapon</b> ammo capacity by </font><font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">25%</font><font preset=""Light Bodytext"">.</font>"
F4D8AE266530E7EF0000EB9CA568B6C9,"<font preset=""Light Bodytext"">Tap </font><gameaction src=""Trailblazer_180Maneuver_Tutorial""><font preset=""Light Bodytext""> to perform a <b>Top Roll Maneuver</b>, quickly turning the <b>Trailblazer</b> in the opposite direction.</font>"
F4D8AE266530E7FA0000EB9EA044AC28,"<font preset=""Light Bodytext"">Hold </font><gameaction src=""Trailblazer_360Maneuver""><font preset=""Light Bodytext""> to perform a <b>Loop Maneuver</b> and quickly reposition the <b>Trailblazer</b> behind enemy pursuers.</font>"
F4D8AE266530EEEA0000EDC1FE909E30,"<font preset=""Light Bodytext"">The <b>Trailblazer's Turret</b> is repaired, enabling its use in combat, and allowing for upgrades and new types to be installed.</font>"
F4D8AE266530EEFC0000EDC3B4E42893,"<font preset=""Light Bodytext"">Increases the explosion radius and damage of <b>Grenades</b> by <b>50%</b>.</font>"
F4D8AE266530EF0B0000EDC55444C8A3,"<font preset=""Light Bodytext"">Increases the amount of <b>Health</b> instantly restored by </font><font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">Bacta Vials</font><font preset=""Light Bodytext"">. Press </font><gameaction src=""MedkitUse""><font preset=""Light Bodytext""> to heal.</font>"
F4D8AE266530EF1A0000EDC72BE748BB,"<font preset=""Light Bodytext"">Allows Kay to tip the odds in her favor when throwing <b>Dice</b> in <b>Kessel Sabacc</b>. Accept the prompt during the <b>Dice Throwing Phase</b> to attempt the <b>Cheat</b>.</font>"
F4D8AE266530EF3F0000EDCAA60E2A23,"Allows <b>Nix</b> to run up and arm any <b>Grenades</b> an enemy is carrying, causing them to explode."
F4D8AE266530EF4E0000EDCC8764E927,"<font preset=""Light Bodytext"">Lowers <b>Merchant</b> prices and increases the amount of <b>Credits</b> received when selling items by <b>10%</b>.</font>"
F4D8AE266530F42F0000EDD6E7FFB5F1,"<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">Adrenaline Rush</font> can now be used more effectively from the <b>Speeder</b>, allowing for automatic targeting of nearby enemy speeders."
F4D8AE266530F43C0000EDD7DEF833D7,"<font preset=""Light Bodytext"">Increases Kay's maximum </font><font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">Health</font><font preset=""Light Bodytext"">.</font>"
F4D8AE266530F46E0000EDDB375AF8A5,Increases maximum number of <b>Adrenaline Rush</b> targets by <b>1</b>.
F4D8AE266530F47D0000EDDD2E526B0D,"<b>Elite</b> enemies can now be targeted twice during <b>Adrenaline Rush</b>, allowing them to be defeated instantly, rather than <b>Staggered</b>."
F4D8AE266530F5E80000EDE5DE4A3D50,"<font preset=""Light Bodytext"">Enables a <b>Roll Maneuver</b>, increasing <b>Dodge</b> distance and making it easier to avoid damage. 
Hold </font><gameaction src=""Trailblazer_UpgradedDodgeLeft""><font preset=""Light Bodytext""> or </font><gameaction src=""Trailblazer_UpgradedDodgeRight""><font preset=""Light Bodytext""> to perform a <b>Dodge Roll</b>.</font>"
F4D8AE266530F60A0000EDE7C44A0636,"<font preset=""Light Bodytext"">Gain a surge of <b>Adrenaline</b> after a <b>Fast-Talk</b> or attempt at escaping <b>Arrest</b>.</font>"
F4D8AE266530F61C0000EDE84EFC12AE,Gain more <b>Adrenaline</b> for every shot or near-miss after a <b>Quickdraw</b>.
F4D8AE266530F6260000EDEA9A1E1443,Deal additional damage when not in combat and shooting from the hip with a <b>Quickdraw</b>.
F4D8AE266530F6420000EDEDF988D5EE,"<font preset=""Light Bodytext"">Provides the components needed to craft the </font><font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">Plasma Module's Heavy Configuration</font><font preset=""Light Bodytext""> for <b>Kay's Blaster</b>. Visit the <b>Workbench</b> aboard the <b>Trailblazer</b> to craft and upgrade <b>Kay's Blaster Modules</b>.</font>"
F4D8AE266530F64F0000EDEF137B07B1,"<font preset=""Light Bodytext"">Allows Kay to perform a </font><font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">Double Draw</font><font preset=""Light Bodytext""> in <b>Kessel Sabacc</b>. Accept the prompt during the <b>Draw Phase</b> to attempt the <b>Cheat</b>.</font>"
F4D8AE266531162C0000EDF711A050B5,"<font preset=""Light Bodytext"">Allows <b>Kay's Speeder</b> to ride over water, enhancing its traversal capabilities.</font>"
F4D8AE26653141B10000EDF96A544204,"<font preset=""Light Bodytext"">In addition to its base effect, </font><font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">Smoke Bomb</font><font preset=""Light Bodytext""> now deals </font><font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">Ion</font> damage<font preset=""Light Bodytext"">, which temporarily disables devices and disrupts <b>Droids</b> in the affected area. Press </font><gameaction src=""GadgetWheelOpen""> and <gameaction src=""SmokeGrenadeUse""><font preset=""Light Bodytext""> to use the <b>Smoke Bomb</b>.</font>"
F4D8AE26653141BD0000EDFBCFEF40A4,"<font preset=""Light Bodytext""><b>Nix</b> will occasionally find extra </font><font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">Materials</font><font preset=""Light Bodytext""> and </font><font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">Valuables</font><font preset=""Light Bodytext""> when searching <b>Containers</b>.</font>"
F4D8AE26653141D70000EDFF804DDD54,"<font preset=""Light Bodytext"">Increases <b>Crouched</b> movement speed.</font>"
F4D8AE266531437B0000EE0AE1E637E9,"<font preset=""Light Bodytext"">Increases the amount of <font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">Energy</font><font preset=""Light Bodytext""> for the </font><font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">Slicing Kit</font><font preset=""Light Bodytext""> by <b>2</b>. Use </font><font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">Energy</font><font preset=""Light Bodytext""> to activate </font><font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">Jokers</font><font preset=""Light Bodytext""> during the slicing process.</font>"
F4D8AE26653143C60000EE0F3571D5A9,"<font preset=""Light Bodytext"">Kay moves more silently, making it easier to sneak around enemies undetected.</font>"
F4D8AE26653144040000EE1466843F18,"<font preset=""Light Bodytext"">Increases the amount of <font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">Energy</font><font preset=""Light Bodytext""> for the </font><font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">Slicing Kit</font><font preset=""Light Bodytext""> by <b>2</b>. Use </font><font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">Energy</font><font preset=""Light Bodytext""> to activate </font><font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">Jokers</font><font preset=""Light Bodytext""> during the slicing process.</font>"
F4D8AE26653144200000EE16FF9540AC,"<font preset=""Light Bodytext"">Allows Kay to decrypt previously encrypted </font><font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">Separatist Datadiscs</font><font preset=""Light Bodytext"">, which could reveal some useful information.</font>"
F4D8AE26653144450000EE1AA4261394,"<font preset=""Light Bodytext"">Increases the amount of <b>Health</b> instantly restored by </font><font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">Bacta Vials</font><font preset=""Light Bodytext"">. Press </font><gameaction src=""MedkitUse""><font preset=""Light Bodytext""> to heal.</font>"
F4D8AE26653144580000EE1C3FE99E7A,"<font preset=""Light Bodytext"">After suffering </font><font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">Explosive</font><font preset=""Light Bodytext""> damage, immediately recover some lost <b>Health</b>.</font>"
F4D8AE26653144660000EE1E47211D78,"<font preset=""Light Bodytext""><b>Nix</b> will automatically attack another nearby enemy when given the <b>Attack</b> command.</font>"
F4D8AE2665314C120006FD2A5183ADDE,"<font preset=""Light Bodytext"">Upgrades the <b>Smoke Bomb</b> with a concussion effect that leaves enemies in the area </font><font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">Staggered</font><font preset=""Light Bodytext""> for <b>2</b> seconds.</font>"
F4D8AE2665314C220006FD2B8688119C,"<font preset=""Light Bodytext"">Gadget able to connect to advanced, terminal-less devices. Interact with a device by pressing </font><gameaction src=""Interact""><font preset=""Light Bodytext""> to <b>Slice</b> it.</font>"
F4D8AE2665314C510006FD2ED8AA4856,Deal extra damage when shooting an enemy unaware of Kay's position.
