7110821465326ADF000611343B110942,"The terminal had useful information about the base, including where to find valuables."
7110821465326B270006113755BADA5E,Imperial Comm Station
7110821465326B2700061138D244F240,"The terminal had useful information about the base, including where to find valuable items."
7110821465326B4B0006113BA77CDFB6,Imperial Bio Research Lab
7110821465326B4B0006113C0CEEBDF3,The terminal had useful information about the base. Including where to find valuables.
7110821465327B4C0006114B3DDAE963,Vault Access
7110821465327B4C0006114C05B09066,There is a vault in the Imperial compound and the access code has been revealed.
7110821465327B4C0006114E8B155444,The vault building is in the center of the Imperial compound.
7110821465327BEE000611601834F470,Courtyard Cargo
7110821465327BEE0006116121F88384,A storage area in the Imperial compound has a crate filled with valuable supplies.
7110821465327BEE00061162C4333A96,The crate is being stored in the shuttle cargo bay in the west of the compound.
7110821465327BFF0006116C9D32D0B3,Tube Lab Data
7110821465327BFF0006116D729D05AF,A datadisk containing sensitive information about the Empire can be collected from a terminal in the Imperial compound.
7110821465327BFF0006116E3A306F5C,The terminal is somewhere in the tube lab and can be sliced.
7110821465327C5E0006117F76D73D20,Vault Access
7110821465327C5E0006118089ED93D6,There is a vault in the Imperial compound and the access code has been revealed.
7110821465327C5E0006118135E7672E,The vault building is in the center of the Imperial compound.
7110821465327C7D0006118BB717EA84,Droid Lab Data
7110821465327C7D0006118C3F12D613,A datadisk containing sensitive information about the Empire can be collected from a terminal in the Imperial compound.
7110821465327C7D0006118D416401F2,The terminal is somewhere in the droid lab and can be sliced.
7110821465327C90000611977100DA31,Shuttle Hangar Cargo
7110821465327C90000611986D7FA476,A storage area in the Imperial compound has a crate filled with valuable supplies.
7110821465327C900006119978DBF386,The crate is being stored in the shuttle hangar behind the waterfall.
7110821465363A8A000211F4A7D7E201,Sweet Scurrier Soup
7110821465363A8A000211F535E10F78,"Delicious, creamy and sweet soup made with scurrier meat.

- Jogaan
- Melioorun
- Gorra berries
- Fried scurrier meat

Note: If scurrier is too gamy, it can be replaced with any other type of four-footed mammal"
7110821465363CCF000211F7B164E209,Who is Jinnjo Blorgh?
7110821465363CCF000211F8A9BBD9CE,"Received the following message:

“I would like to request a transfer. I have served Gorak loyally for many years and have repeatedly said I am available for a new challenge. Anything that’s not standing outside this rusty door.

Sincerely,
Jinnjo Blorgh”

I have no idea who this mudscuffer is, but he needs to be put in his place. Demote him as soon as possible."
7110821465363CF5000211FA0D2BDF5C,For your information
7110821465363CF5000211FB9BC9005A,"A Crimson Dawn operative managed to infiltrate Gorak's inner circle. We searched his living quarters and uncovered multiple bugs. All the data has been destroyed.

The culprit was last seen on the outskirts of Mirogana, heading out into the steppe.

Gorak's bounty hunter droid is tracking him down and we have placed guards on all the landing pads on Toshara."
7110821465363F57000211FD9C6DED7A,Application Response
7110821465363F57000211FECFEF1094,"Mister Kaslo,

The Imperial commission has reviewed your application and identified numerous issues with the proposal. We will not be granting a gambling license at this time.

Application Status: Rejected"
7110821465363F7600021200AEF44FD6,Cleanup: Ship crash
7110821465363F76000212015D01614F,Some scuzbag came in too hot on landing and made a mess. We're being sent in to clean up. Everyone say 'thank you Trailblazer' for the overtime.
7110821465363F9D000212034E19C679,New Tax Legislation
7110821465363F9D00021204429FBA93,"The Public Safety Initiative is a new program that puts stricter regulations upon merchants in Mirogana.

This new tax is issued by Governor Thorden and will be enforced by assigned Imperial Officers.

Upon re-assessment with the new 20% rate, you still have a balance of 715 credits owing.

Failure to pay can result in high-interest fines, seizure of property, and/or imprisonment."
71108214653656570000BA1BB9AB4F3A,Please forgive me
71108214653656570000BA1C60B195ED,"I should’ve never left Mos Eisley. When you said it was dangerous out west I didn’t take you seriously. But this heat, the Hutts, pirates… the farm isn’t sustainable. I hid my valuables in a cave while I figure out what to do.

I thought I'd be happy here, but I’m not. I’m happy with you, I know that now."
71108214653656990000BA1E9CA6FFE6,Urgent: Please Read
71108214653656990000BA1F7F97A1D7,"My superiors are getting suspicious, so I’ve changed the drop-point to the North Jundland Wastes.

It’s under the twisted rock pillar south-east of the southern ranch. Don’t let the other Imps see you - too close last time.

And you better have something more interesting for me than plans for raising water tax. I want to know Jabba’s next move."
71108214653656B60000BA219EF2EFCA,I’m outta here!
71108214653656B60000BA2235006A3D,"I’m done. Retiring, quitting, whatever. Jabba’s Palace was a fortress. When his goons spotted me, I had to dump the stash and lose myself in a herd of Dewback… the stench of those things is something else.

The stash is in a cliff alcove north-east of Bestine. You can get it yourself. Messing with the Hutt’s just ain’t worth it."
71108214653656D50000BA244EEE1B68,Note
71108214653656D50000BA25476B21C0,"Laze, love of my life, for the last time I told you not to bring that junked racer into the main shop. We've got no room to help any actual customers that come in. I want it cleared out before I'm back from Mos Espa.

Kisses, 

Camie."
71108214653657040000BA27591DB994,T-16 Skyhopper Replacement Parts
71108214653657040000BA286716DC84,"I'm hoping you can find those parts and fix it up. I know it seems silly as the boy has outgrown toys, but the skyhopper was given to him by an old family friend and I can't bear to throw it out.


Will send you some blue-milk cheese you like as thanks."
711082146536577E0000BA2C0AE5F92B,Moisture Farmer's Stash
711082146536578B0000BA2E69A6CE50,A moisture farmer is giving up on their farm. They stashed their valuables somewhere safe before pirates raided the farm.
711082146536578E0000BA2F85EDD0FB,"The abandoned farm is far west from Mos Eisley, and the stash is in a nearby cave."
71108214653657B10000BA322C6F6393,Drop-off Point
71108214653657B10000BA33C7EE04ED,A corrupt Imperial officer is trading contraband for information about the Hutts. They have a drop-off point for their associate.
71108214653657B10000BA3445E6BBF1,"The stash is under a twisted rock pillar, south-east of an Imperial compound in the North Jundland Wastes."
71108214653657D40000BA3881FAA43A,Stolen Hutt Valuables
71108214653657D40000BA39DCF06C49,A thief broke into Jabba's Palace but was chased out by the Hutts. They managed to bury the loot and escape.
71108214653657D40000BA3AF2FFFBEC,"The stash is hidden in an alcove north-east of Bestine, near a dewback grazing ground."
711082146536582F0000BA3D95E4030F,Today's Bread
711082146536582F0000BA3E98C9AAC4,"HAIZPAN
A spiced bun with a crunchy outer crust that attacks the roof of your mouth. 

DAO-BEN
A soft and delicious steamed-bun. This Myrran delicacy is probably the best bread in the galaxy, not that we're biased.

CUANUT
A hearty brown loaf that's ideal with meat and bread. The Empire is definitely not forcing us to sell it."
71108214653658540000BA40B18BB8E3,What is your future?
71108214653658540000BA4104C229A6,"Come to Sashin and let me help you untangle the threads of fate. 

Customer Testimonial:

I traveled the galaxy to hear my fortune and see if there is love in my future. Turns out there isn't. I was so depressed I stopped off at Canto Bight on the way home... and won! Who needs love when you’re rich? - Skido from Rodia."
71108214653658760000BA43C4CDD47B,Combat Report
71108214653658760000BA44286D20A1,"Improvements needed:

- Weapon modules. The more the better.
- Further vocal signaling. More threatening, higher frequency.
- Larger detection radius.
- Pursue mode. Hunt down enemy if they flee.
- Bug fixing.

Need more testers, sample pool very small. Just 3 so far."
71108214653658A30000BA46AD0C6361,Who was that?
71108214653658A30000BA4707C814B7,"Did you SEE the droid that just landed in Myrra? They were walking around in a coat and had the most adorable little creature with them.

I'm going down to the landing pads to get a better look. Come with me!"
71108214653658C90000BA49C60E1823,Ochi’s Report
71108214653658C90000BA4A08D77CE8,"Waited here for days for the target. Never been more bored in my life! Then I saw him. Big head, red cloak. Easy. Waited until the contact showed up with some guards — and disintegrated all five of them! Poof! Even a Kowakian that happened to be nearby. All gone! That's what you get when you hire Ochi of Bestoon!"
711082146536592B0000BA4C03F69EBD,IMPORTANT: Myrran Swimmer's Club
711082146536592B0000BA4DB58F51E0,"Due to an increased presence of the Hutt Cartel, the mountains on the western edge of the Great Basin are now a no-go zone for training.

Please avoid the area!

In other news, Kin Shiff will no longer be joining our regular swimming sessions due to his untimely death. The two are unrelated."
7110821465365B1E0000BA4FA4B4A559,I have more info
7110821465365B1E0000BA501300C404,"I've been watching the Pykes come in and out of ruins in Stormhollow. They seem to be mining something from the mountains.

Anyway, we'll need a new fishing spot. They've completely disturbed all the fish in our little lake.

I would say something to them, but I like my current number of limbs."
7110821465365BBB0000BA52B8FBBFAA,Imperial Activity
7110821465365BBB0000BA53B9645B81,"The Empire has a large operation on one of the islands in the Great Basin. My sources tell me they are looking for artifacts of 'cultural importance'. Needless to say we cannot let them take our history!

A group of us are planning to sabotage the operation. Whatever the consequences. Are you in? 

Now delete this message. I mean that Ruto!"
7110821465365C160000BA550C80D32D,Your requested reading
7110821465365C160000BA5669E33BF8,"An image comes to my mind. It's of a finger and thumb, protruding from the edge of a large basin. At the base of the thumb you will find hidden riches.

Beware of the duo. They are planning to snatch this fortune right out of your fingers. 

Come see me in person next time!

The Fortuneteller"
7110821465365C4E0000BA58D2F330E3,Ready for Retrieval
7110821465365C4E0000BA59D8E0882B,"Your demands have been met. The payment has been dropped on an island in the river, south of the ruins near Stormhollow. Look for the arch.

Please collect soon so we can conclude our business.

Do not push your luck. We Pykes do not respond well to bribery."
7110821465365C6F0000BA5B5C70045A,Ahia-ko Tower
7110821465365C6F0000BA5C174F531F,"What an astonishing achievement that the old water tower is still standing. To have withstood all the floods shows superior craftmanship. The construction alone warrants further study.

I will leave the Karaba Foothills at dawn, but I left some supplies in a small canyon at the foot of the tower.

Words do not do it justice; you must see for yourself!"
7110821465365C920000BA5E01F5C0AB,I almost got caught.
7110821465365C920000BA5FDD7B461B,"The Empire had a checkpoint where I was crossing the bridge in Myrra Valley, so I had to quickly get rid of the cargo.

I dumped it in some nearby vines at the bottom of the Red Tree. Do you think you can get it?

They didn't see me but that was close... too close."
7110821465365CDC0000BA61EAA94D5D,Transcript of a partial audio transmission
7110821465365CDC0000BA6245F6383B,"[unintelligible]...we are passing through Akiva space. ETA to Oba Diah is...[unintelligible]

...sorry, just getting an alert from sensors on the ship's hull. One moment.

[unintelligible] Get to the cargo! Move, move! 

What do you mean the clamps aren't holding? We can't lose an entire engine-- [end of record]"
7110821465365D280000BA6EE8BC1D2F,Hutt Cartel Hideout
7110821465365D280000BA6FC64F7E2B,"There seems to have been an increase in Hutt presence near the great lake, which may suggest they have a nearby hideout."
7110821465365D280000BA706319830A,Hutts were seen near the mountains on the western edge of the Great Basin.
7110821465365D670000BA76874F8054,Pyke Syndicate Hideout
7110821465365D670000BA775553A3F2,A local fisherman has seen Pykes mining in the mountains on Akiva.
7110821465365D670000BA785E67C859,The Pykes were seen near a small lake in the middle of Strormhollow.
7110821465365D7F0000BA7A7B683D4A,Imperial Excavation
7110821465365D7F0000BA7BB3EC4DE6,"The Empire are excavating on Akiva, looking for rare artifacts."
7110821465365D7F0000BA7CD3A97EC2,The mining operation is on an island in the eastern part of the Great Basin.
7110821465365D970000BA7E9BBC28FD,Hidden Riches
7110821465365D970000BA7F4AEEC511,The fortuneteller speaks of hidden riches at the base of a finger that protrudes over a large basin.
7110821465365D970000BA80D229FDE0,The fortuneteller is probably referring to the monument above the Great Basin.
7110821465365DAC0000BA822FB44EC7,Pyke Bribe
7110821465365DAC0000BA83134EC06D,The Pyke's are being bribed by an unknown person and have made a drop-off with the payment near one of their camps.
7110821465365DAC0000BA848E15F919,The Pykes have dropped off a payment on a island in the southern part of Stormhollow.
7110821465365DCA0000BA93B93465CB,Ahia-ko Tower Supplies
7110821465365DCA0000BA943B9DCCF9,A researcher was studying the old Ahia-ko water tower and stashed some supplies before leaving.
7110821465365DCA0000BA953252670F,The tower is in the Karaba Foothills and the supplies are in a small canyon at its foot.
7110821465365DE20000BA97DB443AF1,Lost Stash
7110821465365DE20000BA980E6BDF64,"Someone is looking for a hidden stash but the instructions are too hard to follow. ""Leave Myrra. Down river under arch, no bridges! Go right, still river. Stash in tree above."""
7110821465365DE20000BA99AFA0ABB9,Seems as though the stash is under a tree near the river south of Myrra.
7110821465365DF80000BA9BB4458699,Entangled Island
7110821465365DF80000BA9CE485FF8A,Smugglers use a place called the Entangled Island as a drop-off point.
7110821465365DF80000BA9D4ED27DC0,The island is located on the lake west of Sashin.
7110821465365E120000BA9FFD4C4D30,Dumped Cargo
7110821465365E120000BAA036FE84BC,Someone had to quickly dispose of their cargo at an Imperial checkpoint in Myrra Valley.
7110821465365E120000BAA1EB1FC3DE,"The cargo was dumped in some ruins at the base of the Red Tree, near the bridge."
7110821465365F290000BAAF86173BCD,Demolitions Recommendation
7110821465365F290000BAB0EE8A2071,"The best demolition expert I ever worked with was a Chadra-Fan.

Very sensitive hearing means they can pick up on low frequencies, hear the bombs 'tick'. Plus, she had a complete disregard for her bodily safety. 

I haven't seen her in a long time. The best demolitions duo became a solo act and never recovered, if you catch my meaning."
71108214653661410000BAB202C98559,Rush Order
71108214653661410000BAB32D25107B,"Need this soon as you can. I'll throw in an extra ten percent on payment if you can fill the order before week's out.

- Stock for TL-50
- Barrel replacement for TL-50
- SE-14C (two)
- Sight for SE-14C
- Standard ammo
- Concussive ammo
- As many grenades as you can"
711082146536723B000184C7D3EA1DF9,Warning!
711082146536723B000184C8C5106E37,"There have been several reports of counterfeit credits being used in Mirogana Market. Be vigilant, trade with vendors you trust, and check your credits. Counterfeits will have variations in consistency, shape, and weight."
71108214653672AC0001976E5887C08B,The Refractors: A Discordant Tune?
71108214653672AC0001976FDB011BB7,"The triumphant return of Skungy Gungus and the Refractors was a catchy throwback with a few missed notes. While confident with their crowd-pleaser hits, the band didn’t seem to jive together when branching out into new material.

Skungy's charisma can't cover it all… and for the Refractors, this led to one unfortunate member being dropped into Jabba's rancor pit.

3/5."
7110821465367367000197710835EE8D,Remla Moonis' Growing Old - A Review
7110821465367367000197726ED0F498,"It's hard to imagine how a member of the Refractors could produce such nonsense. Remla Moonis has shown nothing but a waste of his talent with his pretentious and uninspired new song, Growing Old in Wayfar.

We’ve all had moments when we’ve thought we’re accessing untapped genius during a creative pursuit... In this sense, Moonis succeeds in evoking memories of youth.

1/5"
711082146536738D0001977415E809DC,Wanted: Swindling Salesman
711082146536738D00019775B20ECC6A,"Individual was spotted in Bestine selling luminous bacta under the pretense of a more valuable concoction. This is not the first ruse set up by the perpetrator.

If seen please inform customers to not engage and report to the local authority immediately."
71108214653673B4000197771A3F4A95,Suspicious Ships
71108214653673B4000197784FCC06E7,"Next time let those ships go without inspection. Their 'processing fee' has already been taken care of. They aren't attacking Imperial ships, and the little bit of pocket money is the only silver lining to this miserable post."
71108214653673ED0001977A4CE50AA1,Shipment List
71108214653673ED0001977BAC6E8A4A,"Four crates of grenades coming in off a freighter. There's also an ornamental knife - a good gift for Jabba perhaps?

Shipment of spotchka ready to go out. Talk to the night dock manager and she'll look the other way.

Modified Skipray came in with some medicine crates. Dropped off by a one-eyed Rodian and a Devaronian."
71108214653674430001977D278C663F,Tax Collector Funds
71108214653674430001977E4358D06D,"Being told to allocate 10% of the taxes collected this season and send it to an account on Nar Shaddaa. 

Fortuna wasn't very forthcoming about the reason why. Has to be for the upcoming magistrate appointment. 

Jabba's got a fathier to back in that race, so to speak, and using money made on Tatooine to spread his influence elsewhere. Infuriating."
8FD81D5165329306000A8291C6C85159,Hold out against the Empire
