6D16199B654A5A8A002828018354C6DD,"<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">ANNOUNCER:</font> Previously on Baradium Dynasty...
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">TALESH:</font> I can't see you anymore... I think my father knows.
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">DIARA:</font> So what if he knows? We have nothing to be ashamed of. I love you.
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">TALESH:</font> I know... but the thing is. There's something I've been meaning to tell you.
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">DIARA:</font> What is it? You can tell me anything.
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">TALESH:</font> Your mother. She's...
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">DIARA:</font> ...finally given you the promotion?
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">TALESH:</font> No... your mother proposed to me... and I said yes."
6D16199B654A5B4400283A10C4864F4F,"<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">ANNOUNCER:</font> Previously on Baradium Dynasty...
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">TALESH:</font> I did it. I told Diara about us.
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">DIARA'S MOTHER:</font> That's great, darling. Now we can move ahead with the wedding.
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">TALESH:</font> It's just... it feels like we're moving too fast.
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">DIARA'S MOTHER:</font> Too fast? The wedding's in a week. If you're having doubts, you can always... talk to me.
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">TALESH:</font> No it's just... the last thing I want is for this to be about credits.
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">DIARA'S MOTHER:</font> Don't worry, darling. It's all there in the prenuptial. I just need your holo-seal. Sign it, and all will be well..."
6D16199B654A5B5D00283CB9FFDB23EE,"<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">ANNOUNCER:</font> Previously on Baradium Dynasty...
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">DIARA:</font> How could you do this, mother? Talesh Makeric was my lover!
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">DIARA'S MOTHER:</font> Oh calm yourself, Diara. I'm only marrying him for the credits. In a cycle, we'll be divorced and he's all yours.
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">DIARA:</font> But... he doesn't even want me anymore.
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">DIARA'S MOTHER:</font> Well, what do you expect from a Makeric. They're all the same. Cold, heartless...
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">TALESH:</font> Cruel?
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">DIARA:</font> Talesh? What are you doing here?
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">TALESH:</font> I'm afraid I have some bad news. There was an accident at the refinery. My father... he's dead."
6D16199B654A5B7E00283FE57A08E570,"<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">ANNOUNCER:</font> Last time on Family of the Frontier Worlds...
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">DOC:</font> I've got some bad news...
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">MALINA:</font> What is it, doc?
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">DOC:</font> The infection. It's worse than I thought. I tried cleaning the wound but...
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">SUNA:</font> Mama, what does that mean?
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">DOC:</font> If we don't get that bacta within the hour... I don't think she'll survive the night.
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">MALINA:</font> Well that settles it.
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">SUNA:</font> Mama? Where are you going?
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">MALINA:</font> I'm going to get that bacta.
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">DOC:</font> But there's a storm out there!
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">MALINA:</font> I know... but for void's sake, I will not lose another bantha."
6D16199B654A5B9F00284341627E9A5A,"<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">ANNOUNCER:</font> Last time on Family of the Frontier Worlds...
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">MALINA:</font> Well, the storm's finally over, but it's gonna take a lot of repairs.
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">SUNA:</font> I can help, mama. C-85 showed us how to solder in school.
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">MALINA:</font> I know, honey... but it'll take a lot more than that to save the farm. With the crops all but destroyed... we might have to sell the skyhopper.
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">NOJAK:</font> I can't believe you!
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">MALINA:</font> Nojak, wait... ugh, there he goes again.
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">SUNA:</font> Where's he going, mama?
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">MALINA:</font> Probably running with that swoop gang down by the river... but I hope I'm wrong..."
6D16199B654A5BB5002845795643149C,"<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">ANNOUNCER:</font> Last time on Family of the Frontier Worlds...
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">MALINA:</font> Nojak. It's time to come home.
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">NOJAK:</font> Why? So you can boss me around the farm. Take away everything I love? No, I'm done with that.
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">MALINA:</font> So you'd rather hang around here, selling pell rocks with these swoop heads?
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">NOJAK:</font> They're my friends.
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">MALINA:</font> You can tell yourself that. But we both know this isn't the life you wanted. You had dreams. You were gonna be a pilot.
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">NOJAK:</font> How would I do that if we don't even have a skyhopper?
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">MALINA:</font> We'll figure it out... we always do. Just come home, Nojak... come home."
6D16199B654A5BD400284884A217EED2,"<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">ANNOUNCER:</font> You're watching Love on Deck 5...
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">BELLIS:</font> This ship is a lot fancier than I thought, Captain. But there's one thing I would change.
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">CAPTAIN:</font> Change?! That's impossible!
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">BELLIS:</font> Every night, I'm sitting alone in the dining room. I'm the most famous singer in the Core, but no one ever asks me to dinner.
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">CAPTAIN:</font> Well, we can't have that. Will you do me the honor tonight?
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">BELLIS:</font> Why Captain, are you asking me out on a date?
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">CAPTAIN:</font> I believe I am.
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">BELLIS:</font> Well fine, but make sure your chief officer knows. I'm trying to make her jealous."
6D16199B654A5BF600284BF820C95B3F,"<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">ANNOUNCER:</font> You're watching Love on Deck 5...
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">BELLIS:</font> Well Captain, I must thank you for a lovely evening.
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">CAPTAIN:</font> The pleasure's all mine.
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">BELLIS:</font> But I think your waiter should skip the hover boots next time.
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">CAPTAIN:</font> I'll make sure to tell them.
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">BELLIS:</font> Do you think your chief officer saw us?
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">CAPTAIN:</font> With those horns, you're quite hard to miss.
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">BELLIS:</font> Oh Captain... you're not making this easy on me."
6D16199B654A5C0800284DC836DA92B9,"<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">ANNOUNCER:</font> You're watching Love on Deck 5...
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">CAPTAIN:</font> I'm sorry it didn't work out with the chief officer.
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">BELLIS:</font> It's like they say, Captain. You only butcher the songs you don't sing.
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">CAPTAIN:</font> I don't think I've heard that expression...
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">CAPTAIN:</font> At any rate, I hope we will see you again.
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">BELLIS:</font> Oh, you will. I just booked another ticket.
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">CAPTAIN:</font> You did?
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">BELLIS:</font> So you'd better practice that valachord, because tomorrow night I'm bringing you up on stage.
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">CAPTAIN:</font> On stage? That's impossible!"
6D16199B654A5C53002852506D043A91,"<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">ANNOUNCER:</font> Previously on Glarnok & Yabassi...
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">YABASSI:</font> Really, sleemo? You're telling me these droids just started robbing vaults on their own?
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">DROIDSMITH:</font> Honest, officer. I don't know what you're talking about.
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">GLARNOK:</font> He's pulling your tendril, Yabassi. That's an expensive looking jacket for an average droidsmith.
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">YABASSI:</font> Yeah... you're right. Where'd you get that jacket, friend?
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">DROIDSMITH:</font> What, this old thing? Bought it used... down on level 1420... it's a fake.
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">GLARNOK:</font> Looks like the real deal to me. Alright, we're taking you to the station.
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">ASSASSIN DROID:</font> [Beeps ominously]
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">YABASSI:</font> Glarnok! Look out!"
6D16199B654A5C770028560222E422E2,"<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">ANNOUNCER:</font> Previously on Glarnok & Yabassi...
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">GLARNOK:</font> Yabassi, what are you doing here?
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">YABASSI:</font> What, I'm gonna let my partner just sit alone in bacta all day? Forget it, Glarnok. Besides, I need your help with the case.
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">GLARNOK:</font> Oh yeah? What's the problem?
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">YABASSI:</font> I traced the blaster to a shop on level 1420. But get this: there are no records of the shop existing in the first place.
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">GLARNOK:</font> That's gotta be a mistake. A blaster can't just pop up outta nowhere.
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">YABASSI:</font> That's what I'm thinking. So I looked up the revisions. And get this - the lot's signed to someone we know.
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">GLARNOK:</font> Frudeki..? But that's...
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">YABASSI:</font> That's right, Glarnok. It's mayor Frudeki himself!"
6D16199B654A5C8C0028583B17F7F73B,"<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">ANNOUNCER:</font> Previously on Glarnok & Yabassi...
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">YABASSI:</font> Hands up, Frudeki. You're not gonna squeeze yourself outta this one.
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">MAYOR FRUDEKI:</font> Detective Yabassi. Glarnok. Is this supposed to be some kind of joke?
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">GLARNOK:</font> The only joke is the one you've been pulling on your hard-working Imperial constituents!
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">YABASSI:</font> You're under arrest on suspicion of fraud and murder. You can't hide behind your office anymore.
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">MAYOR FRUDEKI:</font> Well, let's head to the station and I'm sure we can sort this out...
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">YABASSI:</font> Glarnok! Look out!
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">MAYOR FRUDEKI:</font> For the Rebel Alliance!
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">GLARNOK:</font> Traitor!"
6D16199B654A5CA700285ACB0804D526,"<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">ANNOUNCER:</font> Previously on The Adventures of Flux Magnetar...
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">DORNIGAR:</font> Flux Magnetar. Only you could be so bold to stage an uprising against the King.
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">FLUX MAGNETAR:</font> Let 'em go, Dornigar. This is between you and me.
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">DORNIGAR:</font> If only it were so simple. The King has ordained me judge and jury, Flux. And I'm afraid I have no choice but to give you the strictest punishment on Bolaxia.
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">FLUX MAGNETAR:</font> Go ahead... do your worst.
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">DORNIGAR:</font> So be it. Flux Magnetar, I sentence you to trial by combat... in the burning pits of Mount Vardosh!
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">PEMA:</font> Oh Flux...
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">FLUX MAGNETAR:</font> Don't worry, darling. I'll find a way out. Somehow..."
6D16199B654A5CC800285E327F4EDBDC,"<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">ANNOUNCER:</font> Previously on The Adventures of Flux Magnetar...
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">FLUX MAGNETAR:</font> Dornigar's done, but I'm not leaving until Bolaxia is free.
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">BOLAXIAN FARMER 1:</font> It's too late... all our soldiers are captured. You can't defeat the King yourself.
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">FLUX MAGNETAR:</font> No, not by myself... all of you will help.
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">BOLAXIAN FARMER 2:</font> But how? We're but simple krill farmers! We won't stand a chance against the King's guard.
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">FLUX MAGNETAR:</font> Back on my home planet, I used to be a farmer too... I woke up at dawn and carried barrels of dustgrain all day. But when I enlisted, I realized I had been training my whole life.
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">FLUX MAGNETAR:</font> With my help, you will all turn from farmers into the fiercest warriors in all of Wild Space. And together, we will finally free Bolaxia!"
6D16199B654A5CDB00286023680156C9,"<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">ANNOUNCER:</font> Previously on The Adventures of Flux Magnetar...
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">FLUX MAGNETAR:</font> We have seized the fortress! Shatter the cages. Let the proud people of Bolaxia run free!
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">DORNIGAR:</font> Flux Magnetar... look how far you have come.
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">FLUX MAGNETAR:</font> Dornigar? But... I saw you fall.
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">DORNIGAR:</font> And yet here I stand. You know, we are not so different, you and I. We will both do anything to get what we want.
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">PEMA:</font> Flux! Help me!
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">FLUX MAGNETAR:</font> Let him go, Dornigar! The fleet is on the way. You have already lost.
<font preset=""Medium Bodytext"">DORNIGAR:</font> But will they be here in time to save your love? What do you say, Flux? Can you risk it?"
