BE60F07F654A46490000FBC50BB12D0D,The Imperials keep a record of the contraband they've seized on Toshara. The client needs a slicer to find out where they’re storing it.
BE60F07F654A46E60000FBC64F8F93E3,The client requires a smuggler with a ship capable of withstanding Toshara's solar winds to deliver their cargo to Tatooine.
BE60F07F654A46E70000FBC762899612,A smuggler heading for Kijimi went off the radar. The client needs someone to collect their missing contraband and finish the job.
BE60F07F654A46E80000FBC9B64CAD57,The client requires a competent smuggler to pick up weapons from Jaunta's Hope and deliver them to the Hutt Cartel on Tatooine.
BE60F07F654A46E90000FBCA856F20F6,The Pykes have a stockpile of contraband on Renpalli Station. They need a smuggler to discreetly deliver it to their poaching station.
BE60F07F654A46F50000FBCBAB780F4F,The Pykes need a smuggler who can retrieve some valuable goods and have it delivered to them.
BE60F07F654A46F50000FBCC265E6E62,A bandit is in hiding after stealing their former gang's loot. They need a skilled smuggler to pick it up and deliver it to their hideout.
BE60F07F654A46F60000FBCDF5AB59EB,Imperials have intercepted a shipment of baradium. The client needs a thief to steal it back and drop it off near the Refueling Station.
BE60F07F654A46F60000FBCE093FBF38,Smugglers are storing contraband in the refueling station outside Mirogana. The client needs someone to deliver their cargo to Jaunta's Hope.
BE60F07F654A46F80000FBD0B7AE9471,A Jaunta's Hope resident is apprehensive about picking up supplies due to recent bandit activity. They need a smuggler to do it for them.
BE60F07F654A46F90000FBD11865E76E,Crimson Dawn want a smuggler to deliver some goods to their district in Mirogana.
BE60F07F654A46FA0000FBD3388CBC7B,The Pykes need a hired hand to deliver a shipment of baradium from Mirogana to the Pyke poaching station.
BE60F07F654A46FA0000FBD4FB42AA07,The Empire has seized the client's cargo. They want a hired hand to place a tracking beacon on an Imperial shuttle to track their goods.
BE60F07F654A46FB0000FBD5CC2B7C96,Shipjacker bandits operate out of a local workshop. The client wants someone to investigate where they’re planning to target next.
BE60F07F654A46FC0000FBD7C7F1B604,Crimson Dawn are using new shipping lanes to transport resources. The client wants to plant trackers on their cargo to uncover the routes.
BE60F07F654A46FE0000FBD8290D2E6F,The poaching station is a major source of income for the Pykes. The client needs a slicer to steal financial records from their territory.
BE60F07F654B3E8E00043EEE74245543,The client is searching for a thief to steal a datapad filled with information on Hutt patrol routes. It is being stored in one of their Mos Eisley hideouts.
BE60F07F654B3E8F00043EEF89E98153,Water prices on Tatooine are on the rise. The client needs a smuggler to discreetly deliver water tanks from a moisture farm to Mos Eisley.
BE60F07F654B3E8F00043EF06CB717A5,Rival syndicates are trying to cut off deliveries bound for Hutt territory. The client wants to make sure their cargo reaches its destination.
BE60F07F654B3E8F00043EF10E2189A0,Patrons at Jabba's Throne Room are known to talk business over a drink. The client is seeking a thief who can place a listening device inside.
BE60F07F654B3E9000043EF258F94B6A,An Imperial computer system holds security reports the client is interested in. They are seeking a slicer to retrieve them.
BE60F07F654B7FEA0007511DCF906780,Pirates are disrupting ships bound for Kijimi. The Ashiga Clan are looking for a smuggler to bypass them with a shipment from Tatooine.
BE60F07F654B7FEB0007511E4656C427,The Hutts are looking for a hired hand to safeguard a delivery of building materials from Tatooine to Toshara.
BE60F07F654B7FF400075122B1254541,The Imperials are expecting a large weapons shipment. The client needs a thief to slip into an outpost and secure their importation plans.
BE60F07F654B7FF400075123DBEA55E0,The client is looking to hire an experienced smuggler to discretely deliver buzz droid tech to their associate in Wayfar.
BE60F07F654B7FF500075124C6D26F78,The client is searching for a smuggler to handle an exclusive shipment containing Jabba the Hutt's personal cargo.
BE60F07F654B7FF600075125911256BA,The client is in need of a smuggler to discreetly make a delivery of off-market fusion generators for speeders.
BE60F07F654B7FF6000751260A860694,The Hutt outpost in Mos Eisley is expecting a delivery of weapons. The client is searching for a hired hand willing to assist with the transport.
BE60F07F654B7FF700075127834A1771,The Hutts need a skilled hired hand to deliver a shipment of bacta to one of their most valued enforcers.
BE60F07F654B7FFA0007512C5A668189,The client recovered black market speeder parts from a recent crash site and is seeking a smuggler to transport them to Tosche station.
BE60F07F654B7FFB0007512D1EE15BF2,An Imperial ship is transporting supplies to their outpost on Tatooine. The client wants an infiltrator to plant a surveillance spike with the shipment.
BE60F07F654B918900075130B09FC527,Hutt tax collectors are extorting moisture farmers. The client wants a tracking device planted inside their tax collection building in Mos Eisley.
BE60F07F654B918A0007513283AAC95F,The client needs a slicer to break into surveillance protocols in an Imperial compound and transmit them.
BE60F07F654B918A0007513386D97243,An Imperial compound allegedly holds security logs incriminating the client. They are willing to pay a high price for a slicer who can take care of it.
BE60F07F654B918B00075134C8212942,The Imperial compound in Bestine holds critical communication protocols concerning clan business. The client wants this information extracted by a slicer.
BE60F07F654BA4A000075141087C56EB,A pirate cruiser has been spotted in Pyke territory. The client is seeking a pilot to track it down and steal their cargo.
BE60F07F654BA4A100075142C4F5F49A,A cruiser suspected of carrying stolen quadanium steel was spotted in Pyke-controlled space. The client needs a hired gun to steal it.
BE60F07F654BA4A1000751430B3A1CDB,Pirates have intercepted a shipment of pistols that was being delivered to the Pykes. The client needs a hired gun to deal with them.
BE60F07F654BA4A200075145ABF1E6D5,Imperials have received a shipment of doonium worth a lot of credits on the black market. The client is looking for a thief to steal it.
BE60F07F654BA4A300075146C0CB8615,A merchant’s robuma pelts were seized by the Pykes during transit. The client is seeking a competent thief to steal back their stock.
BE60F07F654BA4A3000751471BCC8613,Smugglers are using an old wreck to hide black market cargo. The client needs a pilot to pick up their latest order.
BE60F07F654BA4A400075148DB84761B,Crimson Dawn have deployed surveillance tech in Toshara space. The client will pay a premium rate for the equipment.
BE60F07F654BA4A60007514B1C83C04A,Pirates have destroyed a merchant ship and stolen their cargo. The client will pay a good price for whatever was inside.
BE60F07F654BA4A60007514CE44F596F,A smuggler's ship was destroyed by solar winds entering Toshara space. The client needs a pilot to retrieve the lost cargo.
BE60F07F654BA4A70007514D24CF6172,Crimson Dawn have uncovered new smuggling lanes. They're looking for a smuggler to deliver their findings to their associates.
BE60F07F654BA4A70007514E46DC02DA,The Pykes are importing sensitive cargo from Oba Diah to Toshara. Crimson Dawn needs a smuggler to steal it from the dropoff point.
BE60F07F654BA4A800075150DA45B61E,The Pykes are seeking a pilot to extract several containers of missing hyperfuel from a slygel-infested area in Toshara space.
BE60F07F654BA4A80007515185DE98D5,A gas merchant jettisoned multiple rhydonium canisters while being pursued by pirates. The client is looking for a smuggler who can find them.
BE60F07F654BAB3100075154D8CBFEA6,Pirates raided a merchant ship bringing valuable building materials to Mos Eisley. The client needs a competent pilot to steal them back.
BE60F07F654BAB3200075155376698AF,Pirates are sitting on multiple ryll containers that were stolen from a merchant ship. The client is seeking a skilled pilot to retrieve them.
BE60F07F654BAB3200075157D5D89452,Pirates have raided a ship bringing supplies to Tatooine. The client wants a skilled pilot to secure the cargo before anyone else claims it.
