09AEDAAA6548FA4F00052416A3ECBC2A,Can be found at some Jawa merchants.
09AEDAAA6548FE810007AFC41269E6CF,Imperials on Akiva have electro-shock prods under high security inside the Excavation Site 12.
09AEDAAA6548FEB40007AFD6A14D3671,The Empire has a flux compressor in a compound in the Great Basin on Akiva.
