91803AE1654CA8B6000119473CB472D4,In Mirogana an angry champion rants that fathier races are being fixed by Crimson Dawn.
91803AE1654CA94200011948B291492F,A jockey from Ord Mantell will win the next fathier race. Rumor has it a former champion in Mirogana has been thrown off by Crimson Dawn.
91803AE1654CA98E000119490598EF33,An angry fathier champion in Mirogana rants about fixed races.
91803AE1654CAC8700015D59ED032E61,The Ashiga clan have found a way to make money on fathier races.
91803AE1654CAC90000164E6A991538E,Two Hutts in the fathier racing business must quickly find someone for a job.
91803AE1654CACAE000164E79293F7D7,A brother's career in fathier races can be ruined by the Hutts.
91803AE1654CACCF000164E94694498A,An suspicious Empire sponsored fathier race is planned soon.
91803AE1654CACDD000164EA65BA6FF5,The former champion hopes to return to fathier racing.
91803AE1654CB72E0000B3DD6750DAD6,The fathier race terminal has been sliced by the Ashiga to change the identity of the fathiers. Access to old revisions can be done by slicing a terminal in the Ashiga's district.
91803AE1654CB7660000B3DE32EAFB1A,"According to an Ashiga Clan terminal, the heaviest fathier will win the next race."
91803AE1654CB7730000B3DFB14F0727,Two fathier dealing members of the Hutt Cartel are looking for someone in Canto Bight for a job. They might have information about the next race.
91803AE1654CB77E0000B3E0BE759521,"All the Intel couldn’t be obtained, but some Hutt enforcers talked about a rigged fathier race where their jockey will win, they must be coming from a Hutt planet."
91803AE1654CB7850000B3E15F126E53,Some Hutt Cartel members discussed that the next fathier race would be won by the smallest fathier.
91803AE1654CB78E0000B3E23A457C80,"Two civilians failed to pay the Hutts, causing their brother's fathier jockey career to come to an end. They have asked for help to resolve the situation."
91803AE1654CB7960000B3E3F3FA32D0,"A terminal in the Hutt Compound, south-west of Mos Eisley, can be sliced to erase any traces of the brother aiding the rebels. It can be accessed from a secret passage on the west side."
91803AE1654CB79E0000B3E4E1346D13,"According to some new intel, the next fathier race will be won by a jockey named Jado Halcyr."
91803AE1654CB7C00000B3E71E66E638,An upcoming fathier race is sponsored by the Empire and it's probably going to be rigged. Some stormtroopers in the area might have more info on it.
91803AE1654CB7C80000B3E85C784C12,The upcoming Empire-sponsored fathier race is causing a lot of buzz. Some Imperial officers in the Alcazar might know more about it.
91803AE1654CB7D10000B3E9B636846A,Some Imperial officers have information about the Imperial fathier race on a datacard.
91803AE1654CB7D80000B3EACB9D83B4,"According to a datacard in Myrra, the rigged Empire-sponsored fathier race will have Vinis Karyvin representing the Empire as a jockey."
91803AE1654CB7E00000B3EBE2E3EBD9,A fathier race champion that used to live in Mirogana is looking for some help.
91803AE1654CB7F00000B3ED7E72FD79,A terminal near Crimson Dawn's docking bay can be used to change Morin's name to redeem him.
91803AE1654CB7F80000B3EE59D55120,"Having collected the leverage material, Crimson Dawn's pressure on the fathier champion can be removed."
91803AE1654CB7FF0000B3EFA495C4E0,The former champion's name has been cleared from the Crimson Dawn blacklist.
91803AE1654CB8070000B3F0F13F4452,The former champion needs funds to buy a new Fathier license if he wants to race again. In the meantime he will wait in Mirogana.
