BE60F07F654C8A1300020AF1350F32AF,Pirates infiltrated a cargo ship that was delivering modified battle droids to Tatooine. The client wants a pilot to retrieve them.
BE60F07F654C8A1400020AF27737A156,A band of pirates destroyed a merchant ship that was shipping droid parts off Akiva. The client needs a pilot to retrieve their cargo.
BE60F07F654C8A1500020AF4229A19A7,The client needs a skilled pilot to steal a shipment of explosive charges from pirates and take them to a secure location.
BE60F07F654C8A1500020AF56E4CCD11,Pirates are searching for cargo jettisoned by a ship that was attacked entering Akiva space. The client wants it back.
BE60F07F654C8A1600020AF6A4BBEC9F,The Empire is searching for cargo believed to be hidden inside a wreck site. The client needs a discrete smuggler to find it first.
BE60F07F654C8A1600020AF7D8395E97,The Pykes are searching for some missing cargo that was offloaded during a pursuit. The client needs a skilled pilot to retrieve it.
BE60F07F654C8A1700020AF82A9C3316,The client needs a smuggler to move some hot goods and fight off pirates who get in their way.
BE60F07F654C8A1700020AFA591498CC,The client is looking for a pilot to steal a shipment of baradium bisulfate and take it to a secure location before the chemicals degrade.
BE60F07F654C8A1800020AFC80043673,The client lost their cargo after being ambushed by Imperials. They need their stock back before it gets sold on the black market.
BE60F07F654C8A1A00020AFEDD83DF9C,Pirates threatened to take down a merchant ship if they refused to hand over their cargo. The client needs a competent pilot to get it back.
BE60F07F654C9FFF00020B006442C139,Pirates boarded a shuttle and stole scandocs from the passengers. The client wants them before they make their way to the black market.
BE60F07F654CA00000020B021D75A29B,A group of pirates have been organizing raids to steal hyperfuel. The client wants a pilot to attack their convoy and take back the fuel.
BE60F07F654CA00000020B039EE05D7F,"Some Kijimi pirates have been harassing freighter convoys in the area, and some merchants have pooled resources to get back what's theirs."
BE60F07F654CA00100020B050CE1E98B,Crimson Dawn are deploying some surveillance tech for their operations on Kijimi. The client will pay premium for a shipment.
BE60F07F654CA00200020B0720A74AAA,The Ashiga Clan make some of the best blasters in the galaxy. The client needs a thief who can retrieve a shipment of their weapons.
BE60F07F654CA00400020B08043E67B9,The client has lost a lot of business due to pirate attacks and now wants to secure some missing baradium and deliver it at all cost.
BE60F07F654CA00400020B0A3C049743,A black market merchant has tracked down a high-value Ashiga Clan freighter and needs a pilot to steal an Ipsium shipment from them.
BE60F07F654CA00500020B0B26EC7873,A former pirate wants someone to attack their former gang and take back their loot. The pirate paid upfront and wants to remain anonymous.
BE60F07F654CA00600020B0CD118D0B8,A pirate group is looking for some plans that were lost after a hyperspace collision. The client wants a pilot to retrieve them first.
BE60F07F654CA00700020B0E4D72E2B2,Pirates are making it difficult to import shipments to Kijimi. The client needs a pilot to recover a lost shipment of thermal engines.
BE60F07F654CA00700020B0F0818248F,The client recently lost a shipment of baradium in the Kijimi system and is looking to recover it before pirates discover it.
BE60F07F654CA00800020B101F92A824,Crimson Dawn are looking for a competent smuggler who can deliver a shipment of cortosis to their technical team as soon as possible.
