1657B1AA655F5BE3000EE75E5DE3C0E7,ND-5 heard rumors that there might be another vault on Tatooine. More info could be found in civilian's cities and settlements.
1657B1AA655F5C05000EE75F5917ADE6,A shady merchant in the market district of Myrra is selling a mysterious holodisc.
1657B1AA655F5C1B000EE7604D0C81C0,A holodisc bought from a merchant in Myrra. The holotracker can read it.
1657B1AA655F5C37000EE761D16E23B6,"The holotracker reacted to a nearby vault, pointing to its location."
1657B1AA655F5C4D000EE76292C92584,The Miyuki vault is open and what's inside can now be claimed.
1657B1AA655F5C6C000EE7637655D2A6,"There might be another vault on Akiva, ND-5 heard some Hutts talking about that. More info should be found around Hutt-controlled areas."
1657B1AA655F5C87000EE7645F7E5F2D,"West of Hutt Poaching Outpost, by the lake's shore, a Hutt smuggler is known to always have a holodisc with a treasure map on him. It seems safer to steal it from him."
1657B1AA655F5CA2000EE765FFADB4E7,The holodisc that was stolen by a Hutt smuggler can be read by the holotracker.
1657B1AA655F5CC1000EE76624934B93,"The holotracker reacted to a nearby vault, pointing to its location."
1657B1AA655F5CD6000EE767FC8B6D45,The Miyuki vault is open and what's inside can now be claimed.
1657B1AA655F5D03000EE76851A1C2CE,Word on the street says that a bounty hunter lost a holodisc at a Sabacc table around the central plaza.
1657B1AA655F5D1B000EE769C3394E91,A holodisc that was won in a game of Sabacc. It can be used by the holotracker.
1657B1AA655F5D2F000EE76A7D484AB6,"The holotracker reacted to a nearby vault, pointing to its location."
1657B1AA655F5D43000EE76BDA0EE11F,The Miyuki vault is open and what's inside can now be claimed.
1657B1AA655F5D56000EE76C85E6FF22,"A treasure hunter coming from Mos Eisley by speeder has been spotted in Wayfar. He was searching for a place in the western part of North Jundland Wastes, but that's quite a flimsy lead. Could probably learn more about his destination in Mos Eisley."
1657B1AA655F5D68000EE76D8CA264C9,"A treasure hunter asked around Mos Eisley for a place located in the Northern part of the West Dune Sea, then left for Wayfar. They might know more in Wayfar, a settlement south of Mos Eisley, even though he might be dead by now."
1657B1AA655F5D86000EE76EB3809211,The treasure hunter headed toward the north boundary between West Dune Sea and North Jundland Wastes with a speeder.
1657B1AA655F5D9D000EE76F1E2B9B67,A crashed speeder that must belong to the treasure hunter searching for the vault. The holodisc could be nearby.
1657B1AA655F5DB6000EE770AC86686F,A holodisc found in a massiff nest but no trace of the treasure hunter. Hopefully the holodisc can still be read by the holotracker.
1657B1AA655F5DCB000EE771339DD51A,"The holotracker reacted to a nearby vault, pointing to its location."
1657B1AA655F5DDD000EE772843AD962,The Miyuki vault is open and what's inside can now be claimed.
1657B1AA655F5DF5000EE773C6889A21,There are rumors about a lot of Miyuki salvage stolen by pirates in a settlement south of Bestine.
1657B1AA655F5E28000EE77459D2578F,The holodisc seems damaged. Hopefully the holotracker can still read it.
1657B1AA655F5E72000EE775843A6CAA,"The holotracker reacted to a nearby vault, pointing to its location."
1657B1AA655F6060000EE776D6994486,The Miyuki vault is open and what's inside can now be claimed.
1657B1AA655F60CA000EE779C8EFAEA4,One of the hidden smuggler caches seems to be located near the vault's entrance.
