224FE6336568B6740000EA35B73A402A,Leaving
224FE6336568B6740000EA362A29557D,"Kiba,

I'm done with this. Too many people have died. It's just the two of us left now. We have to do the smart thing and leave while we still can and not accept that Hutt ""protection"". I just need to pick up my last things at the other cache and then I'm gonna head to Takodana. Please meet me there.

Yours,

Lon"
