D00CF65465671BF80001B51265B63A28,"Salea's hand is a large tree that holds some significance in Akivan history, with several stories and poems written about people meeting and reuniting underneath its crown. The tree itself is protected under Satrap law."
D00CF65465671BF80001B51353B29387,Salea's Hand
D00CF65465671D2D0001B51C14AAFB17,"The Pyke Syndicate have a well-established presence on Akiva. Aside from the typical spice trade and other black market interests, they are also invested in the acquisition and export of certain valuable crystals that can be found on the planet."
D00CF65465671D2D0001B51D13B27435,Pyke Crystal Mine
D00CF65465671D2F0001B51F6A68BB83,"The Hutt Cartel have extended their reach to Akiva by forming a temporary and loose alliance with one of the more influential crime bosses on the planet, Surat Nuat. The Hutts are primarily interested in the planet's droid black market."
D00CF65465671D2F0001B5202959879A,Hutt Poaching Station
D00CF654656727FC0001B525565C1EA8,"While Crimson Dawn has not had a major presence on Kijimi for long, they were quick to establish themselves near their main holdout, The Wellspring. In the district, Crimson Dawn have set up a network of spies and informants that have successfully infiltrated nearly all organizations on the planet."
D00CF654656727FC0001B526D1F120BE,Crimson Dawn District
D00CF654656728880001B529835452EC,"Canto Pass is a board game that Kay used to play as a kid. The game was invented in the Canto Bight Worker’s District and is is particularly popular with children. It involves rolling dice to collect Boons and Tricks for points while avoiding Threats and Duds to lose points. Many Canto Pass sets are handcrafted by people in the Worker’s District, with small metallic game pieces that look like regular objects, such as tools and weapons."
D00CF654656728880001B52ADBF866E8,Canto Pass
