C9E229926569FB48000056B7D2B25C72,Final research log
C9E229926569FB48000056B8A29FF2F6,"Test Unit 08-B has produced fascinating results. The garment's cobolite weave can produce a weapons amplification field 2.41m in diameter. Unfortunately, battle droids exposed to the effect become violently disoriented. Given their importance to the war effort, Command has ordered us to halt our work until peace is secured. Sadly, I must admit I agree.

Dr. Aiyah Pellorean
Research Director"
