09AEDAAA656DA7E7000223483449BB20,Smoke Bomb Compressor
09AEDAAA656DA7E700022349CDD7E387,Smugglers have delivered a shipment of smoke bomb compressors to a drop-off point in the Boulder Forest.
09AEDAAA656DA7E70002234AE5467FC6,A <b>key part</b> for making Selo Rovak's <b>Smoke Bombs</b>.
09AEDAAA656DAD14000224D201A2E805,Durafiber Fabric
09AEDAAA656DAD14000224D3716988BB,Crimson Dawn has a stockpile of durafiber fabric in one of their hideouts on Toshara.
09AEDAAA656DAD14000224D4A7E4AA5F,A <b>key part</b> for making Selo Rovak's <b>Scoundrel's Pouch</b>.
09AEDAAA656DB4CC0002251B2FFFDF83,Ion Capacitator Charge
09AEDAAA656DB4CC0002251C645A4BEF,The Empire seized a shipment of ion capacitator charges that they are now storing inside a compound in Boulder Forest.
09AEDAAA656DB4CC0002251D11976CD5,A <b>key part</b> for making Aila Bren's <b>Concussive Smoke</b>.
09AEDAAA656DB66B0002257F3CAF3B31,Code Breaker Chip
09AEDAAA656DB66B00022580C4959095,Shipjackers raided a downed merchant ship and took a valuable code breaker chip to their hideout in the Lost Steppe.
09AEDAAA656DB66B00022581966277EC,A <b>key part</b> for making Aila Bren's <b>Slice Kit Upgrade</b>.
09AEDAAA656DC278000225C71C1DC0A5,Compact Detonite
09AEDAAA656DC278000225C80170C1B4,The empire is holding confiscated Compact Detonite at Imperial Outpost 51 on Tatooine.
09AEDAAA656DC278000225C97C9F9CB3,A <b>key part</b> for making Teeka's <b>Improved Grenade</b>.
09AEDAAA656DCFBA0002260B802D9216,Burst Injector
09AEDAAA656DCFBA0002260CCCB122E2,The Jawas have set up camp on the Great Mesra Plateau. They probably have a Burst Injector in their sandcrawler.
09AEDAAA656DCFBA0002260D23AE95D0,A <b>key part</b> for making Teeka's <b>Enhanced Bacta Injector</b>.
09AEDAAA656DD4460002266F206BEB36,LC3-Skifter
09AEDAAA656DD4460002267056C74DB0,A smuggler is known to be keeping LC3-Skifters in a cliffside hideout at the edge of the Great Chott Salt Flat.
09AEDAAA656DD4460002267137F3101F,A <b>key part</b> for making Teeka's <b>Magnetic Dice</b>.
09AEDAAA656DDAE3000226B7D0A40FA3,NL-02 Charge Emitter
09AEDAAA656DDAE3000226B8D0F7DB1C,The Pykes in Stormhollow have recently received a shipment of electro-shock prods from their factory on Oba Diah.
09AEDAAA656DDAE3000226B9ABE43D50,A <b>key part</b> for making Temmin Wexley's <b>Electro-Shock Prod</b>.
09AEDAAA656DDB6B000226FBA21C3742,Flux Compressor
09AEDAAA656DDB6B000226FCEA6209A5,Rumor has it that the Empire is storing flux compressors in their compound in the Great Basin.
09AEDAAA656DDB6B000226FD6B07A604,A <b>key part</b> for making Temmin Wexley's <b>Ion Smoke Bombs</b>.
09AEDAAA656DDEF5000980646AE25B63,Susurra-Weave Fabric
09AEDAAA656DDEF500098065FFF9768A,Susurra-weave fabric is an essential part of the thieves' toolkit and can be found throughout the galaxy.
09AEDAAA656DDEF500098066FB73473A,A <b>key part</b> for making Temmin Wexley's <b>Scavenger's Footwear</b>.
09AEDAAA656DE03C00098095D1A79D27,AF-2 Cypher Key
09AEDAAA656DE03C000980961C38C3CF,A merchant hiding away on an island in the Great Basin is supposedly selling AF-2 cyphers.
09AEDAAA656DE03C000980972AF7A064,A <b>key part</b> for making MT-7's <b>Slice Kit Upgrade</b>.
09AEDAAA656DE16F0009811A6B3FD1D5,Power Injector System
09AEDAAA656DE16F0009811B398AFA1E,The Jawas on the Great Mesra Plateau will likely have a power injector system in their sandcrawler.
09AEDAAA656DE16F0009811CAFF20095,A <b>key part</b> for making MT-7's <b>Enhanced Bacta Injector</b>.
09AEDAAA656DE22F0009817157BD6E2F,Elastic Durafiber Fabric
09AEDAAA656DE22F00098172862CE5B7,<b>Tailors and merchants affiliated with the Hutt Cartel</b> have Elastic Durafiber Fabric to sell for <b>allies of the Syndicate</b>.
09AEDAAA656DE22F000981739EC73A7C,A <b>key part</b> for making Selo Rovak's <b>Outlaw's Pouch</b>.
09C272986569C867000173DC72312A5A,Beginnings
09C272986569C867000173DD6B96875B,Kay prepares to steal forged identicards from the Sixth Kin gang in Canto Bight.
09C272986569C8F2000173E318511877,Outlaws
09C272986569C8F2000173E4EE159ED0,Kay takes a job from some unknown mercenaries to break into the mansion of Zerek Besh crime lord Sliro.
09C272986569CDC9000173E9F3953A33,Crashed
09C272986569CDC9000173EAC74F393C,"Kay crashes in her stolen ship on a moon called Toshara, taking her first steps into the greater galaxy."
