09C272986569CFEC00002DABE03F5295,Kay takes the repaired Trailblazer and breaks into an Imperial fuel station.
09C272986569D0E600002DB09370E6F2,The Wreck
09C272986569D0E600002DB17982B454,Kay explores a crashed High Republic ship to retrieve a functioning nav computer.
09C272986569D15200002DB6C7438AF1,The Safecracker
09C272986569D15200002DB72EC30AD7,Kay goes to Kijimi to recruit a safecracker named Ank for her heist crew.
09C272986569D1DF00002DBC40AD0A74,Gunsmith
09C272986569D1DF00002DBD89CECEE2,Kay meets with ND-5 back on the Trailblazer to make some upgrades to her blaster.
09C272986569D2BD00002DC23ADB1084,Breakout
09C272986569D2BD00002DC391EF9B1A,Kay makes some unexpected allies and breaks into the Ashiga Clan weapons factory to rescue Ank.
09C272986569D30E00002DC84D23253E,The Hive
09C272986569D30E00002DC985692C1D,Kay makes a gambit that will impact the future of the Ashiga Clan.
09C272986569D40500002DCEDAACE731,The Heavy
09C272986569D40500002DCFE0865CC5,Kay goes to Tatooine to recruit a mercenary named Hoss for her heist crew.
09C272986569D45300002DD4B0A63CA5,Partners
09C272986569D45300002DD5B65B323D,Kay must do everything she can to rescue a loyal friend from danger.
09C272986569D48D00002DDA776D3AB1,Jabba's Favor
09C272986569D48D00002DDB0B9338A3,Kay must team up with a regretful ally to find a way out from Tatooine.
09C272986569D4D000002DE08AA5427F,The Droidsmith
09C272986569D4D000002DE1DF51D64F,Kay goes to Akiva to recruit an old partner and droidsmith named Gedeek for her heist crew.
09C272986569D51500002DE6B036A782,Viper
09C272986569D51500002DE7CB72319B,Kay must help Gedeek make amends and shut down an Imperial droid program.
09C272986569D55C00002DEC35AB6CF3,Legacy
