8FD81D516579724200038D665211D7AC,Hold the shipments
8FD81D516579724200038D67AF2AE567,"The Tosharan market is saturated. Hold off on shipments for the next two months. Meanwhile, we will store our surplus at a secured location until demand hikes up the prices. We dominate this market and our customers exclusively look to us.

- Gorak"
8FD81D516579733D0005727008323DB6,Understaffed
8FD81D516579733D0005727142934385,"Ponko, I've got a problem with the Pyke job. Looks like the issue is a broken signal compounder. I would've fixed it... but then Gorak blasted the only decent electrician left on this rock. Guess he was moonlighting for the Hutts. Anyway, can you get one of your techies to come here? Just don't tell them about the electrician, okay?"
