8F3847EB65AE309E0004EBE0C4D3F7FA,Left stick inner deadzone
8F3847EB65AE309E0004EBE1C4BAB3EC,"Adjust the size of an area in the center of the left stick where input is ignored. Lowering this value will increase responsiveness, but may cause involuntary input.

Increase this value if you experience any involuntary input."
8F3847EB65AE31F30004EBE263F6D6E3,Left stick outer deadzone
8F3847EB65AE31F30004EBE3F6F1D7E0,"Adjusts the size of an outer margin of the left stick input. Increasing this value will improve responsiveness of the controls, at the expense of precision.

Increase this value if you find it difficult to reach full running speed."
8F3847EB65AE32D50004EBE4ADC682E3,Right stick inner deadzone
8F3847EB65AE32D50004EBE5BCF26164,"Adjust the size of an area in the center of the right stick where input is ignored. Lowering this value will increase responsiveness, but may cause involuntary input.

Increase this value if you experience any involuntary input."
8F3847EB65AE33820004EBE66966F9D7,Right stick outer deadzone
8F3847EB65AE33820004EBE711506DCC,"Adjusts the size of an outer margin of the right stick input. Increasing this value will improve responsiveness of the controls, at the expense of precision.

