E52E0D4365A95C6D002998D1C1AFA431,Goal
E52E0D4365A95C6F002998D2705B684B,"In Kessel Sabacc, you invest chips to improve your hand and <b>get a pair</b> - a Sabacc hand.

To win a round, you need to have a <b>pair</b> - a Sabacc hand - <b>closest to zero.</b>

The <b>last player with chips in stock wins</b> the game and the credit pot."
E52E0D4365A95D88002998D7DC21100F,Sabacc!
E52E0D4365A95D8A002998D8DFF5E750,"You now have a <b>Sabacc hand</b>, which is a <b>pair of cards - one from each deck</b>.<br></br>The <b>closer</b> the card values are to <b>zero</b>, the <b>stronger</b> the Sabacc hand is."
E52E0D4365A95EDA002998E1092AF426,The first of many
E52E0D4365A95EDB002998E2B8787643,The galaxy is full of <b>Kessel Sabacc challenges</b>. Search for <b>Shift Tokens</b> and find <b>new Cheats by exploring the world</b>.<br></br>Refine your strategy and playstyle during your journey.
E52E0D4365A95EDC002998E37778B7D4,Better luck next time
E52E0D4365A95EDD002998E48320E0BB,The galaxy is full of <b>Kessel Sabacc challenges</b>. Search for <b>Shift Tokens</b> and find <b>new Cheats by exploring the world</b>.<br></br>Refine your strategy and playstyle during your journey.
E52E0D4365A95EE0002998E5D1A57645,"You got caught cheating, and are <b>temporarily banned from this table</b>. Come back later to challenge those opponents again."
