09AEDAAA65B11BC90003253F81A2D540,Custom hardware built by the legendary slicer herself.
09AEDAAA65B11BD800032540A20CA3C2,The most powerful tool a slicer has is the element of surprise.
09AEDAAA65B11BDD0003254197F0D29C,Why settle for standard issue when you can mod your gear?
09AEDAAA65B11BE2000325425092C3D8,Cut off the countermeasure before anyone thinks to use it.
09AEDAAA65B11BE900032543C70D145F,"The first rule of slicing is, don't get caught."
09AEDAAA65B11BEF0003254400D8ADCF,Jobs have a tendency to last longer than expected.
09AEDAAA65B11E090003254BD7E77694,Firepower is addictive.
09AEDAAA65B11E1C0003254C78E72FDB,It's good to have someone by your side out on the battlefield.
09AEDAAA65B11E250003254DBD9443DD,Nothing compares to the thrill of combat.
09AEDAAA65B11E2D0003254EC39C093E,Why run away when you can charge forward?
09AEDAAA65B11E330003254F2F23940F,Step one of winning a shootout is getting the enemy in your sights.
09AEDAAA65B12FA20003258533C671A3,The Broken Hoof gets a little rowdy sometimes.
09AEDAAA65B12FB100032586C8302252,"If you're going to be somewhere you shouldn't, at least get in quietly."
09AEDAAA65B130070003258773A7DF56,A good hustler can talk their way out of any situation.
09AEDAAA65B130140003258815E829CB,Sometimes it pays to be the center of attention.
09AEDAAA65B130190003258915A309BC,Every bartender in the South Stretch knows the value of extra protection.
09AEDAAA65B130220003258A5CC89BE8,The only way to survive on Cantonica is to make yourself useful.
09AEDAAA65B130610003258F84D89FA1,A stylish accessory that is soft against the skin.
09AEDAAA65B130A200032592F41A9712,A bold accessory that is both comfortable and eye-catching.
09AEDAAA65B1330B000325A5220020D0,"It's not cheating, it's just an undisclosed talent."
09AEDAAA65B1331E000325BF7A0AED2D,"If you can't hold a winning hand, hold a blaster instead."
09AEDAAA65B1331E000325C002F0A23A,A shrewd gambler always has an exit plan.
09AEDAAA65B1331E000325C1873B3A15,The one who draws first has the most cards at hand.
09AEDAAA65B1331E000325C2658731B4,Never overstay your welcome when you're on a hot streak.
09AEDAAA65B1331E000325C348C9DBAC,All the best plans get made in the heat of the moment.
09AEDAAA65B1339300032618A3C9E21F,Just don't ask where they found it.
09AEDAAA65B1339300032619382C58F3,You can't get firepower like this in any old store.
09AEDAAA65B133930003261A562D5B39,"No one quite knows what the Jawas put in their Bacta Vials. But whatever it is, it works."
09AEDAAA65B133930003261BED234210,There's a sucker in every deal. Why should it be you?
09AEDAAA65B133930003261C01169CB1,"If you want to fight someone twice your size, you have to get the drop on them."
09AEDAAA65B133930003261D5BA7B7A0,A Jawa can always get a better price.
09AEDAAA65B134000003264349C4481D,Classified technology which must not fall into enemy hands.
09AEDAAA65B13400000326449FE2E555,Maximizing survivability is critical for field deployments.
09AEDAAA65B1340000032645E6AD2DEE,Creative use of surrounding materials can offer a substantial tactical advantage.
