7110821465B13A86000461B5153AB4B9,"After a chance encounter with rebels, and with Sliro and the Zerek Besh syndicate on her heels, Kay has made a narrow escape in a stolen starship."
7110821465B142F2000461EF38B9C689,"On the run from Zerek Besh, Kay crash landed on the moon of Toshara, and began to build her reputation in the underworld.

Barely escaping Vail, the Zerek Besh bounty hunter, Kay seeks freedom by joining the heist of a lifetime with Jaylen Vrax, and partners up with his enforcer droid ND-5 to recruit a crew."
7110821465B143F6000461FA49BCA224,"After disrupting Crimson Dawn's plot to place Krisk at the head of the Ashiga Clan, Kay has recruited the talented safecracker and bombmaker Ank to the heist crew.

Jaylen's plan for the heist is falling into place, as is Kay's dream to steal a life-changing fortune."
7110821465B1447600046202A05D84C9,"Failing to recruit the mercenary Hoss, Kay has survived an encounter with Jabba the Hutt and his rancor by reluctantly working with the Zerek Besh bounty hunter Vail.

Even without an enforcer, Kay sticks to the plan: break into Sliro's vault with her crew and land the score of a lifetime."
7110821465B1448F000462066B86C7CE,"Kay has met up and recruited her former partner, the droidsmith Gedeek, and helped him and the rebellion shut down a dangerous Imperial droid project in a secret Imperial base.

Kay is one step closer to pulling off the heist, shaking her death mark, and landing a score that will set her and Nix up for life."
7110821465B22565001ACA396A239AE6,"On the run from Zerek Besh, Kay crash landed on the moon of Toshara, and began to build her reputation in the underworld.

Barely escaping Vail, the Zerek Besh bounty hunter, Kay seeks freedom by joining the heist of a lifetime with Jaylen Vrax, and partners up with his enforcer droid ND-5 to recruit a crew."
7110821465B225AC001ACA3B7E0DB278,"After being manipulated by Crimson Dawn to help place Krisk at the head of the Ashiga Clan, Kay has recruited the talented safecracker and bombmaker Ank to the heist crew.

Jaylen's plan for the heist is falling into place, as is Kay's dream to steal a life-changing fortune."
7110821465B22621001ACA3D1A1AED1B,"After getting roped into Crimson Dawn's plot to disrupt the Ashiga Clan, Kay has recruited the talented safecracker and bombmaker Ank to the heist crew.

Jaylen's plan for the heist is falling into place, as is Kay's dream to steal a life-changing fortune."
