7110821465B2338500018E970F333133,"Thanks for watching the cantina while I’m away. I hope Chalmun’s right about you. Just remember the house rules. Glasses broken will be deducted from your pay. No drink tabs or free drinks, no matter what anyone says. And last of all, and I can’t stress this enough: NO DROIDS.

Wuher"
