E52E0D4365B21AB800080536F68F11A4,"In Kessel Sabacc, you invest chips to improve your hand and <b>get a pair</b>, a Sabacc hand. To <b>win a round</b>, you need to <b>have the best hand</b> at the end of <b>3 turns</b>.

The <b>last player with chips in stock wins</b> the game, and the content of the <b>credits pot</b>."
E52E0D4365B22E390002166BAE21ACE0,"Hands are made of <b>2 cards</b>, one from each family — <b>Sand</b> and <b>Blood</b> — with values going from <b>1 to 6</b>.

The card value is depicted by its <b>header</b> and <b>central symbol</b>. Card header <b>display</b> can be changed in the <b>gameplay settings</b> menu.

There are <b>3 cards for each value per family</b>."
E52E0D4365B2300300021695D4E3C238,"<b>Minimize</b> your hand value, meaning the difference of your card values.

A <b>Sabacc hand</b> is a pair and has a hand value of <b>zero</b>."
E52E0D4365B2300B00021696DDF685A7,"<b>Sabacc hands</b> are <b>ranked</b> based on the <b>value of their paired cards</b>.

The <b>closer</b> the cards' values are to <b>zero</b>, the <b>stronger</b> the Sabacc hand is."
E52E0D4365B2301100021697CEB5DD3D,"When revealed, the <b>Sylop will take the value of the other card in your hand</b>, forming a pair and a Sabacc hand.

There is <b>1 Sylop per family</b>."
E52E0D4365B2301A00021698983E2CF0,"When revealed, the <b>Impostor will take the value of one of 2 dice thrown</b>, completing your hand.

There are <b>3 Impostors per family</b>."
E52E0D4365B23021000216995206CFCD,"<b>Sylop Sabacc or Impostor Sabacc</b> are <b>equivalent to a standard Sabacc hand</b> of the same value.

 A <b>pair of Sylops</b> is Pure Sabacc, the <b>best hand</b> of the game."
E52E0D4365B230270002169A3BB4A397,"Kessel Sabacc is played with <b>3 Shift Tokens</b>, which are powerful game modifiers.

A Shift Token can be played <b>once in the game</b>, and only at the beginning of your turn, <b>before Standing or Drawing</b>.

You can display the active Shift Tokens by pressing <gameaction src=""SabaccOpenShiftLog"">."
E52E0D4365B2302E0002169B5B88CDE9,"You can <b>expand your Shift Tokens deck</b> by finding <b>new tokens in the world, winning them at specific tables or buying them on the black market.</b>"
E52E0D4365B230340002169C32B833C4,"To <b>draw a card</b>, you must <b>invest 1 chip</b>.

<b>Standing</b> will <b>pass your turn for free</b>, saving chips when your hand is good enough."
E52E0D4365B2303A0002169D56A4EAF9,"You can <b>draw the top card of any deck</b> on the table, including the discard decks. After drawing a Sand or Blood card, you must discard a card from the same family, <b>always keeping one card of each family in hand</b>."
E52E0D4365B230430002169EC89253A1,"Each <b>round lasts 3 turns</b>, giving you 3 opportunities to improve your hand.
After each player has played 3 times, <b>everyone reveals their hands</b>."
E52E0D4365B230490002169FD56828DF,"<b>If every player stands</b> during a turn, <b>everyone reveals their hands</b>."
E52E0D4365B23052000216A026BD07A5,"You <b>win the round</b> if you have the <b>best hand</b> at the table. Two or more players can be winners in case of a tie.

<b>If no one has a Sabacc hand</b>, the player with <b>the lowest hand value</b> — the difference of card values — using the lowest cards <b>wins</b>."
E52E0D4365B2305A000216A1573FD2A9,"The <b>round winner</b> takes their <b>invested chips back</b> to their stock.

Without a Sabacc hand, you are <b>taxed an amount equal to the difference of your card values</b>.
With a <b>losing Sabacc hand</b>, you are taxed <b>1 chip</b>.
All <b>taxed chips</b> are <b>lost</b>."
E52E0D4365B23060000216A20D6A8CB4,"If your chips stock is empty by the end of the reveal phase, <b>you are eliminated</b> from the game.

You <b>win</b> the game upon being the <b>last player with chips in stock</b>."
E52E0D4365B23067000216A399D07316,"During your turn, you can <b>send Nix</b> to try <b>peeking at your opponents’ hand</b>.
Failing this cheat will <b>increase their suspicion</b>."
E52E0D4365B2306D000216A4579ECFA6,"You can try to <b>manipulate dice throw results</b> by using this cheat when rolling the dice.
Failing this cheat will <b>increase opponents' suspicion.</b>"
E52E0D4365B23075000216A5FE9DF566,"You can try to cheat and <b>draw 2 cards instead of one</b> from any deck, as long as there are <b>at least 2 cards in it</b>.
You can keep the <b>cheated hidden card as long as you want</b> during a game, <b>swap it</b> anytime with one in your hand, or choose to <b>double discard to get rid of it</b>.
Failing this cheat will <b>increase opponents' suspicion</b>."
E52E0D4365B2307D000216A6A7CBC92D,You can use <b>Fast-Talk</b> opportunities to <b>avoid being caught at cheating</b>.
E52E0D4365B23082000216A7BD995601,"Failing at cheating increases opponents' <b>suspicion</b>, eventually getting you <b>caught and banned from the table</b>.

You will need to <b>wait for things to calm down</b> before coming back to play at the same table."
