8F3847EB65D89A6B000655756ADE26C4,NVIDIA Reflex low latency
8F3847EB65D89A6B0006557631D06865,"NVIDIA Reflex is a technique used to reduce system latency and improves PC responsiveness.

This is automatically enabled when NVIDIA DLSS with Frame Generation is enabled.
 
<color name=""Menu Yellow"">Off:</color> Low Latency mode is disabled.
<color name=""Menu Yellow"">On:</color> Low Latency mode is now enabled and optimizes system latency.
<color name=""Menu Yellow"">On + Boost:</color> Low Latency mode is now enabled and optimizes system latency. In Boost mode, NVIDIA Reflex will save slightly more latency and attempt to optimize latency in CPU bound cases. This option can slightly decrease FPS and increase GPU power draw."
