7110821465DF016900409B3B4BE6BBDB,Special Tailoring Supplies
7110821465DF016B00409B3CB32C84A6,A few credits convinced the tailor on the Mirogana market to share some info on his supplier.
7110821465DF016C00409B3D50FC6B78,The contact can be found near Jaunta’s Hope and might have some rare tailoring supplies for sale.
7110821465DF020B00409B43E24CB1FD,Anaxes Ruffian Jacket
7110821465DF020C00409B4422FD3D1C,The merchant has an excerpt from an inventory manifest stolen from a local Crimson Dawn hideout.
7110821465DF020E00409B45F1306930,"The equipment is stashed at the marked location. Getting to it could be dangerous, but worth the risk."
7110821465DF06D200409B6458C457A4,The Importance of Gear
7110821465DF06D200409B653E59B5EF,"Some say skill is what makes a successful smuggler but let me tell you: it’s not. Having the right equipment is.

Sure, gambling is fun, but spending your credits on the right gear can be the difference between life and death.

Decent gear is available at city tailors, but syndicates hold the premium stuff. If you’ve earned their respect, they might sell to you. For the rest, they keep it heavily guarded in compounds.

From what I hear, the best gear is hidden in stashes across the galaxy. I’ve even sourced a few places nearby.

Jet Kordo"
7110821465DF06E800409B67CCAF1BEA,Upgrading the Trailblazer
7110821465DF06E800409B68B6AC0CAC,"Kay, I left you some scrap I didn’t use on the Trailblazer. You can save them for any upgrades.

Just make sure to come to me first. No one knows this ship like I do, even though there are decent mechanics in Mirogana and Jaunta's Hope. The Renpalli Station mechanics are a bit rough around the edges, but even they know how to upgrade a cannon or a shield generator.

Just don't mention my name around those people... they'll double your price out of spite.

But ask me first, ok?  

Waka"
7110821465DF072000409B6ACDE9ADF8,Scientific Expedition Report 
7110821465DF072000409B6B792D8FE4,"Our expedition to the Fallen Mound was a journey into the unknown. This mound, nestled in the heart of the steppes, is a testament to the moon's tumultuous weather. The abandoned weather station, a casualty of the mound’s collapse, stands as a stark reminder of the area’s inherent dangers.

At its heart, we discovered an artifact of significant interest – an inconspicuous piece of amberine that some believe has health-preserving properties.

Regretfully, we had to abandon the research site after some local predators attacked our encampment.

Doctor Maia Revlin"
7110821465DF074700409B6DA39D6A45,Come upgrade your speeder
7110821465DF074700409B6E239B95A3,"Kay, 

I hope you and the little one are enjoying your modified ride. 

I wanted to thank you again for your help with the wind turbines. It's been weighing me down for so long, but you really had my back there. 

If you want me to take another look at your speeder, I'm sure I can make some more upgrades to it. Just come by the workshop. You can grab any parts you need from my scrap box and just let me know what you want me to work on next.

See you around!

Selo"
7110821465DF080C00409B7008F85D6C,Scavenger’s Notes
7110821465DF080C00409B71407FD174,"Trellem,

If you're gonna make it as a scavenger here, you need to know the trade:

- Blaster parts - The Empire's hoarding most of it, so unless you can break into an Imperial compound, you're not gonna make it in that business.

- Speeder parts - The syndicates own that market. You're gonna need to make some friends or break into their territories and districts.

- Ship parts - You're never gonna beat the competition in finding a new wreck on Toshara, so either go to a pirate camp and steal it from other scavengers, or head out into space and grab it from the wrecks up there.

And for void's sake, get some new clothes. Your old farm tunic reeks of robuma. You can get tailoring supplies from the city and settlement markets.

Now take care, and don't disappoint me.

Rev Barabo"
7110821465DF083B00409B736ADB798C,Syndicate Data
7110821465DF083B00409B74A0025A86,"Kay,

Heard a rumor you're making some friends - and some enemies. That's good! Just means you're making a name for yourself.

Here's something you can use to appease the Pykes and Crimson Dawn: some high-grade information. Both syndicates want this, so just hand it over to one of their affiliated merchants and they'll put in a good word for you. Take your pick who you want to use.

And if you find more syndicate data, think twice before handing it over. Sometimes it’s better to save it for a windy day.

Come see me when you have a moment. I always have jobs that could use your skills.  

Danka"
7110821465DF087900409B7612E0A6D5,Upgrade your Ship!
7110821465DF087900409B77A346AA1C,"Being a spacer can be expensive, but cutting corners on your ship can lead to complete disaster.

My name’s Slot Plondu, and I was exploring the shipwrecks around Toshara to salvage resources when I was suddenly attacked by pirates. The deflector shields went down fast, and my basic cannons hardly put a dent in their hull. Alone and cornered, I tried to outrun them, but my sublight engine was too weak.

I went out there looking for shipwrecks, only to realize I was sitting in one myself!

Next time, I will invest in ship upgrades before venturing out in space. You can find great mechanics at affordable prices both here on Renpalli station and in Mirogana and Jaunta’s Hope.

Be an ace and get ready for space!"
7110821465DF0E6E00409B7CC918ACC6,Anaxes Ruffian Pants
7110821465DF0E7000409B7DF67643AE,A note from Jet Kordo left in the wardrobe of the Trailblazer points to some high-quality gear in a syndicate territory. 
7110821465DF0E7100409B7ED04F84BC,The gear is stashed somewhere in the Pyke Syndicate Workshop on Toshara.
7110821465DF0F2400409B8FC91D38F9,Ship Engine Specialist
7110821465DF0F2700409B909C013B18,Waka left a note about a ship engine specialist who could upgrade the Trailblazer at Renpalli station. 
7110821465DF0F2800409B91994891F2,The ship engine specialist can be found in the docking bay of the station orbiting Toshara. 
7110821465DF100800409BB2DC750081,Mysterious Charm
7110821465DF100A00409BB3627410EA,A scientific expedition report hints at the presence of a rare artifact in the ruins of an abandoned weather station. 
7110821465DF100C00409BB402EAE790,The artifact is located in the abandoned weather station deep inside the Fallen Mound.
