5EA540EF65E58684000000CF0BD3169C,"Use Stun Shot for a silent, non-lethal takedown against humanoids (ineffective against droids).
Activate or deactivate Stun Shot mode with <gameaction src=""ToggleStun"">.
Once fired, Stun Shot must recharge before it can be used again.
Stealth takedowns or melee finishers increases Stun Shot recharge speed."
5EA540EF65E5874E000000D0A23CB52B,"Select the ion module by using <gameaction src=""WeaponModules_SlotModule2""> to unleash ionized attacks.
Ionized attacks make humanoids vulnerable to takedown and are very effective against droids and shields."
5EA540EF65E58835000000D23FD5255B,"The power module is effective against groups of enemies as well as vulnerable walls. Select the power module using <gameaction src=""WeaponModules_SlotModule3"">."
5EA540EF65E588C4000000D7B8523FE2,"Select grenades with <gameaction src=""GrenadeHoldQuick"">.
Throw it with <gameaction src=""ThrowableThrowPress"">."
5EA540EF65E5898E000000D9697C6BC9,"Equip the holotracker with <gameaction src=""HoloReaderHoldQuick"">.

The holotracker has two operating modes: it first displays landscape holomaps <b>indicating marked locations to reach</b>. Upon reaching marked locations, <b>visual and audio cues can be aligned</b> to the correct frequency to discover hidden vaults.

That last operating mode is triggered automatically near <b>Smuggler Caches</b>, leading you to their locations."
5EA540EF65E58AD9000000DB3A89DD91,"Use <gameaction src=""SmokeGrenadeUseQuick""> to create a temporary smoke screen to escape from a sticky situation."
5EA540EF65E58B9D000000EA2C207A53,"Select a Blaster module with <gameaction src=""WeaponModules_SlotModule1"">.
Use <gameaction src=""Shoot""> to fire the blaster, even when moving, or take aim with <gameaction src=""Aim""> and fire <gameaction src=""Shoot""> to gain more precision. Keep in mind that regular plasma shots are less effective against shields and droids."
