842ECCE465F4143C00053C839A67D3A5,"Gedeek's work with the Empire has come to haunt him, as a new type of Viper droid is wreaking havoc on the jungles of Akiva. Kay and Gedeek must break into an Imperial base called Kassina Outpost and shut down the project once and for all."
842ECCE465F4144100053C8B80E3B0B7,Krisk is colluding with Qi'ra from Crimson Dawn to take down the Queen and lay claim of the Ashiga Clan throne. They have given Kay access to Ank in the Ashiga Clan weapons factory in exchange for her help with the coup.
