6AE6EE0D660C020A000000FE194CB2DD,"A listening device used by Crimson Dawn that was planted in the cantina.

The data on this listening device is valuable for the syndicates."
6AE6EE0D660C026400000109B8464134,A mechanical device that controls droid movement.
6AE6EE0D660C029B00000110F0811019,"A datapad used by Captain Covell to track Crimson Dawn activities.

Gorak in Makal’s Gambling Parlor will be interested in it."
6AE6EE0D660C02E300000119B746C5BC,A black market shuttle ticket from Toshara to Tatooine.
6AE6EE0D660C04DE0000012687FD5AB7,"A paddy frog on fompa bread that Jinnjo Blorgh requested for his journey.

Jinnjo is hiding out in Jaunta’s Hope on Toshara."
6AE6EE0D660C057D0000012F2897DD84,"Koje's droid still doesn't believe that his master has vanished.

The droid is waiting outside Chalmun's Cantina."
6AE6EE0D660C0605000001384A2F709A,Planting the recording device in the bookmaker's office could reveal if the Hutts are fixing races.
6AE6EE0D660C066800000141C877D20B,"A top-shelf bottle of spotchka stolen off a gambler in Chalmun's Cantina.

It could be sold for a decent profit."
6AE6EE0D660C06EB0000014AE5B2DACB,"A small collection of stolen Tosharan charms.

Their owner is waiting in Makal's Gambling Parlor."
6AE6EE0D660C077E000001531208993B,"A droid moisture farmer hopes the parts will get the Hutts off their case.

Showing the tax collector the parts might convince them that the droid has been dealt with."
6AE6EE0D660C07CC0000015E02DE3968,"Nutrient packets used by the Melitto to provide sustenance.

Ashiga Clan scouts are waiting for them on Toshara and Akiva."
6AE6EE0D660C08E1000001678CB48A80,"Information gathered by the Ashiga Clan to assess the potential for expansion on Akiva.

An Ashiga Clan scout is waiting on Kijimi for the report."
6AE6EE0D660C09DE000001700C97F26D,"Information gathered by the Ashiga Clan to assess the potential for expansion on Toshara.

An Ashiga Clan scout is waiting on Kijimi for the report."
6AE6EE0D660C0AA900000179BE0376F8,The amulet's insignia represents a smuggling group called the Spice Runner's of Kijimi.
6AE6EE0D660C0C7D00000180F0CF94D6,"A list containing all of the Ashiga Clan's weapons exports and their buyers.

Eleera is waiting for the shipping records on Toshara."
