8F3847EB66389E04001E6B8400FFDF60,NVIDIA RTX Direct Lighting
8F3847EB66389E04001E6B855436F24D,"Toggle high quality dynamic raytraced direct lighting.

Direct lighting is implemented using NVIDIA RTX™ Dynamic Illumination (RTXDI) SDK, which figures out the most important light samples in a scene and renders them physically accurate.

RTXDI requires more VRAM. We recommend a GeForce RTX 4070 (or equivalent) or higher GPU."
