93D3086566548B250004471CBD1889AF,ATTENTION MAINTENANCE STAFF
93D3086566548B250004471D3AC4078D,"I would like to know how six primary turbines managed to fail at the same time. I received one hundred and seven reported cases of ruptured eardrums, all in one morning. Pick three of you. I don't care how. They will be cleaning excreta from the fans with very small brushes.

Your Facility Administrator."
