C9E229926658ABE6000448E8093698BE,Message from Crimson Dawn
C9E229926658ABE6000448E960D2604A,"Lady Qi'ra is very intrigued by your offer. If you can indeed secure the item, we will finance your buy-in to the tournament, and you can consider your debts to the Dawn cancelled. Someone from room service will come by with the hand-off details."
C9E229926658AD4B000448FC33DA0F89,The Target's Appearance
C9E229926658AD4D000448FD6EBCE952,"The human goes by the name Zana Gatta. She changes her look many times a cycle, but she was seen with white hair at the Slag Pit only days ago, so I figure that's how she'll roll up to the tournament.

Her debt to the cartel could buy ten sleemos like you, so if you find her, don't let her out of your sight."
