C9E22992665F1A2A00162E2C9EBDDE7F,Your Orders
C9E22992665F1A2D00162E2D95A915F9,"Here are your orders: PROTECT THE EGG, PROTECT THE EGG, and PROTECT THE EGG. As a Pyke, that is your ONLY duty. The buyer wants an intact Verillian Egg, not a smashed pile of crystal or an empty case.

Choja will be making the actual sale during the final round. All YOU need to do is get it into her hands before then. That means no distractions. Save the lugjacks for later.

I can't imagine why Chrephontis has entrusted you with this, but try not to let him down for once."
