225CF627666722E20006A3C80404E9CE,The Masked Gambler's Here
225CF627666722E20006A3C930C08FE7,"Can you believe it? <b>Rauvin Vashiri</b> was out there playing Sabacc on the floor. She's even more incredible in person. 

It's funny, she was <b>looking around all the time</b>. Wonder what that was about. Guess it's just part of the mystery."
225CF627666723380006A3CB8BA5B5B4,Keep An Eye Out For Mosh
225CF627666723380006A3CC937EEC02,"That <b>Rodian</b> has lots of tricks up her sleeve. When she <b>scratches her forehead</b>, she's trying to free up her hand to double draw or palm some mag dice. Don't let her get one over on you."
40173C9B66431530000484B36EDCD7CE,"<font preset=""{1}"">Final upgrades </font><font preset=""{0}"">require unique </font><font preset=""{1}"">key parts</font><font preset=""{0}"">. Where to find those will be added to the </font><font preset=""{1}"">Journal.</font>"
40173C9B664321B200048514C876BB82,SYNDICATE-AFFILIATED MERCHANTS
40173C9B6667F8D1000125216CD2E73C,"<font preset=""{1}"">Materials</font><font preset=""{0}""> needed for these upgrades are available for purchase from </font><font preset=""{1}"">merchants</font><font preset=""{0}""> or can be collected in </font><font preset=""{1}"">pirate territories</font><font preset=""{0}""> and </font><font preset=""{1}"">space.</font>"
40173C9B6667F98F0001254DB9420ACA,"<font preset=""{1}"">Blaster configuration </font><font preset=""{0}"">key parts are awarded by </font><font preset=""{1}"">special individuals </font><font preset=""{0}"">met during Kay's </font><font preset=""{1}"">journey.</font>"
40173C9B6667FA0A0001255C2BA9F857,"<font preset=""{0}"">Other </font><font preset=""{1}"">materials </font><font preset=""{0}"">needed to</font><font preset=""{1}""> upgrade </font><font preset=""{0}"">the blaster can be purchased from </font><font preset=""{1}"">merchants, </font><font preset=""{0}"">stolen from </font><font preset=""{1}"">Imperial compounds, </font><font preset=""{0}"">or found in concealed </font><font preset=""{1}"">smuggler caches.</font>"
40173C9B6667FA7B0001256C181DDD3B,"<font preset=""{0}"">Unique</font> <font preset=""{1}"">key parts</font><font preset=""{0}""> are required to build </font><font preset=""{1}"">powerful new blaster configurations.</font>"
40173C9B6667FB09000125845487B83F,"<font preset=""{0}"">Syndicate-affiliated merchants also reserve their </font><font preset=""{1}"">best stock </font><font preset=""{0}"">for trusted partners. Kay can access their VIP stock with a good or better </font><font preset=""{1}"">reputation.</font>"
40173C9B6667FB8B00012598D4B0B37A,"<font preset=""{0}"">Some merchants will </font><font preset=""{1}"">request</font><font preset=""{0}""> specific goods in exchange for useful items.</font>"
40173C9B6667FC17000125ABCF5BEC01,"<font preset=""{0}"">With syndicate-affiliated merchants,</font> <font preset=""{1}"">reputation matters.</font><font preset=""{0}""> Goods will be</font> <font preset=""{1}"">more or less expensive</font> <font preset=""{0}"">depending on Kay’s reputation.</font>"
40173C9B6667FC86000125BE2FDC4E5D,"<font preset=""{0}"">Merchants will </font><font preset=""{1}"">buy</font><font preset=""{0}""> Kay’s surplus goods, including stolen</font><font preset=""{1}""> valuables</font><font preset=""{0}"">, at rates that are not affected by her reputation.</font>"
40173C9B6667FE26000125E1CC21E287,"<font preset=""{0}"">Kay can give sensitive </font><font preset=""{1}"">data discs</font><font preset=""{0}""> to syndicate-affiliated merchants to improve her </font><font preset=""{1}"">reputation.</font>"
40173C9B6667FEB5000125F331A16ECF,"<font preset=""{0}"">The required </font><font preset=""{1}"">materials</font><font preset=""{0}""> can be purchased from </font><font preset=""{1}"">merchants</font><font preset=""{0}""> or found in syndicate-controlled areas, such as </font><font preset=""{1}"">districts and territories.</font>"
40173C9B6667FFB8000126052D2B5770,"<font preset=""{1}"">Ship Mechanics</font><font preset=""{0}""> have the skills to</font><font preset=""{1}""> improve and personalize</font><font preset=""{0}""> the Trailblazer for a price.</font>"
