2AE2EC856672A02D0017AF27B1A747BC,"The Ashiga Clan have a long history of making fine blasters, using high quality components that are difficult to find. They take pride in sharing equipment with their best partners."
2AE2EC856672A2D6001A660CCEDFFC89,A bundle containing materials to <b>upgrade the Speeder.</b>
2AE2EC856672A2DB001A73F92A074204,Crimson Dawn has agents across the galaxy who need to be prepared to drop everything in a moment and make a hasty escape. They understand the value of a fast and reliable speeder.
2AE2EC856672A2FB001AC904862C5C21,The Hutt Cartel are involved with gunrunners and arms dealers across the Outer Rim and have access to some of the most powerful hardware available.
2AE2EC856672A2FF001AD3FD962B3982,A bundle containing materials to <b>upgrade the Blaster.</b>
2AE2EC856672A33A001B6EA2151F3FDE,The Pyke Syndicate relies on skilled pilots with ships that can smuggle goods through the most challenging systems. They have access to some of the best ship parts on the market.
2AE2EC856672AC10001E2CF508B0DAF6,A bundle containing materials to <b>upgrade the Blaster.</b>
