C9E22992667D2291000B4E68FACFE5D6,Advice for Brayzak
C9E22992667D2291000B4E693CD3E3FD,"A message with some last minute coaching for Brayzak, revealing that he clears his throat whenever he cheats."
C9E22992667D23D4000B4E6BEEB79553,Maintenance Report
C9E22992667D23D4000B4E6C318AB7C1,A report about the broken luggage conveyor on board the Morenia.
C9E22992667D26FE000B4EDCD1C8507F,Dispatch From Security Unit A-477
C9E22992667D26FE000B4EDDAC8BEED5,"As instructed, we have observed the Quarren <b>Ultus</b> at the Sabacc tables. Behavior analysis reveals that he is indeed a habitual cheater. Keep a close watch when he starts <b>playing with his chips</b>. That is him trying to draw your attention while he palms a card with his other hand."
C9E22992667D27CB000B4F13B130B3BB,Last Minute Advice
C9E22992667D27CB000B4F14006CBB5F,"You are a good player, <b>Brayzak</b>. But you need to watch your tells. You <b>clear your throat</b> when you get nervous. It makes it obvious when you are bending the rules.

They will be watching you back on Oba Diah."
C9E22992667D27F1000B4F32F088FA06,Maintenance Report
C9E22992667D27F1000B4F33815D11E5,"This is L6-2O, reporting on the status of the luggage conveyor. The main motivator has abruptly halted, causing a rupture in the lateral clamps.

This will be a complex repair. Restarting the conveyor with the materials we have on board will not be possible, and authentic replacement parts for the Morenia were exclusively manufactured at the now bankrupt Gallofree Yards. 

We will have to source an after-market luggage solution. I recommend a stop at Boonta after the conclusion of the tournament."
