C9E2299266B0DC8D00027310B16EF741,"To pull off Thorden's job, Kay needs to investigate Renpalli Station for info on the legendary casino cruiser Morenia."
C9E2299266B0DC8D00027312E138999F,An exclusive Sabacc tournament is being held on the casino cruiser Morenia. Someone in the cantina might know something about it.
C9E2299266B0DC8D000273136AE609B1,Suspicious Broker
C9E2299266B0DC8D00027314ACF42F53,"To pull off Thorden's job, Kay needs to investigate Renpalli Station for info on the legendary casino cruiser Morenia."
C9E2299266B0DC8D00027316106AEFA7,"According to rumors in the cantina, the broker is skimming off the top of Thorden's operation. He might give up more info if confronted."
C9E2299266B0DC8D000273174A9BC79A,Hangar Bay
C9E2299266B0DC8D000273184718F72D,"To pull off Thorden's job, Kay needs to investigate Renpalli Station for info on the legendary casino cruiser Morenia."
C9E2299266B0DC8D0002731AEEFA7A69,"A droid from the Morenia is in the station on a supply run, and could be followed back to the casino cruiser. Someone in the hangar bay might know how to identify his shuttle."
