C9E2299266B0FC14000000D50EF70CE0,Head Engineer's Datapad
C9E2299266B0FC14000000D6991C567E,"To pull off Thorden's job, Kay needs to investigate Renpalli Station for info on the legendary casino cruiser Morenia."
C9E2299266B0FC14000000D8DEC2526C,The station's head engineer sold illegal hyperfuel to the droid from the Morenia. Her datapad might have info on the supply shuttle.
C9E2299266B0FE94000000E2C98B0DCE,Shuttle Model
C9E2299266B0FE94000000E39E20DA4A,"To pull off Thorden's job, Kay needs to investigate Renpalli Station for info on the legendary casino cruiser Morenia."
C9E2299266B0FE94000000E5E5346AB1,"According to a hangar worker, the Morenia's shuttle is in the refueling bay. Someone else in the hangar bay might be able to identify its model."
D00CF65466B1FB930002515FB9B3D069,"Kay has taught Nix how to <b>plant cards on other players and frame them as cheaters</b>, which could help her win the tournament.
To pull off the scam, Kay has to <b>perform a double draw and hold onto the extra card</b>. On her next turn, she can <b>send Nix to plant the extra card</b> on any of the other players.
Anyone framed as a cheater will be <b>kicked out of the game</b> by EY-E9."
D00CF65466B1FB930002516064D0EDED,Card Plant
D00CF65466B219E900030AB97721A022,"The hovercam targets a new player every turn, preventing them from cheating."
D00CF65466B219E900030ABA8A983761,Hovercam
D00CF65466B2289E00032B658D5E2D11,Governor Thorden
D00CF65466B2289F00032B66DE157E9C,"Thorden has served as the Imperial Governor of Toshara since the Empire first established its outpost on the moon. Expecting the position to be a springboard for an impressive career, Thorden was stupefied when the Empire pulled back on support for the moon. Since then, Thorden has mingled with crime syndicates and smugglers, building an empire of his own."
D00CF65466B2298F00032B673FB7D440,EY-E9
D00CF65466B2298F00032B6810F282D9,"EY-E9 is a protocol droid who was tasked by the Morenia's original captain to increase their profit margins. Taking an optimal approach, EY got rid of the captain and helmed the Morenia herself, turning the ship into a lucrative underworld casino. Since then, EY has been an untouchable icon whose charm, grace and keen business sense has drawn some of the best Sabacc players in the galaxy."
D00CF65466B22A0700032B6C1CD81ED3,Aksali Noll
D00CF65466B22A0700032B6DB057B5B0,"Aksali Noll is the ambitious leader of a Tosharan scrap gang known as the Starfallers. As a young woman, Aksali turned on her family of simple scavengers, selling her services to the Empire to learn from their ruthless tactics. As a result, the Starfallers became some of the most dangerous bandits on Toshara."
D00CF65466B22AAF00032B6ECA0ED10D,The Morenia
D00CF65466B22AB000032B6F97F17100,"The Morenia is an underworld casino cruiser that regularly hosts exclusive high-stakes Sabacc tournaments. With guest lists of criminal royalty and prize pools worth more than some Outer Rim systems, the Morenia is always on the move, staying in hyperspace as much as possible to avoid pirates and Imperial patrols."
D00CF65466B22BC000032B72FACE3A24,Thorden's Personal Bunker
D00CF65466B22BC100032B73E6AB2D0C,"Preparing for the day the Empire might fall, Thorden has prepared a personal bunker to give himself a leg up in the chaos that would follow. Based in the Mirogana spaceport, Thorden's bunker has all of the resources he would need to stay in power, including bacta, coaxium, weapons and credits."
1657B1AA66B327F5000DDBF85934AD60,Starfaller Assault
