C9E2299266B4E725000478C60B7DF266,Shuttle Bay
C9E2299266B4E725000478C72FA93701,"To pull off Thorden's job, Kay needs to investigate Renpalli Station for info on the legendary casino cruiser Morenia."
C9E2299266B4E725000478C8B6DDA2EE,"According to the head engineer's datapad, the Morenia's shuttle is a ZH-40. Someone else in the hangar bay might be able to identify where it's docked."
D00CF65466B477A200031DAC6AC3D734,Formal Attire Enclosed
D00CF65466B477A200031DADC8BF268F,"Dear Passenger,

Please find within your complimentary outfit for the evening. There is no dress code on board the Morenia, but proper attire is strongly encouraged at casino events.

Morenia Guest Services"
