75B1D5B366EAC3D0000BEB84B8FE69C9,"Your opponents might cheat during the tournament. If you've previously <b>gathered intel</b> on their cheating techniques, you can seize the opportunity to <b>expose them during the game</b>."
75B1D5B366EAEC09001147FCB93D8451,"On your turn, you can <b>send Nix</b> to <b>frame an opponent as a cheater and get them kicked out of the game</b>.
