255244526728DD1D0000010D08F60585,Rapid Recovery Systems
255244526728DD240000010EDB7211E1,A hyper-efficient self-cooling system developed by Anzellan mechanics on the frigid world of Kijimi.
255244526728EA750000014C5FB414EF,Shield Booster
255244526728EA770000014D16A4BCF8,"Increases the density of shield ray patterns, boosting the ability of the deflector to scatter incoming energy attacks."
255244526728EAA90000014E0C28D437,Improved Launchers
255244526728EAAB0000014FC2B000C8,"Manufactured by Alliance techs, these powerful launchers are often stolen by pirates looking to boost their firepower."
255244526728EB38000001632E3616C6,Efficient Heatsinks
255244526728EB3A00000164838B0464,This ion-flux cooling system is copied from military-grade hardware developed for TIE fighters.
255244526728EB4B00000165222CE733,Precision Optics
255244526728EB4D00000166BBA1B628,"Originally developed for deep space research, this crystalline macrobinocular lens is perfect for observing distant galaxies - and picking out weak spots in enemy hulls."
255244526728EB620000016725BF07BC,Reactive Heatsinks
255244526728EB6300000168FECC8F4B,"A compact version of the type employed in capital class reactors, this dynamic heat-dispersal system actively detects and dissipates dangerous heat build-ups."
255244526728EB7B00000169BB9CFADE,Adaptive Generators
255244526728EB7C0000016A0D3A0B73,Experimental technology capable of collecting energy from exploding reactors and channeling it to power internal systems.
255244526728EB980000016BD0656F8F,Emergency Thrusters
255244526728EB990000016C4A49141F,These thrusters come with defensive micro-chaff launchers to disrupt missile guidance systems.
255244526728EBAE0000016D165F5D82,Kinetic Capacitors
255244526728EBB00000016ECBE3ADA9,This rare Outer Rim technology harnesses the momentum from ship maneuvers to boost the velocity of cannon rounds like a sling.
255244526728EBC40000016F3001BA4D,Flux Capacitor Connectors
255244526728EBC50000017032EAB9BE,"Adapted from astro-mech heat exchangers, this system collects and redirects thermal energy to increase the effectiveness of ship-borne cannons."
255244526728EDE60000018135033134,Enriched Coolant
255244526728EDE80000018252435963,"Developed by the Empire, use of this cutting-edge coolant mix is restricted to the Imperial military. Of course, that doesn't stop pirates from stealing it."
255244526728EDFE00000183268BCE26,Supercharged Ions
255244526728EDFF00000184478A2BC0,A deadly Rokana innovation that channels ambient ionic energy into offensive ion systems. Outlawed by the Empire.
255244526728EE1C000001856B2C3894,Turbocharged Servos
255244526728EE1E0000018623ECFCD3,"In a technique pioneered on the ice world of Hoth, alternating streams of fuel and coolant are directly injected into flight machinery."
255244526728EE54000001875B6EFC76,Reinforced Coils
255244526728EE56000001884DAC08F0,"Modified by pirates to help survive the corrosive effect of the Sayma nebula, these durasteel coils constantly funnel low levels of energy to repair systems."
255244526728EE6E00000189474E7149,Redirecting Manifolds
255244526728EE6F0000018A03001717,"This Trade League technology diverts emergency power away from deflector arrays, channeling it all to hull repair systems for the protection of valuable cargo."
255244526728EE830000018B2FA1D64D,Over-Clocked Fire Control
255244526728EE840000018C0267B0C1,"Every pirate knows the most important shots in a fight are the first and the last, so they jury-rig their turret systems to fire faster and for longer."
255244526728F68700043CB99FE3EB92,Increases <b>Shield</b> capacity and recovery.
