B5AC84E76710D2EF0005D0BC879A3523,Digger's Charm
D00CF654672DD9470002CFB097B97C09,"The Rokana Raiders is a band of pirates that emerged during the Galactic Civil War. Under the leadership of the young and ruthless Stinger Tash, the raiders follow a code of collective decision making where all important issues are put to a vote."
D00CF654672DD9470002CFB1D3B7C077,Rokana Raiders
D00CF654672DDBAE0002CFB97058EE1A,"Hondo Ohnaka chose this ruined settlement for the Ohnaka gang because of its isolated location in the Dune Sea. When the Imperials on Tatooine got suspicious, Ohnaka and his crew abandoned their 'oasis in the desert' and moved on. A good pirate never stays in one place for long."
D00CF654672DDBAE0002CFBAD784A454,Ohnaka Hideout
D00CF654672DDC670002CFBD243FC810,"Once a prosperous mining station, Hauler's Keep is now controlled by the Miyuki Trade League. The facility also has the distinction of being the sole trading hub and refueling port in the Khepi System. Hauler's Keep is home to scrappers, smugglers, and syndicate agents alike, all looking to find their fortune in Wild Space."
D00CF654672DDC670002CFBEB7256462,Hauler's Keep
D00CF654672DDCB70002CFC2F1760A73,"The Khepi were an ancient and mysterious civilization. When their homeworld was destroyed, all they left behind was this magnificent tomb. Built into an asteroid drifting through the Sayma nebula, this necropolis is rumored to contain a priceless treasure."
D00CF654672DDCB70002CFC387A3E36F,Khepi Tomb
D00CF654672DDD140002CFC7A728E2CB,"The Sayma nebula is a vast nebula in Wild Space with a maelstrom of ionized gas that reaches into the Khepi system. Pirates and fortune-seekers have been exploring the dangerous nebula for years, searching for the hidden Khepi tomb, which is rumored to be filled with immense treasure. Many have made the journey, but no one has ever come back."
D00CF654672DDD140002CFC868669E16,Sayma Nebula
D00CF654672DDDE00002CFD0E492F357,"Stinger Tash is the captain of the Rokana Raiders pirate gang who climbed up the ranks by being smarter and more ambitious than her peers. Leading according to the egalitarian Rokana Code, Stinger insists on giving everyone on the crew a voice, even though she can usually get things done her way in the end. Lately, she has become obsessed with the stories of the fallen Khepi civilization, and the promise of immense power and wealth hidden within their final resting place."
D00CF654672DDDE00002CFD14C876E0F,Stinger Tash
D00CF654672DDEB00002CFD5D04D7D3C,"Hondo Ohnaka is a notorious pirate with a career that goes back to the Clone Wars. Hondo was the captain and leader of the Ohnaka Gang, but a series of bad choices and unfortunate circumstances left the old pirate alone and without a crew. An incurable optimist, Hondo is still on the lookout for the next big adventure that will continue his self-professed legend."
D00CF654672DDEB00002CFD667F310F3,Hondo Ohnaka
D00CF654672DDFF3000160784415A3F8,"The Khepi System is a resource-rich region of Wild Space. Once home to a mysterious civilization known as the Khepi, it now teems with treasure seekers, scrappers, and pirates."
D00CF654672DE0570001607B5166575C,Khepi System
D00CF654672DE18E0001608517E7D82B,"Khepi was a prosperous world that remained outside the Republic since its formation. Organized under a rigid theocratic system, the Khepi accepted their demise when their world was destroyed in a cataclysmic event. While their remains and culture were moved into a tomb hidden deep within the Sayma nebula, the Khepi system became a site for mining aurodium and roxodium."
D00CF654672DE18E00016086C89045B9,Khepi
