49D82446673B669D00008BED29805000,Frame generation
49D82446673B669D00008BEE9400393C,"Select to enable frame generation, a technique that analyzes the visual output from the game and generates additional frames from them, which results in higher framerate.

<color name=""Menu Yellow"">Off:</color> Turns DLSS Frame Generation off
<color name=""Menu Yellow"">2x:</color> The total number of frames is doubled, with one rendered and one generated frame.
<color name=""Menu Yellow"">3x:</color> The total number of frames is tripled, with one rendered and two generated frames.
<color name=""Menu Yellow"">4x:</color> The total number of frames is quadrupled, with one rendered and three generated frames."
49D82446673B672800008BF5D93B2154,Off
