ACAEF5AB6746EFE6000CDA916DCE1FB4,"ND-5! Didn't expect to hear from you again old man, but a debt’s a debt so here's what I know:

Admiral Gallia Kryder is Alderaanian and survived the purge by transferring her command to the edge of Wild Space. She's set up a nice little network for herself and runs it all from her flagship, the Reviler. So stay on her good side or the fleet might show up for bombardment practice."
