8FD81D51676155E8002E9ADB66054592,Report on Piracy
8FD81D51676155E8002E9ADCCDE91809,"Pirate activity is increasing sharply. Of particular concern is one ""Captain Qorvino"", who has been terrorizing Imperial shipping lanes from his cave hideout in the Myrran backcountry. See attached coordinates.

Other pirates at large include ""Silver-fin Bollas"", the ""Dread Triplets"", and the notorious ""Big Muhh"". Clearly the satraps have been negligent in their duty to keep the Akiva system free from brigandry and safe for Imperial commerce."
8FD81D51676185D9004395F5D09AC19A,Look for clues
8FD81D51676186190043962CDE13C5AF,From Your Old Captain
8FD81D51676186190043962D39DA5189,"Knew you couldn't stay away, Hel. You'll never lose that itch in your trigger finger.

The blasted map didn't do me much good, but maybe you'll have a better shot at it. If you can pull it from my bony grip, that is.

I'll be waiting for you under the three palms. Make your old man proud.

Qorvino"
