A84C6BC867862E190004E464B7838EA3,"The Khepi protected their final resting place by installing numerous droids throughout the tomb. Constructed with the same roxodium alloys as the tomb itself, the droids are made to last for thousands of years until the Sayma nebula eventually collapses into a proton star."
A84C6BC867862E190004E46575558DCD,Khepi Guardian Droids
