49CE584F6787BAE20032124DFF7F14B9,Sorry and Goodbye
49CE584F6787BAE20032124E0716F589,"Dearest Hella,

If you're worried about Qorvino, don't be. He's at the island safe house. Old gugg-head might even pull through. Co-ords attached, if you're ever in the mood to forgive him.

In the end, you were right to leave. The map was more trouble than it was worth. I'm heading back to Champala. Won't be the life we used to dream about, but it'll at least be a fresh start. 

Yours always – even if you're not mine,
Maj Aba"
