49CE584F678A2357000255E690592F56,"Kay,

I recovered this deleted data from what you transmitted from Stinger's terminal in the tomb.

- ND-5

//DELETED ENTRY//

Khepi Chronicles p. 215

With all of this evidence in mind, everything points to one answer. The Khepi built sentry droids using the same roxodium alloys as the tomb itself. As such, they had guardians that would last for thousands of years until the Sayma Nebula eventually collapses into a proton star.

Jopeem, Molo. Khepi Chronicles. 7963"
