ACAEF5AB67A219CF0005CB8EFEC05970,Don't go in there
ACAEF5AB67A219CF0005CB8F514DC2E3,"It's no good, Adden. Forget about the stash. I tried to get the keycard from Scrapper but I couldn't get its panels open. And now that they cut the lights, I can't even find the doshing droid anymore! It's all dusty and strange, this place. And the sound... Something's off here, lad.

Let's go back to the tavern and forget our losses. Better not to mess with this place."
