7490699B67A4727A00021FB286973C5B,Rokana Raider
A84C6BC867A47D59000000E01042AD49,"Rokana ships have the ability to switch their configuration from Recon mode, which emphasizes maneuverability, to Assault mode, which packs more punch with more powerful lasers and access to ion torpedoes."
A84C6BC867A47D59000000E1E63A6EA1,Rokana Assault Configuration
8FD81D5167A1D1C5004736A3FF413EDC,Treasure Hunter's Journal
8FD81D5167A1D1C5004736A4B8F83790,"Arrived on the island today. Seems like it really was a pirate hideout, but from the looks of things it was stripped clean years back. The locals have the usual stories: ghost ships, dead captains, even some talk of a buried treasure map. But all I can find are a bunch of old ruins. 

One more dead end in a long line of them. At this rate I'd have more luck looking for At Attin."
8FD81D5167A235A400476C5B0D5A1A48,Your Orders
8FD81D5167A235A400476C5CE6A785CD,"You're going to find that map. Dig up every fern, dredge every bog, and knock over every ruin. And for jhut's sake, don't let yourself get ambushed again! You're not the only ones after the Khepi hoard."
