38252D2167B6DFA20004E356A3C1143F,More Droid Trouble
38252D2167B6DFA20004E357479D125A,"I don't know what caused it, but something's gotten into those droids. Yesterday, Scrapper swiped the keycard to the forge. Tried to force it open but there's no tool small enough. I guess I could have just blasted the junky astromech, but Adden would have had a fit."
