A84C6BC867BC2CFD00043E5E5E78BA33,Congratulations
A84C6BC867BC2CFD00043E5F9BDD0E23,You are now on your way to pulling off one of the greatest heists the outer rim has ever seen.
A84C6BC867BC2CFD00043E604869E6E4,"You still have {0} remaining of the demo should you wish to continue discovering what Tatooine has to offer. Make your way to Mos Eisley to pick up contracts, try your hand at a few games of Kessel Sabacc, venture out beyond the city limits to uncover the many opportunities within the open world, or even jump back into the pilot seat and explore the dangers of Tatoo space."
A84C6BC867BC340F000444E4F7F98574,Thank you
A84C6BC867BC340F000444E5FA8E42F4,We hope you enjoyed your time with the Star Wars Outlaws Demo.
A84C6BC867BC340F000444E693C33D19,"Purchase the game now to access the full experience. Fight, steal, and outwit your way through the galaxy's crime syndicates as you join the most wanted."
A84C6BC867BC3AE6000447732E6D98BB,"Experience the first-ever open world Star Wars™ game and explore distinct locations across the galaxy, both iconic and new. Risk it all as scoundrel Kay Vess, seeking freedom and the means to start a new life."
A84C6BC867BC3AE600044774B627CC63,"With the Star Wars Outlaws Gold Edition, get access to the base game and the season pass including:"
A84C6BC867BC3AE600044775C0BE7D10,"Get access to the base game, the Season Pass, four cosmetic bundles, and a digital art book* with the Star Wars Outlaws Ultimate Edition."
A84C6BC867BC501D0004478DD65C43F6,BASE GAME<br><br>The Season Pass:<br>STAR WARS OUTLAWS: WILD CARD STORY PACK<br>STAR WARS OUTLAWS: A PIRATE'S FORTUNE STORY PACK<br>JABBA'S GAMBIT EXCLUSIVE MISSION<br>THE KESSEL RUNNER CHARACTER PACK<br>THE HUNTER'S LEGACY BUNDLE<br>THE CARTEL RONIN BUNDLE<br>
A84C6BC867BC636100044795A9C3FFD2,Plus the Ultimate Pack:<br>THE SABACC SHARK BUNDLE<br>THE ROGUE INFILTRATTOR BUNDLE<br>TWO ADDITIONAL BUNDLES*<br>And access to a DIGITAL ART BOOK**
A84C6BC867BC63F40004479E0A0C853A,*available upon the release of the second story pack
A84C6BC867BC6404000447A063C0F173,**access the digital art book from the official Star Wars Outlaws website: starwarsoutlaws.com/digital-art-book
466625AB67BC75DF001875B5D0E81058,You have been noticed by the ship
91D5D54267BCA146000000DC9D53FE8B,Account Closure Notice
91D5D54267BCA146000000DD714691D4,"All League brokers are to close the accounts of Capt. Stinger Tash. We have received reliable reports that she has expired. Her outstanding debts will be extracted from the Rokana Raiders - well, those she didn't zero out with nebula gas. I tried to warn them that the nebula would get them in the end.

Reess Passik"
91D5D54267BCA18D000000E2A3D34FDE,Get The Crew Together
91D5D54267BCA18D000000E33F762C0B,"Got my hands on a Rokana Raider last night. He said Stinger's dead, along with most of the crew. I smell opportunity. I made him give up the co-ordinates to their hidden asteroid base - it's time we upgraded our digs.

Grox Smallhands"
DA5615DD67BC8EC90009B6549D116C66,Mentor
9FCEAC4967BD97670002328D8AF80E79,Details
381EA52767BDCBF40008529F8906E2F7,"Ohnaka Dreams, Entry 72"
381EA52767BDCBF4000852A00C772834,"...When I heard that sorry excuse for a crew mentioning the Khepi - the treasure I, as we all know, have sought for cycles - I simply had to see it for myself. Cleverly announcing my presence and generously offering my services, those raiders snapped me up and tossed me into a cell.

Unfortunately for them - this was all part of my calculated plan. With my communication devices cleverly hidden on my person (a measure any good pirate takes) I called my allies to me and prepared to strike!"
381EA52767BDD800000E038956C7E3D4,Raiding a Tomb...
381EA52767BDD800000E038A536E2278,"This all feels wrong. I became a raider to even the score – to rob the beings that had too much, that deserved it. Not to... show up to this ancient place and disturb whatever's been laid to rest here.

When I come up here alone – I can hear strange sounds in the walls. Whirring. Humming. I don't believe in ghosts, but I know something doesn't want us here..."
381EA52767BDD974000E038CCC31375D,Investigations Ongoing
381EA52767BDD974000E038DB014CD2D,"Good news! Our attempts to open these weird crates all over the tomb have proven, once again, to be a total waste of time!

I don't know how many times I've said THEY DO NOT OPEN, but hey, I'll say it again! They're a bunch of worthless old junk left behind by the Khepi. Now can we get back to shooting down ships and stealing from rich Imperials?? Please??"
381EA52767BDDADA000E09CFC3D55692,Generator Maintanence Datapad
381EA52767BDDADA000E09D0CB246032,"General report so I don't get yelled at again:

This generator is ANCIENT. It's filtering something from the nebula and turning it into energy – I kind of get how it works, but I can't control it.  

If we overclock it, it seems like the nebula gas could flood outside the mechanism, so let's be... extra careful."
381EA52767BDDB8A000E09D33B5FB76D,Grav Lock Orders
381EA52767BDDB8A000E09D4420F31E6,"Any commandeered ships are to be locked down immediately – I don't need another one of you claiming you thought a ship was ""up for grabs"" and slamming into an asteroid.

- Stinger"
381EA52767BDDBD6000E09D7C1AE64C1,REMINDER
381EA52767BDDBD6000E09D87D75BD7A,"Bring all stolen gear to the forge for redistribution. Stinger says that it's not a free-for-all anymore. Once it's sorted, you'll get what you need and we'll scrap the rest."
2552445267BF2A710002E68A49952ECC,Prevents the use of other <b>Pick-Up Weapons</b> when equipped.
9128788867BEDF56000A29AD1861C16F,Old Bab's Diary
9128788867BEDF56000A29AEBF406AFA,"Third night in the brig. At night, when the guards clear out and it's as quiet as the void, I swear I can hear something moving under the rock.

Is it a monster? The tomb getting pulled apart by the nebula's gravity? Or maybe those old tavern-dogs were on to something and the Khepi droids are real after all.

This treasure is dangerous. I know it. Stinger might doom us all."
9128788867BEEA60000A2A8554599A35,To The Security Crew
9128788867BEEA60000A2A869919C343,"Listen, I know this tomb is starting to get to you. You're worried about curses, about the blackouts, about Stinger. And you're not wrong. But if we're going to survive this, we need to stick together.

Stay the course and follow my lead. If it comes down to it, and we need to do something about the captain, I'll be the first to let you know.

Ace Sunspinner"
