380B9A3967EFED860006F761656AF218,Adjusts how much left stick and right stick movement is required to register input.
380B9A3967EFEE520006F7626FDDC411,Left stick inner deadzone
380B9A3967EFEE520006F7635CB1C436,"Adjust the size of an area in the center of the left stick where input is ignored. Lowering this value will increase responsiveness, but may cause involuntary input.

Increase this value if you experience any involuntary input."
380B9A3967EFEE520006F76411060B16,Left stick outer deadzone
380B9A3967EFEE520006F765D851A37D,"Adjusts the size of an outer margin of the left stick input. Increasing this value will improve responsiveness of the controls, at the expense of precision.

Increase this value if you find it difficult to reach full running speed."
380B9A3967EFEE520006F766592D092A,Right stick inner deadzone
380B9A3967EFEE520006F7678B6FE64D,"Adjust the size of an area in the center of the right stick where input is ignored. Lowering this value will increase responsiveness, but may cause involuntary input.

Increase this value if you experience any involuntary input."
380B9A3967EFEE520006F768AA10128D,Right stick outer deadzone
380B9A3967EFEE520006F769FF0F06F9,"Adjusts the size of an outer margin of the right stick input. Increasing this value will improve responsiveness of the controls, at the expense of precision.

Increase this value if you find it difficult to reach full running speed."
