380B9A3967F5328C0003E02901919DAE,The slicing kit reveals glyph groups and give you access to Slicing tricks.
380B9A3967F5328C0003E02ACE110335,KAY CAN NOW SEE BLUE TRACKS CONNECTING SOME GLYPHS TOGETHER.
380B9A3967F5328C0003E02BB4B96E91,There's up to only one valid glyph per connected group. (But a group can have zero glyphs.)
