<color name=""Menu Yellow"">2x:</color> Frame generation is enabled and will generate an extra frame to increase FPS by up to 2x
<color name=""Menu Yellow"">3x:</color> Frame generation is enabled and will generate two extra frames to increase FPS by up to 3x
<color name=""Menu Yellow"">4x:</color> Frame generation is enabled and will generate three extra frames to increase FPS by up to 4x"
